### 🏡 #4 Stunning 60m² Apartment in Ba Dinh - 16.0M VND/month
📍 **Location:** Ba Dinh, Hanoi  
💰 **Price:** 16,000,000 VND/month (≈ $653)  
📏 **Size:** 60m²  
✨ **Style:** Cozy Traditional  

This beautiful 60m² apartment in Ba Dinh offers a cozy traditional style with modern minimalist influences, making it a charming option for those who appreciate a bit of character in their living space. At 16.0M VND/month, this apartment provides a unique blend of comfort and style. 

Your day might start with a peaceful breakfast on the balcony, enjoying the lush greenery of the neighborhood. The cozy atmosphere is perfect for family gatherings or simply unwinding after a long day. You can set up a cozy work nook in the living area, surrounded by tasteful decor that inspires creativity.

Ba Dinh is rich with history and culture, so taking evening strolls to visit the **Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum** or enjoy local cuisine at **Cha Ca La Vong** will add a unique charm to your lifestyle. This property is perfect for culture enthusiasts who want a warm, homely atmosphere while living in a vibrant, historical district. 🏛️🌿

