reenery. Sip your morning coffee in serene comfort and let the calming minimalist design wrap you in tranquility. As natural light floods your stylish workspace, productivity flows effortlessly, setting you up for success. This effortlessly chic studio is more than just a home; it’s your personal sanctuary where stress melts away and Instagram-worthy moments await. Elevate your lifestyle in this unique haven—your dream life is just a heartbeat away!","highlights":["Modern","Cozy","Luxury","Neutral","Warm","Cool","Working","Reading","Relaxing"],"images":["https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1759158110292.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1759158111295.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1759158111960.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1759158112590.jpg"],"matchScore":100,"matchReason":"11.3M under budget. in 56 Street. has tv but no balcony, sofa","realtor_id":"734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e","isExternal":false,"source":null,"sourceUrl":null},{"id":"1af1658a-2bdf-4874-b01a-e19e5441d956","title":"Bright & Chic Urban Retreat in the Heart of District 2","location":"District 2, Ho Chi Minh City","price":7200000,"size":"25m²","vibe":"Modern","description":"Step into this stylish 25m² gem in District 2, where modern living meets affordable elegance at just 7,200,000 VND per month. Experience the warmth of abundant natural light pouring through large windows, creating an inviting atmosphere that feels both spacious and airy. The contemporary kitchen dazzles with sleek wood cabinetry paired with a striking black countertop, making it not only practical but a pleasure to cook and gather in.\n\nUnwind in your private sanctuary – a spa-like bathroom adorned with high-quality finishes that exude luxury and comfort. This tranquil space invites relaxation after a long day. The bedroom is thoughtfully designed with built-in storage solutions that maximize functionality while maintaining a stylish aesthetic, ensuring your space remains organized and clutter-free.\n\nPerfectly positioned in a vibrant urban setting, this apartment is ideal for those seeking a chic lifestyle without the hefty price tag. Embrace the balance of comfort and sophistication in your new home – where every detail has been curated for modern living.","highlights":["Modern","Cozy","Luxury","Neutral","Warm","Cool","Working","Reading","Relaxing"],"images":["https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756819973494.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756819974796.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756819975793.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756819976600.jpg"],"matchScore":100,"matchReason":"12.8M under budget. in District 2. no balcony, sofa, tv","realtor_id":"734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e","isExternal":false,"source":null,"sourceUrl":null},{"id":"3b0ef408-3051-4c8c-bd7a-df2f4c6ad330","title":"Elevate Your Living: Chic 30m² Retreat in Ho Chi Minh City’s District 2","location":"District 2, Ho Chi Minh City","price":6500000,"size":"30m²","vibe":"Modern","description":"Discover the perfect blend of comfort and style in this 30m² urban sanctuary located in the vibrant District 2 of Ho Chi Minh City. This rental offers extensive built-in storage solutions, cleverly designed to maximize your space while maintaining a sleek, organized aesthetic. The warm wood finishes throughout the room create a cozy atmosphere, inviting you to unwind after a busy day in the city.\n\nAdmire the thoughtfully crafted built-in cabinetry that not only provides ample storage but also enhances the modern, minimalist vibe of the space. Each detail reflects a commitment to functionality without sacrificing elegance. The highlight of this apartment is the stylish wooden floating desk, perfect for those who need a dedicated workspace or love to create in an inspiring environment. \n\nWith a monthly rent of just 6,500,000 VND, this chic retreat offers an affordable lifestyle solution without compromising on modern conveniences. Embrace the ease of urban living while enjoying the comfortable, refined surroundings of your new home. Don’t miss out on this opportunity to elevate your living experience!","highlights":["Modern","Cozy","Urban","Neutral","Warm","White","Working","Relaxing","Entertaining"],"images":["https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756822089912.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756822090767.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756822091210.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756822091908.jpg"],"matchScore":100,"matchReason":"13.5M under budget. in District 2. no balcony, sofa, tv","realtor_id":"734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e","isExternal":false,"source":null,"sourceUrl":null},{"id":"82ac1e31-2d49-45ef-94df-b0c078ac734b","title":"Stylish Urban Oasis in District 2: Cozy & Bright Studio","location":"District 2, Ho Chi Minh City","price":7200000,"size":"35m²","vibe":"Modern","description":"Discover your perfect retreat in this charming studio apartment located in the vibrant heart of District 2, Ho Chi Minh City. Spanning 35m², this modern oasis features a sophisticated open-plan layout that seamlessly merges living and dining areas, creating a spacious feel. Bask in the abundant natural light that floods through the large floor-to-ceiling sliding windows, leading to a delightful balcony where you can enjoy your morning coffee or unwind after a long day. The warm wooden panel accents on the ceiling add a touch of elegance, while the soothing aqua walls create a calming ambiance throughout. The thoughtfully designed furniture includes a plush mustard yellow couch, a low-profile bed with a stylish pink bedspread, and a minimalist wooden desk that enhances the studio’s chic aesthetic. Perfect for busy professionals or students, this rental offers convenience and comfort at an affordable price. Experience urban living at its finest, with trendy cafes and local shops just a short stroll away.","highlights":["Modern","Cozy","Urban","Neutral","Warm","Cool","Working","Reading","Relaxing"],"images":["https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756616551719.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756616552436.jpg","https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/property-images/734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e/1756616553142.jpg"],"matchScore":100,"matchReason":"12.8M under budget. in District 2. has tv but no balcony, sofa","realtor_id":"734bd05c-a381-4267-b823-88a84c79a40e","isExternal":false,"source":null,"sourceUrl":null}],"summary":"I found 5 properties in Ho Chi Minh City under 20M VND/month.","totalMatches":5}', '{}', '2026-01-02 05:16:55.063497+00'),
