":8,"urban":6,"modern":7,"elegant":8,"spacious":5,"luxurious":5,"minimalist":9,"natural_light":7},"image_highlight":"Inviting personal sanctuary with natural light","detailed_analysis":"This bedroom exudes a serene, minimalist vibe with a focus on comfort and tranquility. The queen bed, adorned with soft linens, invites restful nights, while the wooden nightstand complements the light wood flooring, enhancing the room''s warmth. A piece of artwork adds a touch of color, subtly uplifting the space. Large windows allow natural light to flood in, making the room feel airy and bright, perfect for relaxation or quiet reading. The layout promotes a sense of peace, creating a personal sanctuary for rejuvenation.","suggested_amenities":["Natural Light","Queen Bed"],"suggested_activities":["Resting","Reading"]}]},"rooms":"1 Bedroom","property_source_link":"https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131531307.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]","sourceProviderName":"Huyền Ngân","sourceProviderPhone":"093812 ***","matchScore":100,"matchReason":"6.5M under budget, has pool, gym, cozy style","realtor_id":"ext-nhatot","isExternal":true,"source":"nhatot","sourceUrl":"https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131531307.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]"},{"id":"5f8ba82e-9d9f-45df-8369-eab2e80a7cad","title":"TOP 44000 Units in April Starting from 4.5 Million VND - BEST PRICE - STUDIO/1BR/2BR/3BR - VINHOMES GRAND PARK","location":"Vinhomes Grand Park, Phường Long Thạnh Mỹ, Quận 9, Hồ Chí Minh","price":4500000,"size":"30 m²","vibe":"Modern, Elegant, Cozy","description":"Discover your ideal home at Vinhomes Grand Park with Thành Kiên Land! We offer a vast selection of over 44,000 apartments for rent, ranging from Studios to 3-bedroom units, all at the best prices and highest quality standards. Our dedicated team of 50 sales professionals is available 24/7 to assist you in finding the perfect apartment that matches your preferences, budget, and quality expectations.\n\nEnjoy complimentary services including assistance with temporary residence registration, ensuring a hassle-free move. We help negotiate the best rental prices with landlords and provide transparent legal support with detailed contracts directly from the owner. We also assist with registering parking passes, resident cards, and accessing all the fantastic amenities Vinhomes has to offer.\n\nOur commitment extends throughout your tenancy, providing ongoing support for any issues that may arise. Rental prices vary based on the apartment type and furnishing:\n\nStudio apartments start from 4.5 million VND/month (unfurnished), 5 million VND/month (with kitchen and curtains), and 5.5 - 6.5 million VND/month (fully furnished).\n1-bedroom units start from 5.5 million VND/month (unfurnished), 6 million VND/month (with kitchen and curtains), and 6.5 - 7.5 million VND/month (fully furnished).\n2-bedroom units start from 6 million VND/month (unfurnished), 6.5 million VND/month (with kitchen and curtains), and 7 - 8 million VND/month (fully furnished).\n3-bedroom units start from 7.5 million VND/month (unfurnished), 8 - 9 million VND/month (with kitchen and curtains), and 9 - 12 million VND/month (fully furnished).\n\nAdditional costs include management fees (8,800đ - 15,800đ/m²/month as per Vinhomes regulations), electricity and water at state-regulated prices, and parking fees (150k/month for motorbikes, 1,250k/month for cars).","highlights":["Sleek kitchen island with stylish seating","Eclectic display cabinet with vibrant collectibles","Stunning chandelier illuminating the stylish living area","Vibrant collectibles showcasing unique personal style","Inviting dining area with natural light"],"images":["https://file4.batdongsan.com.vn/resize/1275x717/2026/03/12/20260312164907-90af_wm.jpg","https://file4.batdongsan.com.vn/resize/1275x717/2026/03/12/20260312164907-5593_wm.jpg","https://file4.batdongsan.com.vn/resize/1275x717/2026/03/12/202603121649