	('654fee40-ad34-4ba2-9792-7d533eda1805', 'nt131675433', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/131675433.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Superb Studio Apartment in Binh Thanh Center - Fully Furnished', 'Đường Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh, Phường 25, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng x vit ngh tnh phng 25 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 6600000, '6,6 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover this superb studio apartment located right in the heart of Binh Thanh District. This spacious 40 m² unit offers a wonderfully airy and cool living environment, thanks to its large windows. The apartment comes fully equipped with all necessary furniture and amenities, ensuring a comfortable and convenient lifestyle from day one. Its prime location provides easy access to numerous universities and local markets, making it ideal for students or professionals seeking a vibrant neighborhood with essential services close at hand. Experience the perfect blend of comfort and convenience in this well-appointed studio.', '{"Inviting natural light with elegant window seating","Elegant entryway with contemporary design elements","Inviting reading nook with natural light","Seamless open-plan living and dining space","Sophisticated dining space with elegant lighting"}', '{"Service apartment","Mini apartment","Fully furnished","Large windows","Near universities","Near markets"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131675433/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131675433/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131675433/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131675433/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131675433/4.