	('49ff6642-7ead-43e6-ab28-d1cf596f7f34', 'nt130843759', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/130843759.htm', 'Luxury Fully Furnished Apartment for Rent in District 7', 'Phan Khiêm Ích Street, Tân Phong Ward, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City', 'phan khim ch street tn phong ward district 7 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 9500000, '9.5 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'This luxurious 1-bedroom serviced apartment in District 7 offers a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. The apartment is fully furnished with modern amenities, including a private washing machine and dryer. Located in a quiet building with few units, it ensures a peaceful living environment. The building features an elevator and spacious parking. The area is known for its high standard of living, with easy access to educational institutions such as Ton Duc Thang University and RMIT University, as well as shopping centers like Lotte Mart and Eco Green. Enjoy the convenience of quick transportation to Districts 1, 4, 5, and 8. Contact us for a free consultation and to schedule a viewing.', '{"Functional open layout with natural light","Efficient multi-use space with integrated laundry","Stylish entertainment center with built-in storage","Chic study nook with integrated lighting","Functional dining area with natural light"}', '{"Fully Furnished","Washing Machine",Dryer,Elevator,"Spacious Parking","High Security"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130843759/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130843759/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130843759/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130843759/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt13