	('d8a7ed29-0eb3-4b9d-a2aa-2f020acd7de0', 'nt131259967', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/131259967.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Newly Furnished 2 Bedroom Apartment for Rent in MT Eastmark City', 'Trường Lưu, Phường Long Trường, Thành phố Thủ Đức, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'trng lu phng long trng thnh ph th c tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 5000000, '5 triệu/tháng', '60 m²', 'This newly furnished 2-bedroom apartment is located in the MT Eastmark City project in Thủ Đức City, Ho Chi Minh City. With a generous area of 60 m², the apartment features a modern design with one bedroom plus an additional room that can be used as a study or guest room. The apartment is fully furnished, allowing you to move in immediately without any hassle. The property is equipped with essential amenities such as a swimming pool, gym, sports field, supermarket, and kindergarten, making it ideal for families. Its strategic location offers easy access to District 2 and the city center, with a travel time of approximately 25 minutes. Enjoy a comfortable lifestyle in a vibrant community with all the conveniences at your doorstep.', '{"Abundant natural light illuminating the space","Sleek modern kitchen with ample storage","Inviting balcony with stunning views","Resort-style poolside oasis for relaxation","Scenic riverside park with illuminated pathways"}', '{"Swimming Pool",Gym,"Sports Field",Supermarket,Kindergarten,"Air Conditioning","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures","Wood Flooring","Large Window",Door,"Kitchen Sink","Kitchen Cabinets",Countertop,Stove,"Wall-mounted Lighting","Refrigerator Space",Backsplash,Balcony,"Large Windows",Wall,"Lounge Chairs","Palm Trees",Pathways,"Outdoor Lighting","Landscaped Gardens","Park-like green space","Waterfront view","Outdoor lighting","Walking paths","Outdoor seating areas"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-imag