	('0a2e3e5d-9c26-4f09-b906-ec4b39248abe', 'nt131480594', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-ba-trung-ha-noi/131480594.htm', 'Stunning 30m² Fully Furnished Apartment for Rent in Hai Ba Trung', 'Ngõ Chùa Hưng Ký, Phường Minh Khai, Quận Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội', 'ng cha hng k phng minh khai qun hai b trng h ni', 'hanoi', 5700000, '5.7 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'This stunning 30m² apartment is located in the vibrant Hai Ba Trung district of Hanoi, offering a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Fully furnished with high-end amenities, this apartment features a private washing machine, a balcony, and a modern kitchen equipped with an induction stove and a range hood. The living space is designed for both relaxation and functionality, making it ideal for students or professionals. Situated close to several universities, including Eastern University and National Economics University, this apartment is perfect for those seeking a lively neighborhood with easy access to educational institutions. The rental price is 5.7 million VND per month, with additional service charges for utilities. Don''t miss out on this opportunity to live in a well-equipped, stylish apartment in one of Hanoi''s most sought-after areas.', '{"Inviting workspace with abundant natural light","Bright, inspiring workspace with urban views","Versatile workspace with integrated storage solutions","Functional kitchen with sleek cabinetry and modern appliances","Efficient workspace with integrated storage solutions"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Balcony,Refrigerator,"Induction Stove","Range Hood",Bed,Wardrobe,Mattress,Desk,Chair,Plants,Cabinets,"Large Windows","Work Desk","Natural Light","Storage Cabinets","Indoor Plants","Indoor Plant","Built-in Cabinets","Kitchen Sink","Dining Table","Plant Decor","Wall-mounted Shelves","Storage Cabinet",Workspace}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131480594/0.