	('0089a39d-960c-405a-95b3-2dc83e5f8823', 'nt77327998', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/77327998.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Chic Urban Retreat in The Manor with City Views', '91, Đường Nguyễn Hữu Cảnh, Phường 22, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '91 ng nguyn hu cnh phng 22 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 12000000, '12 triệu/tháng', '36 m²', 'Welcome to your chic urban retreat at The Manor, where modern design meets comfort. This stylish studio apartment is bathed in natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The open layout seamlessly integrates the living area, bedroom, and kitchen, making it perfect for both relaxation and entertaining. Imagine sipping your morning coffee while enjoying stunning views of the city skyline or Landmark 81 from your window. The contemporary decor features a soothing color palette with sleek finishes, ensuring a tranquil living experience. With high-quality furnishings and thoughtful details, this space is designed for those who appreciate a sophisticated lifestyle. The amenities of The Manor enhance your living experience with a swimming pool, gym, and various dining options just steps away. Whether you''re hosting friends or enjoying a quiet evening, this apartment is the perfect backdrop for your daily rituals.', '{"Light-colored sofa with decorative cushions","Light-colored bedding with matching decorative pillows","Compact kitchen with modern appliances and cabinetry","Charming chandelier with multiple light bulbs","White shelving unit with decorative items and books"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Parking,Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera",sofa,table,chairs,bed,artwork,blinds,Wi-Fi,"Air conditioning",desk,chair,shelves,window,Desk,Bookshelf,"kitchen appliances","storage cabinets",Dishwasher,Microwave,windows,chandelier,television,"shelving unit","decorative items",Television,Storage}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.s