	('53da5d78-0708-48d9-bfc1-22ef4d4d7a5e', 'nt131475667', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-ba-dinh-ha-noi/131475667.htm', 'New 1 Bedroom Service Apartment for Rent in Kim Ma, Ba Dinh', '535 Kim Ma, Giang Vo Ward, Ba Dinh District, Hanoi', '535 kim ma giang vo ward ba dinh district hanoi', 'hanoi', 26300000, '26.3 million/month', '85 m²', 'This newly designed 1-bedroom service apartment is located in the prestigious Sumitomo building on Kim Ma street, offering a spacious area of 85 m². Ideal for Japanese and foreign clients, the apartment features modern decor and is equipped with essential amenities including an air purifier, dehumidifier, bathtub, 130L water heater, washer-dryer, and automatic toilet. The rental price of 26.3 million VND per month includes various services such as internet, Japanese television with 16 channels, weekly cleaning and laundry service, security, and water usage. The location is prime, situated opposite Daewoo and Lotte, and is within walking distance to Ngoc Khanh Lake and Thule Lake, making it perfect for exercise and leisure. Nearby, you will find Tomibun supermarket and Omosan Japanese restaurant, as well as the Japanese embassy and RMIT University, all within a short walking distance.', '{"Inviting dining area with modern decor","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes","Bright and inviting living area with natural ambiance","Bright and modern living space with cozy seating","Natural light-filled living space with greenery views"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Dryer,Bathtub,"Water Heater",Security,"Cleaning Service","Laundry Service"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131475667/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131475667/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131475667/2.jpg,https: