	('465091e7-9731-4b6b-96fc-2220c31909d4', 'nt131926686', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-cau-giay-ha-noi/131926686.htm', 'Charming Fully-Furnished Studio in the Heart of Cầu Giấy', 'Phố Trung Kính, Phường Trung Hoà, Quận Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội', 'ph trung knh phng trung ho qun cu giy h ni', 'hanoi', 4800000, '4,8 triệu/tháng', '25m²', 'Step into this charming fully-furnished studio, where modern comfort meets a cozy atmosphere. Bathed in natural light, the space features a harmonious blend of soft hues and contemporary furnishings, creating a serene retreat in the bustling Cầu Giấy district. The open layout is perfect for morning rituals, whether it''s enjoying a cup of coffee at the breakfast bar or setting up a cozy nook for remote work. With a fully equipped kitchen, including a refrigerator and a private washing machine, daily living is made effortless. The thoughtful design ensures that every corner feels inviting, making it an ideal space for hosting friends or unwinding after a long day. Experience the perfect balance of style and functionality in this delightful studio.', '{"Stylish wooden staircase leading to elevated area","Compact kitchen with sleek cabinetry and modern finishes","Bright natural light streaming through large window","Open layout connecting kitchen and living space seamlessly","Built-in wardrobe providing efficient storage solutions"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Elevator}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131926686/0.jpg,https://cdn.chotot.com/PG9ODsoGI7T0wpDOX-9I8FGicdAYZTmJE7-tnNOniC4/preset:view/plain/2af35ea9fa60213bd1634a7bfe3c7aa8-2980652114969204226.jpg,https://cdn.chotot.com/zHEYAGRLDTmeP-RBCzw600ZHv9Wt5YQG8w9Ak0jlM_s/preset:view/plain/5f7f655bc5569568cc0d991fa1fcd4c3-2980652116831540738.jpg,https://cdn.chotot.com/7G9B-P4DKc4QutiYdJk2i2kpjUtycbDqJ87CaoUKreE/preset:view/plain/d4a2b2846e7c55b8606afbc224cf5e15-2980652117469140