	('6591e783-7f7a-4a50-aff9-3697a2d1b801', 'nt131669935', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131669935.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'CHARMINGTON Q10 SHORT & LONG-TERM RENTAL SYSTEM - 12M VND, READY FOR IMMEDIATE OCCUPANCY', 'Số 181, Cao Thắng, Phường 12, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 181 cao thng phng 12 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 12000000, '12 triệu/tháng', '32 m²', 'Discover a fantastic rental opportunity at Charmington La Pointe in District 10, Ho Chi Minh City. This listing offers a 32 m² officetel apartment, perfect for both short and long-term stays, available immediately for 12 million VND per month. The unit comes fully furnished with beautiful interiors, ensuring a comfortable and convenient living experience. 

