	('88b47518-ca3c-4533-8e24-ee3e2e3d6b99', 'pr45426006', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-grand-park-phuong-tang-nhon-phu-tp-ho-chi-minh/gio-hang-cho-q9-nhieu-gia-tot-gan-hon-2000-ho-pr45426006', 'Affordable Studio Apartment for Rent in Vinhomes Grand Park, District 9', 'Vinhomes Grand Park, Tang Nhon Phu Ward, District 9, Ho Chi Minh City', 'vinhomes grand park tang nhon phu ward district 9 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 4500000, '4.5 triệu/tháng', '34 m²', 'Discover a fantastic opportunity to rent a studio apartment in the prestigious Vinhomes Grand Park, located in District 9 of Ho Chi Minh City. This well-maintained studio spans 34 square meters and is available for just 4.5 million VND per month. The apartment is part of a vibrant community that offers a range of amenities including a 36-hectare park, resort-style swimming pools, BBQ areas, sports facilities, and a gym. Residents can enjoy convenient access to Vincom Mega Mall, supermarkets, cafes, and restaurants within the complex. The area is well-connected with easy access to major roads, making commuting to District 1, Binh Thanh, and Thu Duc a breeze. With 24/7 security and a clean, civilized living environment, this studio is perfect for long-term living. Don''t miss out on this great deal!', '{"Sleek, modern kitchen with elegant finishes","Chic dining space for intimate gatherings","Stylish built-in shelving unit for organization","Versatile dining area for work or leisure"}', '{"Swimming Pool","BBQ Area","Sports Facilities","Outdoor Gym","24/7 Security","Green Park"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45426006/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45426006/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45426006/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.