g stylish vertical lines. A neatly made bed with a green quilt and two decorative pillows adds a cozy touch. The minimalist nightstand holds a small plant, enhancing the room''s natural feel. An air conditioning unit is mounted above, ensuring comfort. The overall color scheme is calming, with neutral tones complemented by the greenery.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air conditioning", "Nightstand"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["sofa", "coffee table", "plants", "large window", "mirror"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 8}, "image_highlight": "Large mirror reflecting light and space", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a modern living area with a large mirror that enhances the sense of space and light. A comfortable sofa is paired with a stylish coffee table, while greenery adds a refreshing touch. The large window allows for ample natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere. The overall design is minimalist, emphasizing clean lines and functionality, suitable for both relaxation and entertaining guests.", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "Smart TV"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Entertaining"]}, {"amenities": ["Air conditioning", "Sofa", "Coffee table", "Plant", "Storage unit"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 8}, "image_highlight": "Large window with a view of greenery outside", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a modern living area featuring a large window that provides ample natural light and a view of greenery outside. A stylish sofa and coffee table create a cozy seating arrangement, while a potted plant adds a touch of nature. The minimalist design is complemented by a sleek storage unit, enhancing the overall aesthetic of the space.", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony",