	('abf7c5a1-9c21-45e6-a17a-2f5c8a348390', 'nt131974034', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131974034.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Modern Studio in Tranquil Quận 7', 'Đường Trần Xuân Soạn, Phường Tân Hưng, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng trn xun son phng tn hng qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7500000, '7,5 triệu/tháng', '20 m²', 'Step into this charming modern studio that perfectly balances comfort and style in the heart of Quận 7. With a spacious layout of 20 m², this studio is bathed in natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The contemporary design features sleek furnishings and a neutral color palette, accented by pops of color that bring life to the space. Imagine sipping your morning coffee in the cozy nook by the window or hosting friends for a casual dinner in the open living area. The fully equipped kitchen, complete with modern appliances, makes meal preparation a delight. High-speed WiFi ensures you can work from home seamlessly, while the air conditioning keeps the space cool and comfortable. Located in a quiet and secure neighborhood, this studio is ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat while still being close to the vibrant city life. Whether you''re a busy professional or a student, this studio offers the perfect blend of functionality and style for your daily rituals.', '{"Bright turquoise wall complements natural light from window.","Sleek black countertop contrasts with white cabinetry.","Cozy corner with a chair and view of the city.","Open layout enhances space with minimalistic design.","Natural light highlights the clean, simple decor."}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine","Full Furnishings","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131974034/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external