	('e59d0902-44fe-4cbd-bd31-52a923716aa3', 'nt117814247', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/117814247.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxury 2-Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Hà Đô Centrosa Garden, District 10', '200, 12, Ward 12, District 10, Ho Chi Minh City', '200 12 ward 12 district 10 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 23000000, '23 million/month', '86 m²', 'Welcome to this stunning 2-bedroom apartment located in the prestigious Hà Đô Centrosa Garden in District 10, Ho Chi Minh City. Spanning 86 square meters, this fully furnished apartment offers a luxurious living experience with modern amenities and stylish decor. The spacious layout includes two well-appointed bedrooms, each designed for comfort and relaxation. The apartment features a contemporary kitchen, a cozy living area, and two bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals seeking a comfortable home. Residents can enjoy a range of exceptional facilities, including a rooftop swimming pool, a fully equipped gym, BBQ areas, and lush green gardens. With easy access to shopping centers, restaurants, and public transport, this apartment is perfect for those looking for convenience and luxury in the heart of the city.', '{"Elegant chandelier illuminating chic living space","Chic dining area for upscale gatherings","Serene personal retreat with elegant decor","Elegant sanctuary with natural light and chic decor","Sophisticated dining area for elegant gatherings"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Gym,"Swimming Pool","BBQ Area","Community Room",Library,Parking,Elevator,Security,"Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt117814247/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt117814247/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-