	('c09d9dd0-390b-4a68-b565-3bdea9d889bd', 'nt131914779', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131914779.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Chic Urban Retreat in Vinhomes Golden River with Stunning Views', '2 Tôn Đức Thắng, Phường Bến Nghé, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '2 tn c thng phng bn ngh qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 22000000, '22 triệu/tháng', '53 m²', 'Step into a chic urban retreat in the heart of Vinhomes Golden River, where modern design meets comfort. This stylish 1-bedroom apartment boasts a generous 53 m² of living space, flooded with natural light that dances across the sleek surfaces. The open layout is perfect for morning rituals, whether you''re sipping coffee on the balcony or working from home with a view of the city skyline. The interior features a harmonious blend of contemporary aesthetics with warm textures, creating a cozy yet sophisticated atmosphere. The full furnishings ensure you can move in and start enjoying life immediately, while the airy ambiance invites relaxation after a busy day. With a prime location in Quận 1, you’re just steps away from vibrant city life, making this the ideal home for those who appreciate both style and convenience.', '{"Chic living area with modern furnishings","Stylish seating area with natural light","Sleek, fully equipped culinary creativity hub","Sleek spa-like bathroom retreat"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera",Sofa,"Coffee Table",Television,"Dining Table",Curtains,"Wall Decor",Chandelier,"Large Windows",Refrigerator,Oven,Stove,"Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,"Kitchen Appliances","Modern Kitchen",Shower,Toilet,Sink,Mirror,"Storage Cabinet","Luxury Bathroom","Modern Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131914779/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131914779/1.jpg,https://gbgrwj