	('55278f7f-8f6f-47c9-960c-18d1c60e3c4e', 'nt131684784', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/131684784.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '2-Bedroom Apartment 50m2 for Rent in Cityland Park Hills, Gò Vấp', '18, Phan Văn Trị, Phường 10, Quận Gò Vấp, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '18 phan vn tr phng 10 qun g vp tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 9500000, '9,5 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Discover this charming 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment for rent in the prestigious Cityland Park Hills residential area. Located at 18 Phan Van Tri, Ward 10, Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City, this 50m² apartment offers a comfortable and modern living space. The unit comes fully furnished with high-end interiors, ensuring a hassle-free move-in experience. Enjoy the convenience of a private washing machine, windows for natural light, and a balcony perfect for relaxation. The apartment features two bedrooms and one living room, providing ample space for individuals or small families. Situated within the Cityland Park Hills project, residents benefit from a well-planned urban area with excellent amenities and a vibrant community. The deposit required is 19,000,000 VND. Don''t miss this opportunity to live in a sought-after location with all the comforts you need.', '{"Bright and airy kitchen with modern finishes","Private balcony with garden space and views","Bright open layout with ample natural light","Integrated laundry facilities for effortless living","Integrated laundry space for effortless living"}', '{"Service apartment, mini apartment","50 m² area","2 bedrooms","1 bathroom","High-end interior","Deposit: 19,000,000 VND","Full furniture","Private washing machine",Windows,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Refrigerator,"Kitchen Cabinets","Kitchen Countertop","Window Treatments","Lighting Fixtures",Planters,"Outdoor Space",View,"Large Windows","Modern Lighting","Kitchen Sink","Kitchen Appliances",Countertop,"Dining Table",Chairs,"Wall Art","Laundry Appliances","Kitche