	('a643e931-23b0-4973-bdd9-c9d30ff0ad11', 'nt132045459', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/132045459.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Chic Urban Retreat with Stunning Landmark Views', 'Tôn Đức Thắng, Phường Bến Nghé, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'tn c thng phng bn ngh qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 22000000, '22 triệu/tháng', '53 m²', 'Step into a chic urban retreat that perfectly encapsulates modern living in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. This stylish 1-bedroom apartment boasts a generous 53 m² of thoughtfully designed space, where contemporary aesthetics meet comfort. The open layout invites natural light to flood the living area, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere ideal for both relaxation and entertaining. Imagine sipping your morning coffee while gazing at the iconic Landmark 81 from your window, or hosting friends in a space that effortlessly blends sophistication with a cozy vibe. The full furnishings enhance the living experience, providing a seamless transition from day to night. With a neutral color palette accented by tasteful decor, this apartment is not just a place to live, but a lifestyle to embrace.', '{"Polished marble flooring reflecting overhead lights","Stylish dining set with upholstered chairs","Plush sofa with decorative cushions and light colors","Chic chandelier illuminating the dining area","Elegant tufted headboard with neutral color scheme"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera","Built-in cabinets","Dining chairs","Large windows","Smart TV","Dining table",TV,"Kitchen appliances","Storage cabinets",Wi-Fi,sofa,"decorative cushions","dining set","lighting fixtures","High-speed internet",Chandelier,Sofa,"Smart home features","In-unit laundry",bed,headboard,mirror,wardrobe,"Air conditioning","Built-in wardrobe"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt132045459/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmyt