	('455e6906-cc11-4687-a691-3fe6d1a33573', 'nt131751789', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131751789.htm', 'Charming Balcony Retreat with Full Amenities in the Heart of Quận 10', 'Đường Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 15, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng t hin thnh phng 15 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 6500000, '6,5 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Step into a serene sanctuary in the bustling heart of Quận 10, where this charming 1-bedroom apartment awaits. Bathed in natural light, the space features a delightful balcony that invites fresh air and sunlight, creating a perfect spot for morning coffee or evening relaxation. The interior is thoughtfully designed with a full range of furnishings, including a cozy bed, a modern air conditioning unit, and a convenient washing machine, ensuring a hassle-free living experience. The open layout allows for seamless transitions between living, dining, and working, making it ideal for both productivity and leisure. Enjoy the peace of mind with 24/7 security and the convenience of an elevator, while being just steps away from vibrant local amenities, cafes, and shopping. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice for those seeking comfort and convenience in a lively urban setting.', '{"Abundant natural light with spacious layout","Bright, inviting space with urban views","Functional laundry area for effortless living","Functional laundry area seamlessly integrated","Versatile dining area for gatherings and meals"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Washing Machine",Balcony,Elevator,"24/7 Security","Dining Table",Chairs,Sofa,Bed,Curtains,"Large Windows",Chair,Wardrobe,Flooring,Refrigerator,Cabinets,"Kitchen Cabinets","Coffee Table","TV Stand","Storage Cabinet","Electric Stove"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131751789/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/n