	('70c4768d-0b56-4f62-b29f-0f522a767cfe', 'nt131669956', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131669956.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'VIP! FOR RENT KINGDOM 101 APARTMENT WITH MILLION-DOLLAR VIEW FOR FIREWORKS IN DISTRICT 1, ONLY 17 MILLION/MONTH', '334, Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 14, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '334 t hin thnh phng 14 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 17000000, '17 triệu/tháng', '72.5 m²', 'Discover this exceptional 2-bedroom apartment for rent at Kingdom 101, located at 334 To Hien Thanh, District 10. This unit boasts a generous area of 72.5 m² and is available for 17 million VND per month. As a resident of Kingdom 101, you''ll enjoy a prime location with a million-dollar view, perfect for watching fireworks over District 1. The apartment features 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, offering comfortable living spaces. Kingdom 101 is a high-end apartment complex providing a full range of amenities to meet all residents'' needs, including an infinity pool, lush green park, sky garden, gym, yoga room, and a luxurious reception hall. This particular listing is for a 2-bedroom unit with basic furniture, priced competitively. Other options are available, including 1-bedroom units (48-60m²) from 14-17 million VND/month, 2-bedroom units (70-79m²) from 17-22 million VND/month, and 3-bedroom units (103m²) from 23-30 million VND/month, with both basic and fully furnished options. Duplex units are also available. Service fees range from 700k-1.55 million VND depending on the apartment size, and parking is available for motorbikes (150k) and cars (2 million). Don''t miss this opportunity to live in one of Ho Chi Minh City''s most sought-after developments.', '{"Sleek marble island and modern appliances","Bright and airy personal retreat","Warm and inviting personal sanctuary","Bright workspace with city skyline views","Inviting personal retreat with natural light"}', '{"2 bedrooms","2 bathrooms","Infinity pool","Green park","