 Cabinets", "Air Conditioning"], "image_index": 0, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Sleek marble island and modern appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen exemplifies modern elegance with its sleek marble island and high-end appliances, promoting a culinary creativity hub. The glossy cabinetry reflects light, enhancing the spacious feel while the warm wood doors provide a cozy contrast. The layout encourages efficient movement, making meal preparation hassle-free. Natural light spills in, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere, perfect for both cooking and socializing. With practical storage solutions and contemporary finishes, this kitchen transforms daily cooking into a luxurious experience.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "Marble Countertops"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Bed", "Wardrobe", "Artwork", "Nightstand", "Ceiling Lights"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 4, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Bright and airy personal retreat", "detailed_analysis": "This serene bedroom exudes tranquility with its bright, airy layout enhanced by natural light pouring through the windows. The minimalist design, featuring a neatly made bed with colorful linens and a simple wardrobe, promotes a sense of calm and organization. Thoughtfully placed artwork adds a touch of personality, while the warm wooden accents create a cozy atmosphere. This space effortlessly flows, inviting moments of relaxation and rejuvenation, ideal for unwinding after a long day.", "suggested_amenities": ["Wardrobe", "Ceiling Lights"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Built-in Storage", "Queen Bed", "Nightstand", "Artwork", "Shelves"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 8, "urban": 2, "modern": 2, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 3, "minimalist": 7, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Warm and inviting personal sanctuary", "detailed_analysis": "This bedroom radiates warmth and comfort with its soft pink bedding and cozy decor. The well-placed shelves and built-in storage optimize space, making it functional yet inviting. The natural light filtering through the window enhances the serene atmosphere, while the artwork adds a touch of personality. The overall layout encourages relaxation, creating a perfect personal retreat for unwinding after a long day. The blend of modern and cozy elements makes it a unique haven.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Built-in Storage"], "suggested_activities": ["Resting", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Queen Bed", "Large Windows", "Air Conditioning", "Curtains", "Wall Art"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 8, "urban": 5, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Bright workspace with city skyline views", "detailed_analysis": "This bright bedroom seamlessly combines comfort and practicality with its large windows offering stunning city skyline views, creating an inspiring atmosphere. The soft color palette, accentuated by cozy textiles, enhances the inviting mood, while the minimalist decor ensures a clutter-free environment. The air conditioning unit adds a touch of modern convenience, ensuring a comfortable climate year-round. Ideal for both relaxation and productivity, this space flows effortlessly, making it a perfect personal retreat.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Large Windows"], "suggested_activities": ["Reading", "Working"]}, {"amenities": ["Bed", "Nightstand", "Lamp", "Wardrobe", "Artwork", "Curtains"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 9, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 10, 