	('ae8157ad-06c3-4d1d-92e1-359d2f568ed6', 'nt131507173', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131507173.htm', 'Charming 1-Bedroom Retreat with Balcony and Separate Kitchen, Steps from Lê Văn Tám Park', 'Đường Võ Thị Sáu, Phường Võ Thị Sáu, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng v th su phng v th su qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover a serene urban escape in this beautifully designed 1-bedroom apartment, perfectly situated on Võ Thị Sáu Street in the heart of Quận 3. This 40m² residence offers a harmonious blend of modern aesthetics and practical living, ideal for those seeking comfort and convenience. The apartment features a thoughtfully separated kitchen, allowing for distinct living and cooking zones, enhancing both functionality and the overall flow of the space. Step out onto your private balcony to greet the morning sun or unwind in the evening, enjoying fresh air and natural light that floods the interior. The design embraces a clean, contemporary style with high-quality furnishings, creating an inviting atmosphere where you can simply unpack and begin living. Imagine starting your day with a coffee on the balcony, enjoying the tranquility before diving into the vibrant energy of the city. With a private washing machine, daily chores become effortless, contributing to a seamless living experience. Located just moments from Lê Văn Tám Park, this home offers easy access to green spaces for relaxation and recreation, while also being well-connected to Quận 1, Phú Nhuận, and Bình Thạnh, placing you at the nexus of Saigon''s dynamic lifestyle. This apartment isn''t just a place to live; it''s a sanctuary designed for modern urban living.', '{"Premium living space feature","Inviting natural light through large windows","Functional dining area for casual gatherings","Artistic wall decor elevating bedroom ambiance","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes"}', '{Balcony,"Washing Machine",