	('637a444b-788b-428e-8b38-5db7d8784c76', 'pr41364475', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-eco-green-sai-gon-phuong-tan-thuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/thang-10-cho-dung-nhu-cau-1pn-2pn-3pn-ntcb-va-full-11-13-15tr-pr41364475', 'Eco Green Apartment for Rent: 2-3 Bedrooms with Full Amenities', 'Eco Green Sài Gòn, Nguyễn Văn Linh Street, Tân Thuận Ward, Ho Chi Minh City', 'eco green si gn nguyn vn linh street tn thun ward ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 15500000, '15.5 million/month', '66 m²', 'This stunning apartment in Eco Green Sài Gòn is available for rent, offering a perfect blend of comfort and modern living. With 2 bedrooms and a spacious area of 66 m², this apartment is ideal for families or professionals looking for a cozy home. The property features basic furnishings, allowing you to move in immediately. You can choose between fully furnished options or basic setups, depending on your needs. The rental price ranges from 15.5 to 18 million VND per month, depending on the specific unit and furnishings. Located on Nguyễn Văn Linh Street in Tân Thuận Ward, this apartment is conveniently situated near essential amenities and services. Contact us today to secure this beautiful apartment and enjoy a comfortable lifestyle in one of Ho Chi Minh City''s most sought-after locations.', '{"Breathtaking view from expansive floor-to-ceiling windows","Stylish dining area with elegant lighting fixtures","Inviting entertainment area with ample natural light","Stylish built-in storage for organized living","Casual dining space for intimate gatherings"}', '{"Basic Furniture","Fully Furnished Options","24/7 Security","Parking Space"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr41364475/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr41364475/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-imag