	('11196c65-a3b9-4017-ba72-8fb07966b50a', 'nt128346733', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-ba-trung-ha-noi/128346733.htm', '[New] CCMN Minh Khai Bach Mai fully furnished, secure, quiet, and with fire protection!', 'Ngõ 77 Phố 8 Tháng 3, Phường Minh Khai, Quận Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội', 'ng 77 ph 8 thng 3 phng minh khai qun hai b trng h ni', 'hanoi', 6000000, '6 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Discover this charming and secure mini apartment (CCMN) or studio for rent, perfectly situated at alley 77, 8 Thang 3 Street, Minh Khai, Bach Mai, Hai Ba Trung District. Ideal for families, students, or working professionals, this unit offers a comfortable living space of 30m². The building features an elevator for convenience and a private balcony for drying clothes. Enjoy peace of mind with free motorbike parking on the first floor, fingerprint access control, and 24/7 security cameras. The property is fully equipped with essential fire protection systems on every floor and in each room, meeting Ministry of Public Security standards.

Inside, you''ll find a complete set of furnishings, including a bed, wardrobe, desk, air conditioner, water heater, kitchen cabinets, refrigerator, sink, single induction cooker, and a private washing machine. Just bring your personal belongings and settle in! Utility costs are transparent: electricity at 3,500 VND/kWh, water and trash at 100,000 VND/person/month, service fee at 100,000 VND/person/month, and internet (wired and Wi-Fi) at 100,000 VND/room/month. Rent is paid monthly, with a 1-month deposit required for a 1-year contract. Please note, pets are not allowed, electric vehicles are prohibited, and no gatherings after 11 PM. Contact Nhung, the owner, for more details.', '{"Natural light-filled open kitchen layout","Stylish built-in storage solutions","Efficient laundry space with outdoor access","Secure motorcycle parking area with easy access","Sleek elevator access for effortless living"}', '{Elevator,"Private balcony","Free motorbike parking","Fingerprint access","24/7 security cameras","Fire protection system (PCCC)","Fully furnished",Bed,Wardrobe,Desk,"Air conditioner","Water heater","Kitchen cabinets",Refrigerator,Sink,"Induction cooker","Private washing machine","Internet (wired and Wi-Fi)"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/4.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128346733/5.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/extern