	('951ff9ba-2ca7-4e0c-9ac3-3271eb52910d', 'nt131913503', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/131913503.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxury Studio Retreat with Elegant Wooden Accents Near District 1', 'Đường Huỳnh Mẫn Đạt, Phường 19, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng hunh mn t phng 19 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7200000, '7,2 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Step into a world of luxury in this stunning studio apartment, designed with a sophisticated wooden tone that exudes warmth and elegance. The spacious 35m² layout features large windows that invite natural light to dance across the room, creating a bright and airy atmosphere perfect for both relaxation and productivity. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the faux balcony, enjoying the gentle breeze while planning your day. The apartment is fully furnished with high-quality amenities, including a washing machine and dryer, ensuring convenience for your busy lifestyle. With a modern security system and 24/7 concierge service, you can feel safe and secure in your new home. This studio is not just a place to live; it''s a sanctuary where you can unwind, entertain friends, and embrace the vibrant energy of the city around you.', '{"Natural light pouring into the serene bedroom space","Stylish wooden accents and calming decor","Fitness corner for health-focused lifestyle","Active lifestyle corner with exercise bike","Tranquil reading nook by the window"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"24/7 Security","King Bed",Nightstand,"Ceiling Fan","Large Windows","Wood Flooring",Artwork,"Wall Decor",Closet,"Wall Art","Lighting Fixtures","Wooden Furniture","Indoor Plants","Decorative Wall Art","Bedside Lamp",Bicycle,"Indoor plants","Exercise bike","Wall art","Wooden furniture","Ceiling fan","Floor Lamp","Wooden Accents",Curtains}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot