	('fcf6ab64-399f-4d03-ac16-3edc88c6d963', 'nt131315371', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/131315371.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Excellent Rental Apartments at Vinhomes Central Park & Landmark 81 (1-4 Bedrooms)', '208, Nguyễn Hữu Cảnh, Phường 22, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '208 nguyn hu cnh phng 22 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 28000000, '28 triệu/tháng', '1203 m²', 'Welcome to Vinhomes Central Park! Cozy Home specializes in managing 100% of the high-end apartments for rent at Vinhomes Central Park and Landmark 81, offering the best prices on the market. This listing features a spacious 3-bedroom apartment spanning an impressive 1203 m², available for 28 million VND per month. We also have a variety of other units, from 1-bedroom to 4-bedroom apartments, with both long-term and short-term rental options. Long-term prices start from 16 million VND/month for 1-bedroom units, 19 million VND/month for 2-bedroom units, 27 million VND/month for 3-bedroom units, and 50 million VND/month for 4-bedroom units. Landmark 81 units start from 22 million VND/month. Residents enjoy exclusive amenities such as free access to the swimming pool and gym, guaranteed parking for one car and two motorbikes per apartment, and access to the Vinschool system (kindergarten, primary, secondary, high school). Pet owners are welcome – please contact us for details. The area boasts a Vincom shopping center, Winmart supermarket, FamilyMart, An Nam Gourmet, Pharmacity pharmacy, various restaurants, banks, cocktail bars, a cinema, a 14-hectare riverside park, and the Vinmec International General Hospital. We commit to customer information confidentiality, apartment and service quality, simple and quick rental procedures, convenient payment options, and ample, secure parking. Contact us today to secure your ideal home!', '{"Panoramic city view from expansive windows","Sophisticated dining area for memorable gatherings","