	('f90d735a-db0c-4290-9357-492b027ed8e2', 'nt131651801', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131651801.htm', 'For Rent: The Infiniti Apartment, 121m2, 3 Bedrooms, 100% New, High-End Furniture', 'Huỳnh Tấn Phát, Phường Tân Phú, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'hunh tn pht phng tn ph qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 33000000, '33 triệu/tháng', '121 m²', 'Discover this exquisite apartment for rent at The Infiniti, a premium new development. Located on the 32nd floor, this spacious unit spans 121 m2 and features a well-designed layout with 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, perfect for families or those seeking ample living space. The apartment comes fully furnished with brand new, high-end decor, ensuring a luxurious and comfortable living experience from day one. Enjoy modern aesthetics and top-quality finishes throughout the home. The rental price is 35 million VND per month, with room for negotiation. A special offer includes free management fees for months 4, 5, 6, and 7. Don''t miss the opportunity to live in this prestigious project. Contact Ms. Tố Như for viewings and further details via call, Zalo, WeChat, WhatsApp, or KakaoTalk.', '{"Open-concept living and dining area with elegance","Bright and airy living space with city views","Elegant dining space for memorable gatherings","Sophisticated dining area with stylish decor","Culinary creativity hub with sleek finishes"}', '{"Apartment type: Condominium","Area: 121 m²","Bedrooms: 3 rooms","Bathrooms: 2 rooms","Interior condition: High-end furniture","Project: The Infiniti Riviera Point",Sofa,"Coffee Table","Dining Table","Dining Chairs",Refrigerator,"Kitchen Cabinets","Light Fixtures","Large Screen TV",Chairs,Balcony,"Smart AC Unit","Pendant Light",Artwork,"Air Conditioning","Wall Lighting","Kitchen Counter",Cabinets,"Kitchen Sink",Stove,Oven,Dishwasher,Countertops,"Kitchen Hood","Kitchen Appliances","Granite Countertops"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/obje