 Table", "Chairs", "Balcony"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 8, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Bright and airy living space with city views", "detailed_analysis": "This living area exudes modern elegance with its open layout and large windows that flood the space with natural light. The neutral color palette, complemented by the sleek sofa and stylish dining setup, creates a welcoming atmosphere perfect for hosting or unwinding. The unique chandelier adds a touch of sophistication, while the balcony offers a serene view of the urban landscape. The seamless flow between indoor and outdoor spaces enhances the overall lifestyle experience, making it ideal for both relaxation and social gatherings.", "suggested_amenities": ["Large Screen TV", "Sofa"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Hosting guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Dining Table", "Dining Chairs", "Refrigerator", "Kitchen Cabinets", "Smart AC Unit", "Pendant Light", "Artwork"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 8, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Elegant dining space for memorable gatherings", "detailed_analysis": "This image showcases a sophisticated dining area designed for both functionality and style. The elegant wooden dining table, surrounded by plush, modern chairs, creates an inviting atmosphere perfect for entertaining. The minimalist cabinetry and sleek appliances lend a contemporary touch, while the warm accent wall adds depth and character. Well-placed lighting enhances the ambiance, making it ideal for evening gatherings. The openness of the space encourages seamless flow between dining and culinary experiences, embodying a lifestyle of effortless hosting.", "suggested_amenities": ["Dining Table", "Refrigerator"], "suggested_activities": ["Hosting dinner parties", "Family meals"]}, {"amenities": ["Dining Table", "Chairs", "Air Conditioning", "Artwork", "Wall Lighting", "Kitchen Counter", "Cabinets", "Refrigerator"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Sophisticated dining area with stylish decor", "detailed_analysis": "This image showcases a sophisticated dining area, highlighted by a minimalist design aesthetic and warm color palette. The elegant dining table, surrounded by plush chairs, invites intimate gatherings and memorable meals. Above, stylish pendant lights provide a soft glow, enhancing the inviting atmosphere. The open layout seamlessly connects to a modern kitchen, ensuring functionality while maintaining an airy feel. The artwork adds a touch of personality, making this space a focal point for social interactions and culinary experiences.", "suggested_amenities": ["Dining Table", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Hosting dinner parties", "Enjoying family meals"]}, {"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Kitchen Sink", "Stove", "Oven", "Dishwasher", "Countertops", "Cabinets", "Kitchen Hood"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 8, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Culinary creativity hub with sleek finishes", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen space embodies modern elegance with its sleek cabinetry and high-end appliances. The minimalist design features warm wood tones combined with smooth granite countertops, creating a harmonious balance of functionality and style. Ample natural light floods the area through the window, enhancing the inviting atmosphere. This culinary creativity hub is perfect for those who enjoy cooking and entertaining, featuring a well-integrated kitchen hood and ample storage. The layout encourages seamless movement, making meal preparation and socializing effortless.", "suggested_