	('2615a888-70ea-47d7-b213-5a40cbfe21b9', 'nt131809045', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/131809045.htm', 'Charming 1-Bedroom Retreat with Private Balcony in the Heart of Phú Nhuận', 'Đường Phan Đăng Lưu, Phường Đức Nhuận, Quận Phú Nhuận, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng phan ng lu phng c nhun qun ph nhun tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7600000, '7,6 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Welcome to your charming 1-bedroom retreat nestled in the vibrant heart of Phú Nhuận. This delightful apartment features a private balcony that invites natural light to flood the space, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The open layout is perfect for morning coffee rituals, while the cozy living area is designed for relaxation or remote work. With full furnishings, including a washing machine for added convenience, you can move in and start enjoying your new home immediately. The modern amenities, such as a spacious parking area and a secure building with a dedicated elevator, enhance your living experience. Located centrally, you’ll find quick access to the bustling districts of Q1, Bình Thạnh, and Tân Bình, making it an ideal spot for both work and leisure. Embrace the lifestyle you’ve always wanted in this serene and stylish apartment.', '{"Bright natural light through expansive windows","Functional workspace with sleek modern design","Minimalist multifunctional living space","Culinary creativity hub with sleek modern design","Stylish glass partition enhances privacy and flow"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Parking,Elevator,Security,Refrigerator,Bed,Desk,Sofa,"Large Windows",Chair,"Storage Shelves","Storage Cabinets",Artwork,"Coffee Table","Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,Countertops,"Kitchen Appliances","Modern Kitchen","Dining Table","Wall Art",Workspace,"Comfortable Seating"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131809045/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.