	('005286d4-4c45-4e4f-9496-6a44cee8074c', 'nt131919653', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/131919653.htm', 'Chic Urban Retreat with Modern Comforts Near Lotte', 'Đường Nguyễn Văn Lượng, Phường 10, Quận Gò Vấp, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng nguyn vn lng phng 10 qun g vp tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 10000000, '10 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Step into this chic urban retreat, where modern comforts meet stylish design. This spacious 2-bedroom apartment is bathed in natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The contemporary decor features a harmonious blend of neutral tones and vibrant accents, making it a perfect backdrop for your personal style. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the balcony, enjoying the fresh air as you plan your day. The open layout seamlessly connects the living area to the kitchen, ideal for hosting friends or enjoying quiet evenings at home. With high-end furnishings and a fully equipped kitchen, every detail has been thoughtfully curated to enhance your living experience. Located just steps away from Lotte, you’ll have easy access to shopping and dining, while the surrounding neighborhood offers a vibrant community feel. Experience the perfect balance of comfort and convenience in this stylish haven.', '{"Bright hallway with modern marble flooring","Modern kitchen with sleek cabinetry and dining space","Versatile workspace with ample storage solutions","Functional workspace with stylish built-in storage","Efficient study corner with stylish shelving"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine","Security Camera",Elevator,"Large Windows","Dining Table",Chairs,"Marble Flooring",Refrigerator,Stove,"Kitchen Cabinets",Sink,Countertops,"Kitchen Appliances","Dining Area",Desk,Chair,"Storage Cabinets",Wardrobe,"Lighting Fixtures","Wall Shelves",Workspace,Bed,"Storage Shelves",Curtains}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt13