	('2dd3b3cc-7050-4c94-94e8-4a6e986557b5', 'nt131786250', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131786250.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Urban Retreat with Modern Touches in Quận 10', 'Đường Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 13, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng t hin thnh phng 13 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 5500000, '5,5 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Step into this charming urban retreat nestled in the heart of Quận 10, where modern design meets cozy living. This 40 m² one-bedroom apartment boasts an inviting atmosphere, enhanced by ample natural light streaming through large windows. The contemporary decor features a soothing color palette of soft neutrals and warm wood tones, creating a serene backdrop for your daily rituals. Imagine enjoying your morning coffee in the stylish living area, or hosting friends in the open layout that seamlessly connects the living room and kitchen. Equipped with essential amenities like air conditioning and a well-appointed kitchen, this space is designed for both comfort and functionality. The thoughtful layout includes a spacious bedroom that offers a peaceful escape from the bustling city outside. With security features like fingerprint access and a wide parking area, you can feel at ease in your new home. Experience the vibrant lifestyle of Quận 10, with shopping, dining, and entertainment just moments away.', '{"Multi-functional workspace with sleek storage solutions","Sleek kitchen for culinary exploration","Sleek built-in wardrobe for streamlined organization","Chic kitchen with modern finishes and functionality","Efficient minimalist design for versatile living"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Elevator,"Security Camera",Desk,"Storage Cabinets","Kitchen Sink",Refrigerator,"Wall-mounted Shelves","Kitchen Cabinets",Stove,Sink,Countertop,"Bed Frame","Built-in Wardrobe",Window,"Wood Flooring","Light Fixtures",Wardrobe,Countertops,"Open Floor Plan","Kitchen Appliances","Modern Cabinets",Bed,"