	('979d561d-d68b-4f85-b2a1-2818425baf8f', 'nt131530888', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-cau-giay-ha-noi/131530888.htm', 'Apartment for rent at MHDI – 60 Hoang Quoc Viet with 3 bedrooms, fully furnished', 'Ngõ 60, Hoàng Quốc Việt, Phường Nghĩa Đô, Quận Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội', 'ng 60 hong quc vit phng ngha qun cu giy h ni', 'hanoi', 16000000, '16 triệu/tháng', '101 m²', 'Discover this spacious and modern apartment for rent at MHDI – 60 Hoàng Quốc Việt, offering a comfortable and convenient living experience. With a generous area of 101 m², this apartment features 3 bedrooms, a living room, a kitchen, and 2 bathrooms, making it ideal for families or individuals seeking ample space. The unit is fully furnished with essential appliances and furniture, including a TV, air conditioners, washing machine, beds, wardrobes, sofa, and kitchen equipment, allowing you to move in immediately with just your personal belongings.

Located on the 22nd floor, the apartment boasts a refreshing and airy design with a beautiful view of Hồ Tây. The building ensures good security and offers convenient amenities such as elevators and a spacious basement for parking. Its prime location provides easy access to numerous universities, markets, and supermarkets, ensuring a vibrant and well-connected lifestyle. Additionally, the first four floors of the building house a private kindergarten, a Vinmart supermarket, and cafes, adding to the convenience for residents. Situated in a high-intellectual area, this apartment at MHDI 60 Hoàng Quốc Việt promises a high quality of life.', '{"Stylish entertainment center with modern finishes","Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances","Dedicated workspace with natural light","Inviting bathroom with modern fixtures","Sleek walk-in shower with modern fixtures"}', '{"Apartment type: Apartment","Area: 101 m²","Legal documents: Pink book (private ownership certificate)","Number of bedrooms: 3 rooms","Interior condition: Fully furnished","Deposit: 16,000,000 VND/month","Floor number: 22",TV,"Air conditioning","Washing machine",Beds,Wardrobes,Sofa,"Kitchen appliances","Parking basement",Elevator,Security,"Air Conditioning",Television,"TV Stand","Storage Cabinets","Wood Flooring","Lighting Fixtures",Refrigerator,Stove,Oven,Microwave,"Kitchen Hood",Cabinets,Sink,Countertop,"Modern Kitchen Appliances","Kitchen Island","Wall-mounted TV",Desk,Chair,Fan,Window,"Bathroom Sink",Mirror,Shower,Toilet,Curtains,"Large Windows","Modern Bathroom","Natural Lighting","Walk-in Shower","Modern Toilet","Towel Rack","Modern Bathroom Fixtures","Stylish Mirror"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131530888/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131530888/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-