	('d05626f6-da9a-4fdd-9d74-3e016817a35f', 'nt124019937', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/124019937.htm', 'Luxury Newly Built Apartment Near Le Van Sy - Adjacent to Nguyen Van Troi, District 3', 'Le Van Sy Street, Ward 11, Phu Nhuan District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'le van sy street ward 11 phu nhuan district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 10000000, '10 triệu/tháng', '60 m²', 'This luxurious newly built apartment is located on Le Van Sy Street, adjacent to Nguyen Van Troi in District 3, Ho Chi Minh City. The apartment boasts a spacious area of 60 m² and features one bedroom, making it ideal for individuals or couples looking for a comfortable living space. The building consists of five floors with an elevator and ample parking space. It is conveniently located just three minutes from Tan Son Nhat Airport and close to Pham Van Hai Market. The apartment is fully furnished with high-end furniture, ensuring a stylish and comfortable living environment. Each studio and one-bedroom unit comes with a balcony and large windows, providing plenty of natural light and ventilation. Don''t miss the chance to live in this prime location with modern amenities.', '{"Seamlessly integrated kitchen and living area","Efficient kitchen with modern appliances and design","Efficient laundry integration with kitchen design","Natural light flooding through balcony windows","Inviting balcony with urban views"}', '{Elevator,Parking,"Fully Furnished",Balcony,"High-end Furniture","Washing Machine",Refrigerator,Stove,Microwave,"Air Conditioning","Dining Table",TV,"Kitchen Cabinets","Kitchen Appliances","Dining Area",Chairs,Oven,"Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,"Modern Kitchen Appliances","Kitchen Hood",Television,"Double Bed",Curtains,"Large Screen TV",Bed,Nightstand}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt124019937/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/ext