ditioning", "Television", "Double Bed", "Curtains", "Balcony"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Natural light flooding through balcony windows", "detailed_analysis": "This stylish bedroom radiates modern elegance with its minimalist design, featuring a plush double bed and a sleek television. The spacious layout is complemented by natural light streaming in from the balcony windows, creating a serene atmosphere. The elegant color palette and polished flooring enhance the room''s airy feel, while the tasteful curtains add a touch of coziness. This space offers a perfect retreat for relaxation or a peaceful reading nook, making daily life more enjoyable.", "suggested_amenities": ["Television", "Balcony"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Large Screen TV", "Balcony", "Bed", "Nightstand"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 8}, "image_highlight": "Inviting balcony with urban views", "detailed_analysis": "This bedroom space exudes a serene urban charm, featuring a comfortable bed with soft linens and a nightstand for essentials. The large screen TV adds entertainment options, while the air conditioning ensures year-round comfort. A standout feature is the inviting balcony that opens up to stunning urban views, perfect for enjoying fresh air or a quiet moment. The minimalist design creates an uncluttered atmosphere, making it a restful sanctuary. Natural light pours in through the windows, enhancing the peaceful vibe.", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing with a book", "Enjoying morning coffee"]}]}', '2026-03-28 05:32:00.43+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-13 03:00:12.303+00', true, '2026-03-28 05:32:00.5