	('aca731ca-787c-4b1d-a587-85749f659548', 'nt131262034', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/131262034.htm', 'Charming Mini Apartment in the Heart of Phu Nhuan', 'Nguyen Dinh Chieu Street, Ward 4, Phu Nhuan District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'nguyen dinh chieu street ward 4 phu nhuan district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 5500000, '5.5 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'This charming mini apartment is located in the vibrant heart of Phu Nhuan, just a stone''s throw away from District 1. With a spacious area of 30 m², it features one bedroom and a well-designed layout that maximizes comfort and functionality. The apartment is bright and airy, boasting two windows that let in plenty of natural light. The interior is tastefully furnished with high-quality decor, ensuring a cozy and inviting atmosphere. The rental price is incredibly affordable at 5.5 million VND per month, with additional costs for electricity and water. This apartment is perfect for individuals or couples looking for a stylish and convenient living space in one of Ho Chi Minh City''s most desirable neighborhoods.', '{"Bright and airy minimalist bedroom retreat","Efficient kitchen setup with modern appliances","Dedicated workspace with natural light","Bright and inviting minimalist workspace","Bright, well-lit minimalist bedroom ambiance"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Hot Water",Refrigerator,"Cooking Facilities",Bed,Wardrobe,Mirror,Window,Curtains,Sofa,Table,Chair,"Natural Light","Kitchen Sink",Cabinetry,"Wooden Storage Unit","Potted Plant","Air Conditioning Unit",Desk,"Storage Cabinet","Indoor Plant",Nightstand}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131262034/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131262034/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131262034/2.jpg,https://