	('e72f4ebb-3e8f-45ca-afc4-c47b5cd8a7c4', 'nt131928577', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/131928577.htm', 'Charming Mini Apartment with Private Kitchen and Serene Rooftop', 'Đường Đặng Văn Sâm, Phường 9, Quận Phú Nhuận, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng ng vn sm phng 9 qun ph nhun tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7900000, '7,9 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Step into this charming mini apartment that offers a perfect blend of comfort and style. With its spacious layout, this 1-bedroom sanctuary features a private kitchen that keeps cooking smells away from your sleeping area, ensuring a peaceful retreat. The large windows invite natural light to flood the space, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere throughout the day. Enjoy your morning coffee on the expansive rooftop, perfect for relaxing or hosting friends for a BBQ. The high-end furnishings add a touch of luxury, while the quiet neighborhood ensures a serene living experience. This apartment is ideal for those who appreciate privacy and a cozy vibe, making it a perfect home for couples or professionals seeking a stylish living space.', '{"Charming dining nook with natural decor","Restorative sleep sanctuary with calming decor","Charming accent wall with vibrant pink tone","Vibrant green backsplash with modern kitchen fixtures","Charming dining nook with modern elegance"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera",Bed,"Dining Table",Chairs,"Decorative Plants","Wall Art","Window Blinds","Built-in Storage","Large Bed",Window,"Cozy Bed",Nightstand,"Indoor Plant",Refrigerator,Microwave,"Kitchen Cabinets","Kitchen Sink",Stove,Countertop,"Modern Kitchen","Kitchen Appliances","Dining Chairs","Pendant Light","Floral Centerpiece",Tableware}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131928577/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131928577/