	('c70ea0a8-8396-4375-9336-fdd9a8d40b1f', 'nt131680707', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131680707.htm', 'COZY 1-BEDROOM APARTMENT 35SQM WITH BALCONY NEAR NGUYEN THI MINH KHAI', 'Đường Cao Thắng, Phường 2, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng cao thng phng 2 qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Discover this charming 35sqm serviced apartment, featuring a refreshing balcony and large windows, offering an abundance of natural light and a pleasant breeze. Located at 21B Cao Thắng, Ward 2, District 3, this apartment boasts a prime location with easy access to major roads. You''ll be just a stone''s throw away from Bàn Cờ Market and a mere 5-minute drive to Aeon Cao Thắng. The vibrant neighborhood is filled with eateries operating late into the night, and its proximity to District 1 offers unbeatable value.

