	('b9ff6c52-32ec-4d9f-aa78-2167aa84d0f8', 'nt131468668', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-chau-da-nang/131468668.htm', 'F Home Apartment 2 Bedrooms with River and City View', 'Ly Thuong Kiet, Hai Chau I Ward, Hai Chau District, Da Nang', 'ly thuong kiet hai chau i ward hai chau district da nang', 'da_nang', 20000000, '20 million/month', '63.5 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment located in the F Home complex offers a spacious 63.5 m² living area with breathtaking views of the Han River and the city. Situated on the 9th floor, the apartment features modern furnishings and is equipped with a smart TV, side-by-side refrigerator, washing machine, and dryer. The rental price is flexible, with a special rate of 20 million VND per month for a one-year lease, while a three-month contract is available at 22 million VND per month. Ideal for expatriates, this apartment is ready for occupancy after April 1, 2026. Enjoy the vibrant lifestyle of Da Nang with easy access to local amenities and attractions.', '{"Cozy living area with stylish decor","Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances","Breathtaking urban skyline views","Bright and inviting living space with sleek furnishings","Spa-like walk-in shower experience"}', '{"Fully furnished","Smart TV","Side-by-side refrigerator","Washing machine",Dryer,Sofa,"Coffee Table","Dining Table",Refrigerator,Television,"Kitchen Cabinets","Air Conditioning","Wall Art","Light Fixtures",Microwave,Stove,"Kitchen Sink","Dining Chairs",Cabinets,Countertops,"Modern Kitchen Appliances","Dining Area",Bed,Nightstand,Lamp,Chair,"Large Windows",Curtains,Artwork,"Wood Flooring","Cozy Seating Area","Comfortable Sofa","Large Refrigerator","Walk-in Shower","Modern Toilet","Glass Shelf","Bathroom Sink",Mirror}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131468668/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/