	('3560f0eb-4f1c-4574-9794-4a1db296de64', 'pr38754674', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-duong-dien-bien-phu-phuong-22-vinhomes-central-park/chuyen-cho-gia-tot-nhat-thi-truong-1-2-3-4pn-lh-pr38754674', 'Rental Apartment at Vinhomes Central Park - Best Market Prices (1, 2, 3, 4 Bedrooms)', 'Vinhomes Central Park, Dien Bien Phu Street, Ward 22, Binh Thanh District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'vinhomes central park dien bien phu street ward 22 binh thanh district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 35000000, '35 million/month', '120 m²', 'Welcome to Vinhomes Central Park, where luxury meets convenience. This stunning 3-bedroom apartment spans 120 m² and is available for rent at an attractive price of 35 million VND per month. The apartment is fully furnished, offering a modern living experience with ample space for families or professionals. Located in the vibrant Binh Thanh District of Ho Chi Minh City, residents enjoy easy access to a range of amenities including a 14-hectare riverside park, the Landmark 81 commercial tower, and the Vinmec International Hospital. The area is also home to Vinschool, providing quality education options. With a variety of dining and shopping options at your doorstep, Vinhomes Central Park is the perfect place to call home. Contact us today to schedule a viewing!', '{"Elegant chandelier illuminating the living space","Sophisticated dining area with elegant decor","Culinary creativity hub with elegant finishes","Gourmet kitchen with elegant marble finishes","Serene sleeping quarters with urban skyline views"}', '{"Fully Furnished","Riverside Park","Commercial Tower","International Hospital",School,Sofa,"Coffee Table",Chandelier,Artwork,Curtains,"Large Windows","Dining Table","Dining Chairs","Wall Shelving",Cabinets,"Accent Lighting","Marble Flooring","Kitchen Sink",Refrigerator,"Built-in Oven",Stove,Dishwasher,"Marble Countertops","Wall-mounted TV","Modern Kitchen Appliances","Elegant Dining Area","Kitchen Island",S