	('a1e201e2-435f-406e-89cc-339d6a04e088', 'pr40917260', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-grand-park-phuong-long-binh-sg-tp-ho-chi-minh/san-gio-hang-500-cho-gia-tot-nhat-cac-loai-hinh-studio-1-2-3pn-quan-9-pr40917260', 'Affordable Studio Apartment for Rent in Vinhomes Grand Park, District 9', 'Vinhomes Grand Park, Long Binh Ward, Ho Chi Minh City', 'vinhomes grand park long binh ward ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 4500000, '4.5 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Discover a modern studio apartment available for rent in the prestigious Vinhomes Grand Park, located in District 9 of Ho Chi Minh City. This 30 m² studio is perfect for singles, students, or young professionals seeking a comfortable living space. The apartment is offered at an attractive price of 4.5 million VND per month, making it an excellent choice for those looking for affordable housing in a vibrant community. The apartment is designed to meet all your living needs, with a spacious layout and essential amenities. Residents can enjoy a variety of facilities within the complex, including swimming pools, sports courts, and convenient transportation options. With a focus on customer satisfaction, the property management offers 24/7 support and assistance with all rental processes. Don''t miss out on this opportunity to live in a well-equipped and modern environment!', '{"Effortless living in a stylish studio space","Sleek kitchen design with modern finishes","Contemporary bathroom with sleek finishes","Sleek modern kitchen with elegant finishes","Bright and airy kitchen with modern finishes"}', '{"Swimming Pool","Sports Courts","Free Shuttle Bus",Parking,"24/7 Security","Washing Machine",Television,Sofa,"Coffee Table","Air Conditioning","Storage Cabinets","Decorative Plants","Comfortable Sofa","Modern TV","Kitchen Sink","Upper Cabinets","Lower Cabinets",Countertop,"Window with Curtains",Shower,Toilet,"Bathroom Sink",Mirror,"Towel Rack","Modern Toilet",Refrigerator,Stove,Mi