	('7f4a6bf6-b34a-4786-9ba2-3af1a11dcbdc', 'nt131332897', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131332897.htm', 'Luxury 1 Bedroom Apartment with Balcony in District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', 'Bui Thi Xuan Street, Pham Ngu Lao Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', 'bui thi xuan street pham ngu lao ward district 1 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 13500000, '13.5 triệu/tháng', '45 m²', 'This luxurious 1-bedroom apartment is located in the heart of District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, just a stone''s throw from Ben Thanh Market. The apartment boasts a modern design with brand new furnishings, providing a comfortable and stylish living space. It features a spacious balcony overlooking a newly paved street, perfect for enjoying your morning coffee or evening relaxation. The building, completed in January 2026, offers a range of amenities including an elevator, secure parking, and 24/7 access with fingerprint entry. Ideal for both short-term and long-term stays, this apartment is perfect for expatriates and professionals looking for convenience and comfort in the city center. With easy access to major districts and local attractions, this apartment is a fantastic choice for anyone looking to experience the vibrant lifestyle of Ho Chi Minh City.', '{"Stylish built-in storage with modern finishes","Efficient workspace with built-in desk and storage","Bright workspace with built-in desk and natural light","Streamlined entryway with elegant finishes","Compact kitchen with stylish built-in appliances"}', '{Elevator,Parking,"24/7 Access","New Furniture",Balcony,"Fingerprint Entry","No Shared Ownership","Built-in Storage","Queen Bed","Natural Light","Air Conditioning",Desk,Wardrobe,"Double Bed","Wall-mounted Lighting","Built-in Desk","Large Windows","Storage Shelves","Built-in storage","High-quality flooring","Stylish door","Wall shelves","Washing Machine",Refrigerator,Stove,"Kitchen Sink","Built-in Cabinets",Sofa,"Dining Table","Kitchen Appliances"}', 