all-mounted Lighting"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Efficient workspace with built-in desk and storage", "detailed_analysis": "This space features a well-integrated workspace with a built-in desk that maximizes functionality while maintaining a chic, modern aesthetic. The warm wooden accents contrast beautifully with the sleek, minimalist design, creating an inviting atmosphere. The air conditioning unit ensures comfort, while the clever use of built-in storage keeps the area organized and clutter-free. Natural light filters in through the window, enhancing the overall ambiance and making it an ideal spot for productivity or leisure.", "suggested_amenities": ["Built-in Storage", "Desk"], "suggested_activities": ["Working from home", "Studying"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Built-in Desk", "Large Windows", "Storage Shelves"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 5, "modern": 7, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 8}, "image_highlight": "Bright workspace with built-in desk and natural light", "detailed_analysis": "This space features a bright and airy layout, enhanced by large windows that invite ample natural light, creating an uplifting work environment. The minimalist design is complemented by a built-in desk, providing a functional workspace that maximizes efficiency. The sleek finishes and neutral color palette contribute to a modern aesthetic, making it a versatile area for productivity or study. The air conditioning unit ensures comfort year-round, while the subtle storage shelves offer practical organization without compromising style.", "suggested_amenities": ["Built-in Desk", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Studying"]}, {"amenities": ["Built-in storage", "High-quality flooring", "Stylish door", "Wall shelves"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 5, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Streamlined entryway with elegant finishes", "detailed_analysis": "This entryway boasts an elegant design with high-quality flooring and stylish built-in storage, creating a welcoming atmosphere. The layout flows smoothly, leading into the living space while maximizing functionality. The subtle decor and clean lines evoke a sense of calm and organization, making it an ideal introduction to the rest of the home. The thoughtful use of wall shelves allows for decorative touches while ensuring practicality. Overall, this space enhances the home''s modern aesthetic and invites a seamless lifestyle.", "suggested_amenities": ["Wall shelves", "Built-in storage"], "suggested_activities": ["Welcoming guests", "Organizing belongings"]}, {"amenities": ["Washing Machine", "Refrigerator", "Stove", "Kitchen Sink", "Built-in Cabinets", "Sofa", "Dining Table"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 8, "modern": 8, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Compact kitchen with stylish built-in appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This compact kitchen area boasts stylish built-in appliances, including a modern washing machine and a refrigerator, creating an efficient culinary workspace. The sleek cabinetry and bright yellow backsplash add a contemporary flair, while the cozy sofa and dining table invite relaxation and social interaction. The layout maximizes functionality, perfect for meal prep or casual dining. The overall atmosphere combines modern aesthetics with practicality, ensuring a seamless flow between cooking and entertaining.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "Sofa"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking meals", "Entertaining guests"]}]}', '2026-03-22 10:02:14.443+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-16 03:00:04.208+00', t