ibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 3, "modern": 5, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 7, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "large white wardrobe with detailed paneling", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a large white wardrobe featuring detailed paneling and multiple drawers. The wardrobe''s design adds an elegant touch to the space while providing ample storage. The room has wooden flooring that complements the wardrobe and contributes to a cozy atmosphere. An air conditioning unit is visible, enhancing comfort. The layout appears functional, with a door leading to another area, suggesting a well-planned living space.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Built-in Wardrobe"], "suggested_activities": ["Organizing", "Relaxing"]}, {"amenities": ["white cabinetry", "mirror shelf", "decorative handles"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 4, "modern": 6, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "white cabinetry with decorative handles and mirror", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a white cabinetry unit featuring detailed paneling and decorative handles. Below, there''s a mirrored shelf that adds depth and functionality. This setup is ideal for storage and organization, contributing to a clean and minimalist aesthetic. The overall design enhances the room''s brightness and creates a welcoming atmosphere.", "suggested_amenities": ["Storage solutions", "Mirror"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Reading", "Relaxing"]}]}', '2026-05-08 12:29:10.798+00', '2026-05-20 00:02:17.749+00', '2026-05-10 00:02:17.637+00', false, '2026-05-08 12:29:10.836549+00', '2026-05-21 10:10:24.978949+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', true, '{"images": ["https://file4.batdongsan.com.vn/resize/1275x717/2026/02/26/20260226111446-5a02_wm.jpg", "https://file4.batdongsan.com.vn/resize/1275x717/2026/02/26/20260226111446-656f_wm.jpg", "https://