	('f0656072-0835-476a-a998-9a9833939e11', 'nt131664333', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131664333.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Fully Furnished 1-Bedroom Serviced Apartment for Rent in District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', '361, Đường Trần Hưng Đạo, Phường Cầu Kho, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '361 ng trn hng o phng cu kho qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 11500000, '11,5 triệu/tháng', '25 m²', 'Direct owner offering a brand new, fully furnished serviced apartment (CHDV) for rent. This 1-bedroom unit features a balcony with a city view and is equipped with 100% new furniture. Located at 361 Tran Hung Dao, Cau Ong Lanh Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, the property boasts a prime central location in a secure area, just a few hundred meters from Ben Thanh Market. The apartment is 25 sqm and includes 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom. Rental price is 11.5 million VND per month. Utility costs include electricity at 4000 VND/kWh, water at 150,000 VND/person, and service fees (elevator, WiFi, trash collection, shared laundry, corridor cleaning, maintenance) at 150,000 VND/person. A deposit of 115,000,000 VND is required. Contact the owner to view the room. Room codes 201 and 301 are available for 12,000,000 VND.', '{"Natural light flooding through large windows","Inviting balcony retreat with city views","Charming outdoor seating with urban ambiance","Spa-like walk-in shower experience","Spa-inspired rain shower experience"}', '{"Serviced apartment","Mini apartment","25 m²","Deposit contract","1 bedroom","1 bathroom","Fully furnished",Balcony,"City view",Elevator,WiFi,"Shared laundry","Corridor cleaning",Maintenance}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131664333/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131664333/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-imag