	('95d25b07-5479-44c4-8439-75e60a4c28e1', 'nt126077961', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/126077961.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Modern Retreat with Full Amenities Near HUTECH University', 'Đường Điện Biên Phủ, Phường 25, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng in bin ph phng 25 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 8900000, '8,9 triệu/tháng', '55 m²', 'Step into this charming modern retreat, where comfort meets convenience in a beautifully designed space. This 55 m² apartment features two cozy bedrooms, perfect for unwinding after a long day. The interior is adorned with a contemporary aesthetic, showcasing a harmonious blend of soft colors and sleek textures that create a warm and inviting atmosphere. Natural light floods the living area, enhancing the open layout that encourages a seamless flow between spaces. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the balcony, enjoying the fresh air and vibrant surroundings. The fully furnished setup includes essential amenities like air conditioning and a refrigerator, allowing you to move in effortlessly and start living your best life. Located near HUTECH University, this apartment is not just a home; it''s a lifestyle choice that puts you close to parks, hospitals, and shopping centers, making daily errands a breeze. Whether you''re hosting friends or enjoying a quiet evening, this space is designed for modern living.', '{"Bright and airy open-plan living space","Natural light-filled retreat with balcony access","Inviting workspace for focused productivity","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Full Furniture",Balcony,Refrigerator,"Dining Table",Chairs,Sofa,"Wall Art","Kitchen Countertop",Bed,Windows,"Door to balcony",Desk,Chair,Wardrobe,Window,Stove,"Kitchen Sink","Kitchen Cabinets",Microwave,"Range Hood","Kitchen Appliances","Modern Kitchen"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/extern