	('8f6626e9-6d0d-4bc8-86bb-9e8f08ff7425', 'nt131833223', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131833223.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Chic Urban Retreat in Kingdom 101 with Stunning City Views', '334, Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 14, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '334 t hin thnh phng 14 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 32000000, '32 triệu/tháng', '93 m²', 'Step into a chic urban retreat at Kingdom 101, where modern design meets comfort. This spacious 93 m² apartment features three beautifully appointed bedrooms, with a layout that allows for both privacy and togetherness. The living area is bathed in natural light, thanks to expansive glass windows that offer stunning views of the vibrant cityscape. The interior boasts a harmonious blend of contemporary furnishings and warm textures, creating an inviting atmosphere perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Imagine sipping your morning coffee while gazing out at the skyline, or hosting friends in the open-plan living space that seamlessly connects to a stylish kitchen. With high-quality finishes and a thoughtful design, this apartment is not just a place to live, but a lifestyle choice. Enjoy the convenience of nearby amenities, including shopping, dining, and recreational facilities, all within easy reach.', '{"Spectacular city view through large windows","Elegant dining area with stunning city views","Sophisticated dining area with integrated lighting","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes","Breathtaking panoramic city skyline view"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Balcony,Parking,Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera","Dining Table",Chairs,Sofa,"Coffee Table","Large Windows","Lighting Fixtures",TV,Lighting,Window,"Storage Cabinets","Built-in Oven",Stove,Refrigerator,"Kitchen Island",Dishwasher,"Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,Microwave,"Kitchen Appliances","Modern Kitchen","Built-in Wardrobe",Television,"Comfortable Bed"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/s