	('a7c51c40-f136-4cc7-b6fd-0b39ea192820', 'nt131824013', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131824013.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming 1-Bedroom Apartment with Separate Kitchen and Balcony in Vibrant Đa Kao, Q1', '109/14, Đường Nguyễn Bỉnh Khiêm, Phường Đa Kao, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '10914 ng nguyn bnh khim phng a kao qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 12800000, '12,8 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover a delightful living experience in this charming 1-bedroom apartment, thoughtfully designed with a separate kitchen and a lovely balcony, offering a breath of fresh air and natural light. Spanning 40m², this fully furnished space exudes a cozy yet sophisticated vibe, perfect for individuals or couples seeking comfort and convenience in the heart of Đa Kao, Quận 1. The interior boasts high-quality furnishings, creating an inviting atmosphere where you can unwind after a long day. Imagine starting your mornings with a cup of coffee on your private balcony, or enjoying a home-cooked meal prepared in your well-equipped, separate kitchen. The layout ensures privacy and functionality, with a distinct living area and bedroom. With a washing machine and dryer included, daily chores become effortless, allowing you more time to explore the vibrant surroundings. The freedom of flexible hours means you can truly make this space your own, adapting it to your unique lifestyle. This apartment isn''t just a place to live; it''s a sanctuary designed for modern urban living, blending practicality with a touch of elegance.', '{"Efficient kitchen space with integrated appliances","Inviting lounge area with modern decor","Efficient workspace with natural light","Premium living space feature"}', '{"Fully Furnished",TV,"Washing Machine",Dryer,Balcony,Window,"Air Conditioning","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-