	('68b649f9-a24d-439a-9452-329ffd3bf680', 'pr45484834', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-biet-thu-lien-ke-hai-au-vinhomes-ocean-park-gia-lam/cho-5pn-5wc-100m2-20-trieu-vnd-tai-02-pr45484834', '5-bedroom, 5-bathroom villa for rent, 100m2, 20 million VND at Hải Âu 02, Vinhomes Ocean Park Gia Lâm', 'Hải Âu 2 101, Vinhomes Ocean Park Gia Lâm, Xã Gia Lâm, Huyện Gia Lâm, Hà Nội', 'hi u 2 101 vinhomes ocean park gia lm x gia lm huyn gia lm h ni', 'hanoi', 20000000, '20 triệu/tháng', '100', 'Villa for rent at Hải Âu 2 101, Vinhomes Ocean Park Gia Lâm, Xã Gia Lâm, Hà Nội (formerly Gia Lâm District, Hà Nội) with modern design and full amenities. The house has 5 bedrooms + 5 bathrooms/powder rooms + kitchen, suitable for a large family or a group of friends. With a price of 20 million VND and an area of 100m², this villa not only provides a comfortable living space but also offers convenience and luxury within the Vinhomes Ocean Park community. The property is ready for immediate occupancy.', '{"Elegant facade with multiple balconies and large windows","Breathtaking waterfront view from private balcony","Sleek shower enclosure with modern fixtures","Inviting entryway with abundant natural light"}', '{Balcony,"Large Windows","Security System",Elevator,"Waterfront View","Palm Trees","Modern Toilet","Shower Enclosure","Bathroom Sink",Mirror,"Polished Tile Flooring"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45484834/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45484834/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45484834/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr45484834/3.jpg}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"cozy": 161, "urban": 289, "colors": ["Warm", "Neutral", "Cool", "Bold", "Bright", "Refined"], "modern": 394, "rustic": 53, "styles": ["Elegant", "Luxurious", "Modern"], "elegant": 419, "colorful": 106, "spacious": 392, "luxurious": 397, "activities": ["Relaxing on the balcony", "Enjoying city views", "Morning coffee overlooking the water", "Evening relaxation with sunset views", "Refreshing showers"], "minimalist": 299, "natural_light": 357, "image_analyses": [{"amenities": ["Balcony", "Large Windows", "Security System", "Elevator"], "image_index": 0, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 3, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 9, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Elegant facade with multiple balconies and large windows", "detailed_analysis": "This stunning property features a modern facade with clean lines, multiple balconies, and large windows that flood the space with natural light. The elegant design creates a welcoming atmosphere, making it perfect for both relaxation and social gatherings. The spacious layout enhances the sense of openness, while the architectural details, such as arched doorways, add character. The building''s secure entry and elevator access offer convenience and peace of mind, making it ideal for urban living.", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "Security System"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing on the balcony", "Enjoying city views"]}, {"amenities": ["Balcony", "Waterfront View", "Palm Trees"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 3, "urban": 4, "modern": 7, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 8, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Breathtaking waterfront view from private balcony", "detailed_analysis": "This image showcases a stunning waterfront view framed by an elegant balcony. The natural light floods the space, creating an inviting atmosphere perfect for morning coffee or evening relaxation. The surrounding palm trees add a touch of tropical elegance, enhancing the luxury lifestyle. The architectural details of the buildings harmonize with the serene water, establishing a tranquil yet sophisticated setting. This outdoor space seamlessly connects the interior lifestyle with the beauty of nature, promoting a sense of calm and inspiration.", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "Waterfront View"], "suggested_activities": ["Morning coffee overlooking the water", "Evening relaxation with sunset views"]}, {"amenities": ["Modern Toilet", "Shower Enclosure", "Bathroom Sink", "Mirror"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": [4], "urban": [5], "modern": [7], "elegant": [7], "spacious": [6], "luxurious": [8], "minimalist": [9], "natural_light": [2]}, "image_highlight": "Sleek shower enclosure with modern fixtures", "detailed_analysis": "This bathroom exudes contemporary elegance with its sleek lines and high-end fixtures. The dark color palette enhances a sense of sophistication, while the modern shower enclosure invites relaxation. The minimalist design promotes a clutter-free environment, allowing for a tranquil space perfect for self-care rituals. The integration of a stylish bathroom sink and mirror further elevates the aesthetic, creating a refined atmosphere for daily routines. Overall, this bathroom offers a luxurious experience that transforms mundane tasks into moments of indulgence.", "suggested_amenities": ["Shower Enclosure", "Modern Toilet"], "suggested_activities": ["Refreshing showers", "Morning routines"]}, {"amenities": ["Large Windows", "Balcony", "Polished Tile Flooring"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 3, "urban": 4, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 8, "luxurious": 8, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Inviting entryway with abundant natural light", "detailed_analysis": "This entryway showcases a modern aesthetic with polished tile flooring that reflects the abundant natural light pouring in through the large windows. The open layout creates an inviting atmosphere, perfect for welcoming guests or enjoying a moment of tranquility. The balcony access hints at a seamless indoor-outdoor living experience, enhancing the overall spacious feel of the area. The minimalist design allows for personal expression while maintaining an elegant vibe, setting the tone for a sophisticated lifestyle.", "suggested_amenities": ["Large Windows", "Balcony"], "suggested_activities": ["Welcoming guests", "Creating a serene atmosphere"]}]}', '2026-04-07 09:30:53.268+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-11 03:00:06.025+00', true, '2026-04-07 09:30:53.382721+00', '2026-06-14 15:31:45.804769+00', NULL, NULL, '4+ Bedrooms', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('e4355e34-d4b6-4521-ab1b-86f4b4162942', 'nt131095966', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-dong-da-ha-noi/131095966.htm', 'OWNER - 50M2 APARTMENT IN DONG DA CENTER - CAR PARKING - FULLY FURNISHED', 'Số 10 ngõ 49/64 Huỳnh thúc Kháng, Huỳnh Thúc Kháng, Phường Láng Hạ, Quận Đống Đa, Hà Nội', 's 10 ng 4964 hunh thc khng hunh thc khng phng lng h qun ng a h ni', 'hanoi', 5900000, '5,9 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Discover this exceptional 50m2 apartment located in the heart of Đống Đa, Hà Nội, offering unparalleled convenience and comfort. Situated at a prime intersection of major streets like Nguyễn Chí Thanh, Láng Hạ, Nguyên Hồng, and Huỳnh Thúc Kháng, this property provides easy access to prominent universities, commercial centers, and office areas such such as Trần Duy Hưng and Lê Văn Lương. 

This spacious apartment is designed for tranquility and privacy, featuring a generous 50m2 layout. It comes fully furnished, allowing you to move in immediately with just your suitcase. Enjoy modern amenities including air conditioning, a refrigerator, microwave, stove, a comfortable double bed, and a floor-to-ceiling wardrobe. The unit also boasts a separate laundry area and a clean drying yard. 

Experience a lifestyle of convenience with wide roads and car access right to your doorstep, plus a car park just 50m away. Free motorbike parking is available on the ground floor. The area is known for its high intellectual community and absolute security. Essential services like VinMart, local markets, and gas stations are all within easy reach. Flexible accompanying services such as cleaning and laundry are also available upon request. All this is offered at an excellent rental price of just 5.9 million VND per month, directly from the owner, with no intermediaries. Contact Mr. Cường for a direct viewing. Priority is given to long-term tenants who will take good care of the property.', '{"Open layout with ample natural light","Culinary creativity hub with vibrant backsplash","Dedicated workspace for productivity and focus","Relaxing spa-style bathing experience","Secure parking space for motorbikes"}', '{"Căn hộ dịch vụ, mini","50 m²","1 phòng ngủ","1 phòng vệ sinh","5.900.000 đ/tháng tiền cọc","Tầng 3","Full nội thất","Điều hòa","Tủ lạnh","Lò vi sóng",Bếp,"Giường đôi","Tủ quần áo kịch trần","Khu vực máy giặt riêng","Sân phơi riêng biệt","Ô tô đỗ cửa","Bãi gửi ô tô gần","Miễn phí chỗ để xe máy","Khu dân trí cao","An ninh tốt","Gần VinMart","Gần chợ dân sinh","Gần cây xăng","Dịch vụ dọn dẹp vệ sinh (theo yêu cầu)","Dịch vụ giặt là (theo yêu cầu)",Refrigerator,"Storage Cabinet","Tile Flooring","Gas Stove",Microwave,"Kitchen Sink","Storage Cabinets","Colorful Backsplash",Desk,Chair,Bookshelf,Bed,Bedding,Bathtub,Sink,Toilet,"Tiled Flooring","Bathroom Sink",Motorcycles,"Sliding Glass Doors"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131095966/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131095966/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131095966/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.su