	('b95a79c4-8c67-48ce-a8d0-5c25fad0cd21', 'nt131876998', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131876998.htm', 'Stylish Urban Retreat in the Heart of Quận 4', '331, Bến Vân Đồn, Phường 1, Quận 4, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '331 bn vn n phng 1 qun 4 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 16000000, '16 triệu/tháng', '100 m²', 'Step into a stylish urban retreat that perfectly balances comfort and modern design in the vibrant Quận 4. This spacious 100 m² apartment features an open layout that invites natural light to dance across the sleek surfaces, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The contemporary decor is complemented by a soothing color palette of soft neutrals and pops of color, making it an ideal backdrop for both relaxation and entertaining. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the balcony, enjoying the fresh air and city views, or hosting friends in the spacious living area that seamlessly connects to the dining space. With three well-appointed bedrooms, there''s ample room for family or guests, while the fully equipped kitchen stands ready for culinary adventures. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice that embraces the energy of city life while providing a serene sanctuary to unwind.', '{"dark wood furniture with glass coffee table","black countertop with gas stove and kitchen utensils","decorative wallpaper with floral pattern on wall","wooden flooring leading to a bedroom area"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera",television,sofa,"coffee table",curtains,Wi-Fi,"Air conditioning","gas stove",microwave,"kitchen cabinets",sink,Dishwasher,Microwave,bed,mattress,nightstand,TV,"wall decor",Television,"air conditioning","wall-mounted TV",Wardrobe}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131876998/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt