k wood cabinets and a black countertop, creating a modern aesthetic. A gas stove is prominently placed, surrounded by essential kitchen utensils. The layout is functional with ample storage, while the light-colored walls contrast with the darker elements, enhancing the overall appeal. The presence of a sink and nearby shelving adds practicality, making it suitable for cooking and meal preparation.", "suggested_amenities": ["Dishwasher", "Microwave"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking", "Entertaining"]}, {"amenities": ["bed", "mattress", "curtains", "nightstand", "TV", "wall decor"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 6, "modern": 6, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "decorative wallpaper with floral pattern on wall", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a bedroom featuring a decorative wallpaper with a floral pattern, adding a touch of elegance to the space. The bed is made with a simple wooden frame and a mattress covered in plastic. Curtains with a subtle design complement the wallpaper, while a nightstand sits beside the bed. A wall-mounted television adds modern convenience, and the overall layout suggests a cozy atmosphere suitable for relaxation.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Television"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["air conditioning", "bed", "curtains", "wall-mounted TV"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 4, "modern": 5, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 3, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "wooden flooring leading to a bedroom area", "detailed_analysis": "The image captures a hallway leading to a bedroom area. The wooden flooring adds warmth, while the decorative wallpaper enhances the aesthetic appeal. A bed is visible in the room, complemented by curtains that frame the window, suggesting a cozy atmosphere. The wall-mounted TV indicates modern conveniences. Overall, the layout feels inviting and functional, suitable for relaxation or reading.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Wardrobe"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}]}', '2026-04-25 00:31:54.825+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-18 03:00:09.058+00', true, '2026-04-25 00:32:00.559223+00', '2026-06-18 03:00:09.061763+00', NULL, NULL, '3 Bedrooms', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'complete', false, NULL),
	('bcb59863-cae1-4c02-8588-5094a01b1d80', 'nt131345017', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/131345017.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '2 Bedrooms Fully Furnished Apartment for Rent at Vinhomes Grand Park', 'Nguyễn Xiển, Long Thạnh Mỹ Ward, Thủ Đức City, Ho Chi Minh City', 'nguyn xin long thnh m ward th c city ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 8500000, '8.5 triệu/tháng', '70 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment at Vinhomes Grand Park offers a spacious 70 m² of living space, fully furnished with modern amenities. Located in the vibrant Thủ Đức City, this apartment is perfect for those seeking comfort and convenience. The property features a central park of 36 hectares, a swimming pool, gym, and free BBQ facilities, making it an ideal place for relaxation and leisure. The nearby Vincom shopping center, Vinmec hospital, and international schools add to the convenience of living in this community. The apartment is situated in a secure compound with 24/7 security, providing peace of mind for residents. Enjoy a civilized community with all amenities within reach. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and experience this beautiful home!', '{"Contemporary minimalist bedroom design","Efficient workspace with integrated storage solutions","Sleek multimedia storage and display solution","Natural light flooding through large windows","Breathtaking cityscape view from the balcony"}', '{"Fully Furnished","Swimming Pool",Gym,"BBQ Area","24/7 Security","Central Park"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131345017/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131345017/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131345017/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131345017/3