	('872116f7-bc3f-438a-9acd-0ceec7d93c03', 'nt131499888', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131499888.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Modern 2-Bedroom Apartment with Bitexco View for Rent in Saigon Royal Residence', '34-35 Ben Van Don, Ward 13, District 4, Ho Chi Minh City', '3435 ben van don ward 13 district 4 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 20000000, '20 million/month', '85 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment is located in the prestigious Saigon Royal Residence, offering a breathtaking view of the Bitexco Financial Tower. With a spacious area of 85 m², this modern apartment is fully furnished, allowing you to move in with just your suitcase. The apartment features two bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it perfect for families or professionals. The interior is designed to maximize natural light and space, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Residents can enjoy premium amenities including a swimming pool, gym, BBQ area, and lush gardens. The location is ideal, just a short distance from District 1 and District 7, with easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options. Don''t miss the chance to live in this beautiful apartment in a prime location!', '{"Inviting balcony with scenic views","Open-plan living area with stylish furnishings","Bright dining area with inspiring views","Sleek dining area for stylish entertaining","Inviting bedroom with expansive city views"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Full Furniture",Refrigerator,"Washing Machine",Sofa,Bed,Wardrobe,"Dining Table",TV,"Swimming Pool",Gym,"BBQ Area",Garden,"24/7 Security",Elevator,Parking,"Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131499888/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131499888/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/objec