	('7f81d5de-9d9f-4582-8ff2-4ad76b780b9f', 'nt131682785', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131682785.htm', 'De La Sol Apartment for Rent: 2 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms, 76m2 with High-End Furniture', 'Số 1, Tôn Thất Thuyết, Phường 18, Quận 4, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 1 tn tht thuyt phng 18 qun 4 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 25000000, '25 triệu/tháng', '76 m²', 'Discover this exquisite 76m2 apartment for rent in the prestigious De La Sol project, located at 1 Ton That Thuyet, Ward 18, District 4, Ho Chi Minh City. This spacious unit features 2 comfortable bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals seeking a luxurious living space. The apartment comes fully equipped with high-end furniture, ensuring a move-in ready experience with style and convenience. Situated on the 15th floor, residents can enjoy stunning views of the swimming pool, offering a serene and relaxing atmosphere. The De La Sol project provides a range of premium amenities including a fully equipped gym, a refreshing swimming pool, and a BBQ area, perfect for leisure and entertainment. Experience sophisticated urban living in one of Ho Chi Minh City''s most sought-after developments. A deposit of 50,000,000 VND is required.', '{"Sleek built-in storage with LED accent lighting","Sophisticated open-concept living and dining area","Contemporary design with sleek built-in storage","Inviting natural light through large windows","Built-in wardrobe maximizing storage efficiency"}', '{"2 bedrooms","2 bathrooms","High-end interior","Deposit: 50,000,000 VND","Floor 15","Block C",Gym,"Swimming Pool","BBQ area"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131682785/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131682785/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt13168