	('392784cb-e4e7-4044-8f73-57b0e0ddaf89', 'nt131770472', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-ba-trung-ha-noi/131770472.htm', 'Vibrant and Fully Furnished Studio with Balcony, Steps from Hanoi''s Universities', 'Phố Tạ Quang Bửu, Phường Bách Khoa, Quận Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội', 'ph t quang bu phng bch khoa qun hai b trng h ni', 'hanoi', 4800000, '4,8 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Discover a vibrant and fully furnished apartment on Tạ Quang Bửu, offering a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. This cozy 30m² space is thoughtfully designed with a modern aesthetic, featuring a bright and airy atmosphere thanks to its private balcony or large windows. The interior boasts a clean, contemporary feel with essential furnishings including a comfortable bed, wardrobe, air conditioning, water heater, washing machine, and dryer, ensuring a hassle-free living experience. The neutral color palette creates a serene backdrop, allowing you to personalize the space with your unique style. Imagine starting your day with a cup of coffee on your balcony, enjoying the fresh air, or unwinding after a busy day in this peaceful retreat. Located in the heart of the university district, it''s an ideal sanctuary for students, faculty, or young professionals seeking a quiet, clean, and civilized environment. The wide alley allows for car access right to the door, and the area is known for its excellent security and high intellectual community. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice for those who appreciate comfort, convenience, and a touch of modern elegance.', '{"Inviting dining space with stylish decor","Sleek marble bathroom with contemporary fixtures","Stylish dining nook for intimate gatherings"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Water Heater","Washing Machine",Dryer,Elevator,Balcony,Parking,"Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-proper