	('9cb7c169-e773-4cf7-8f4c-714bfd5584ee', 'nt131332988', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-chau-da-nang/131332988.htm', 'Luxury 1 Bedroom Apartment – Trưng Nữ Vương – Fully Furnished', 'Trưng Nữ Vương Street, Bình Thuận Ward, Hải Châu District, Da Nang', 'trng n vng street bnh thun ward hi chu district da nang', 'da_nang', 18000000, '18 million VND/month', '50 m²', 'This luxurious 1-bedroom apartment located on Trưng Nữ Vương Street in Da Nang offers a modern living experience with full amenities. The apartment features high-end furnishings and a stylish design, making it perfect for long-term residents seeking comfort and privacy. The unit includes a spacious bedroom, a well-equipped kitchen, and a cozy living area. Residents can enjoy a variety of amenities including 24/7 security cameras, high-speed WiFi, and a modern elevator. Additionally, there is a laundry facility with individual washing and drying machines for each room. The apartment is situated in a secure environment, ideal for those who value safety and convenience. The rental price is 18 million VND per month, and the apartment will be available for move-in starting April 10th. Contact us now to schedule a viewing and secure your new home!', '{"Bright natural light flooding the room","Efficient culinary workspace with modern appliances","Sleek modern kitchen with integrated appliances","Sleek black cabinetry with integrated appliances","Inviting social interaction space for gatherings"}', '{"Parking area","24/7 security cameras","High-speed WiFi","Modern elevator","Individual washing machine","Individual dryer","Weekly cleaning service","Queen Bed","Air Conditioning","Wall-mounted TV",Desk,Chair,Curtains,Lamp,Balcony,"Washing Machine","Kitchen Sink",Refrigerator,"Electric Stove","Dining Table","Dining Chairs","Modern Kitchen Appliances","Dining Area",Stove,"Kitchen Cabinets",Countertop,"Ample Storage Cabinets",Dishwasher,"Built-in Oven","Kitchen Appliances","Granite Counte