 ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Washing Machine", "Kitchen Sink", "Refrigerator", "Electric Stove", "Dining Table", "Dining Chairs", "Air Conditioning"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 7, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Efficient culinary workspace with modern appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This space embodies a sleek, modern kitchen with an efficient layout designed for culinary creativity. The dark cabinetry and marble countertops provide a sophisticated contrast, while the adjacent dining area invites social gatherings. The open floor plan fosters seamless movement, enhancing both cooking and entertaining experiences. Warm lighting complements the minimalist aesthetic, creating an inviting atmosphere. The presence of essential appliances like a washing machine and refrigerator adds practicality, making daily living effortless. This space perfectly balances style and functionality, ideal for the modern renter.", "suggested_amenities": ["Modern Kitchen Appliances", "Dining Area"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Stove", "Refrigerator", "Washing Machine", "Kitchen Sink", "Kitchen Cabinets", "Countertop"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 4, "urban": 6, "modern": 7, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 2}, "image_highlight": "Sleek modern kitchen with integrated appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen space embodies a sleek, modern aesthetic with dark cabinetry and clean lines, creating an inviting culinary hub. The layout promotes efficiency with an integrated stove and refrigerator, perfect for culinary creativity. The subtle lighting adds sophistication, while the minimalist design encourages a clutter-free environment, enhancing functionality. Ample storage cabinets provide organization, making it an ideal workspace for entertaining guests or preparing family meals. The overall atmosphere is one of contemporary elegance, setting the stage for both casual and sophisticated gatherings.", "suggested_amenities": ["Modern Kitchen Appliances", "Ample Storage Cabinets"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Stove", "Washing Machine", "Dishwasher", "Kitchen Sink", "Built-in Oven", "Kitchen Cabinets"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Sleek black cabinetry with integrated appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This modern kitchen features sleek black cabinetry paired with integrated appliances, exuding sophistication and style. The granite countertops provide ample space for culinary creativity and meal preparation. The efficient layout facilitates seamless workflow, ideal for both cooking and entertaining. Subtle lighting accents enhance the ambiance, while the minimalist design promotes a clutter-free environment. This kitchen is not just functional; it embodies an elevated lifestyle for aspiring home chefs.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "Granite Countertops"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Coffee Table", "Sofa", "Dining Table", "Dining Chairs", "Floor Lamp"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 6, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Inviting social interaction space for gatherings", "detailed_analysis": "This inviting living space is designed for social interaction, featuring a cozy sofa paired with stylish seating around a round dining table. The neutral color palette, complemented by the warm light from a floor lamp, creates a welcoming atmosphere perfect for entertaining. The layout encourages fluid movement between seating areas, making it ideal for casual gatherings or intimate dinners. With air conditioning for comfort, this space offers a balance of modern aesthetics and practical functionality, enhancing the overall living experience.", "suggested_amenities": ["Sofa", "Dining Table"], "suggested_activities": ["Entertaining guests", "Casual dining"]}]}', '2026-03-22 18:01:37.852+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-10 03:00:11.771+00', true, '2026-03-22 18:01:37.888869+00', '2026-06-14 15:31:45.804769+00', NULL, NULL, '1 Bedroom', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('6e5827a8-69a0-4c72-bc62-ab33b91e2559', 'nt131467134', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131467134.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxury 2 Bedroom Apartment for Rent in The Era Town, District 7', '15B Extended Road, Phu My Ward, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City', '15b extended road phu my ward district 7 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 11000000, '11 triệu/tháng', '75 m²', 'This luxurious 2-bedroom apartment is located in the prestigious Era Town project in District 7, Ho Chi Minh City. With a spacious area of 75 square meters, this apartment features a modern design and high-end furnishings. The apartment includes two bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals seeking comfort and convenience. The unit comes fully furnished, complete with a long balcony that offers stunning views. Residents will enjoy a secure living environment with 24/7 security and a range of amenities including a swimming pool, gym, parks, and supermarkets. The location is conveniently close to Phu My Hung, providing easy access to the city center and surrounding areas. Don''t miss the opportunity to live in this upscale community!', '{"Expansive views through floor-to-ceiling windows","Breathtaking cityscape and water views","Panoramic views of vibrant city and lush landscape","Dedicated laundry space for effortless chores"}', '{"Swimming Pool",Gym,Park,Supermarket,"24/7 Security"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131467134/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131467134/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131467134/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131467134/3.jpg}', 'Hung Phuc', NULL, NULL, '{"colors": [], "styles": [], "activities": [], "