	('822b1d54-676f-4d71-b006-da9f21098e9e', 'pr43663449', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-pho-ton-duc-thang-phuong-ben-nghe-vinhomes-golden-river-ba-son/chuyen-cho-ch-bason-gia-tot-nhat-tt-1pn-17tr-2pn-19tr-3pn-28tr-lh-xem-nha-24-7-pr43663449', '200 Apartments for Rent at Vinhomes Ba Son - Great Prices 1BR-18M, 2BR-20M, 3BR-28M, 4BR-50M - View Anytime 24/7', 'Vinhomes Golden River Ba Son, Ton Duc Thang Street, Ben Nghe Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', 'vinhomes golden river ba son ton duc thang street ben nghe ward district 1 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 20000000, '20 million/month', '90 m²', 'Discover the perfect blend of luxury and convenience at Vinhomes Golden River Ba Son. This stunning 2-bedroom apartment offers a spacious 90 m² layout, ideal for both relaxation and entertainment. With a competitive rental price of 20 million VND per month, this property is a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a modern living experience in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. The apartment features contemporary design elements, ample natural light, and access to a range of high-end amenities. Residents can enjoy 24/7 access for viewings, making it easy to explore this beautiful home at your convenience. Located in the vibrant District 1, you will be just steps away from shopping, dining, and cultural attractions, ensuring that you are always at the center of the action.', '{"Breathtaking skyline views from expansive windows","Breathtaking panoramic city views","Breathtaking waterfront panorama with vibrant cityscape","Inviting social gathering space with vibrant decor","Serene sleep sanctuary with panoramic views"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"24/7 Security",Gym,"Swimming Pool",Parking}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr43663449/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/batdongsan-pr43663449/1.jpg,https://gbgrw