here are built-in storage cabinets that provide a minimalist aesthetic, complemented by a sleek white finish. The room is designed for efficiency, with ample storage space and a clean layout, making it ideal for relaxation or reading.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Wi-Fi"], "suggested_activities": ["Reading", "Relaxing"]}]}', '2026-03-28 05:09:57.012+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-20 03:00:02.18+00', true, '2026-03-28 05:09:57.060404+00', '2026-06-20 03:00:02.252834+00', NULL, NULL, '3 Bedrooms', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('312a6282-ae33-4435-9120-cbd89501466c', 'nt130987519', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-bat-dong-san-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/130987519.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Service Apartment for Rent in Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'Lê Quang Định Street, Ward 1, Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'l quang nh street ward 1 go vap district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 4900000, '4.9 triệu/tháng', '25m²', 'This charming studio apartment is located on Lê Quang Định Street in Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City, and is available for rent at an affordable price of 4.9 million VND per month. The apartment spans 25 square meters and is fully furnished, providing a comfortable living space for individuals or couples. The rental price includes various amenities such as air conditioning, WiFi, and essential furniture including a desk, chairs, and a wardrobe. Residents will also benefit from additional services like a shared meeting room, pantry access, and cleaning services for common areas. Utilities such as water and electricity are reasonably priced, making this apartment an excellent choice for those seeking convenience and comfort in a vibrant neighborhood.', '{"Functional workspace with natural light","Functional dining area with stylish wooden furnishings","Chic workspace with natural decor accents","Efficient daily hygiene sanctuary","Functional dining area with natural light"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Fully Furnished","Meeting Room Access",Pantry,"Cleaning Service"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130987519/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130987519/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130987519/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130987519/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmyta