	('08d362b9-8177-479e-8dad-c92de996d169', 'nt131274046', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131274046.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxury 1-Bedroom Him Lam Apartment in District 7', 'Đường Hoàng Trọng Mậu, Phường Tân Hưng, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng hong trng mu phng tn hng qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 9500000, '9,5 triệu/tháng', '45 m²', 'Discover this exquisite 1-bedroom luxury apartment in the prestigious Him Lam area of District 7. Boasting a beautiful balcony, this 45 m² service apartment comes fully equipped with high-end furniture, offering a comfortable and stylish living experience. Residents will benefit from a spacious basement parking area and a wide array of amenities within the building. The location is highly convenient, situated on a vibrant street with numerous dining options and close to key landmarks such as RMIT University, Crescent Mall, Lotte Mart, Phú Mỹ Hưng, and easy access to District 4 and District 1. This apartment is perfect for individuals or couples seeking a premium lifestyle in a prime location. Contact us now for a consultation!', '{"Floor-to-ceiling windows with stunning city views","Sophisticated dining area with expansive outdoor views","Outdoor entertainment oasis with city skyline","Functional workspace with natural light","Spa-like retreat with modern fixtures and finishes"}', '{"Service apartment, mini apartment","45 m² area","Deposit contract","1 bedroom","1 bathroom","High-end interior","Deposit: 9,500,000 VND/month",Balcony,"Spacious basement parking","Full amenities"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131274046/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131274046/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131274046/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1