	('48f7abd9-43eb-42af-8b60-65477a9dd225', 'nt131559903', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-ba-trung-ha-noi/131559903.htm', 'Versatile Urban Sanctuary: Fully Furnished Mini-Apartments in Vibrant Hai Bà Trưng', 'Đường Nguyễn Khoái, Phường Bạch Đằng, Quận Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội', 'ng nguyn khoi phng bch ng qun hai b trng h ni', 'hanoi', 3600000, '3,6 triệu/tháng', '25 m²', 'Discover your ideal urban retreat in these thoughtfully designed mini-apartments, ranging from 20m² to 30m², nestled in the heart of Hai Bà Trưng. Step into a space where modern aesthetics meet practical living, perfect for students, professionals, or small families seeking comfort and convenience. Each unit boasts a contemporary design with a neutral color palette, creating a serene and inviting atmosphere. Natural light streams through large windows or private balconies in some units, offering a refreshing start to your day and a peaceful ambiance in the evenings. The fully equipped kitchenettes, complete with a stove and sink, invite you to explore your culinary creativity, while the sleek, enclosed bathrooms provide a private sanctuary. Imagine unwinding after a long day in a space that feels both stylish and functional, where every detail, from the comfortable bed to the dedicated workspace, supports your daily rhythm. The building itself offers a secure and independent living experience with elevator access, fingerprint door locks, and 24/7 security cameras, ensuring peace of mind. Located in the vibrant Đầm Trấu - Nguyễn Khoái area, you''re just moments away from major universities, hospitals, and the historic charm of Hồ Gươm and the Old Quarter. This is more than just an apartment; it''s a lifestyle choice for those who appreciate modern living in a dynamic urban setting.', '{"Functional workspace with ample storage options","Functional workspace with minimalist design","Efficient bathroom with modern amenities"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Water Heater",Bed,Wardrobe