	('62d9c9a3-d317-4e6a-972f-cedf20491ab5', 'nt131676708', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131676708.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Service Apartment for Rent - Great Price, Fully Furnished - District 7', '31, Đường Nguyễn Văn Linh, Phường Tân Thuận Tây, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '31 ng nguyn vn linh phng tn thun ty qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7200000, '7,2 triệu/tháng', '25 m²', 'Discover your ideal living space in District 7 with this fantastic service apartment, offering exceptional value and a full suite of amenities. Located at 31 Nguyen Van Linh, Tan Thuan Ward, Ho Chi Minh City, this apartment is perfect for those seeking comfort, convenience, and security. 

Starting from just 7.2 million VND per month, this fully furnished unit is ready for immediate move-in. Enjoy a bright and airy room with a window, ensuring a pleasant living environment. The apartment is meticulously maintained, providing a clean, safe, and long-term suitable home. 

Included services elevate your living experience: weekly bed linen changes, twice-weekly laundry service (under 7kg) with complimentary detergent and fabric softener, free initial bed linen wash, high-speed Wi-Fi, daily trash collection, and free drinking water. Air conditioning maintenance is also provided regularly. For those with vehicles, a free parking card is included (tenants are responsible for personal property security). 

With a limited number of units available, act fast to secure this beautiful apartment. Contact us today to arrange a viewing!', '{"Open layout with cozy seating area and kitchen","Stylish kitchen with efficient storage solutions","Efficient kitchen with sleek countertop space","Efficient storage solutions for organized living","Efficient kitchen storage and organization solutions"}', '{"Fully furnished",Window,"Weekly bed linen change","Laundry service (2 times/week, under 7kg)","Free detergent and fabric softener","Free initial bed linen wash","High-speed Wi-Fi","Trash collection","Free drinking water","Regular air conditioning maintenance","Free parking card","1 bedroom","1 bathroom","Deposit required (7,200,000 VND)","6th floor"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/4.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/5.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/6.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/7.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/8.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131676708/9.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nh