	('2862e908-8817-4c88-ae3b-6d2b91fea982', 'nt131667796', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-ba-dinh-ha-noi/131667796.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '1-Bedroom Apartment in Prime Ba Đình Center, Fully Equipped', '28, Phố Ông Ích Khiêm, Phường Điện Biên, Quận Ba Đình, Hà Nội', '28 ph ng ch khim phng in bin qun ba nh h ni', 'hanoi', 8800000, '8,8 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Discover this exceptional 1-bedroom serviced apartment located in the heart of Ba Đình, Hà Nội. This property offers a secure and prime location, fully equipped with modern conveniences. Spanning 50m², the apartment features a spacious living room, a well-appointed kitchen, a comfortable bedroom, a bathroom, and a balcony with multiple windows, ensuring ample natural light and ventilation. You won''t have to worry about cooking odors thanks to the sliding glass door separating the kitchen space. Free motorbike parking is available on the ground floor.

The apartment comes with high-end furnishings and private appliances, including a smart TV, washing machine, dryer, induction hob, range hood, refrigerator, two air conditioners, and a smart card lock. The ceiling lights offer three color modes for customizable ambiance. Situated at 28 Ông Ích Khiêm, Ba Đình, the property benefits from a wide alley that also leads to Lê Hồng Phong street and includes a playground. It''s just a 3-minute walk to Lăng Bác, Ngọc Hà market, and One Pillar Pagoda, and a 7-minute walk to Hanoi Centre (Tiến Bộ Plaza) shopping mall. The area is known for its excellent security and high intellectual standards, surrounded by government buildings and offices. Rent ranges from 8.8 to 9.3 million VND per month.', '{"Natural light through large windows enhances comfort","Stylish kitchenette with modern finishes","Inviting relaxation corner with stylish decor","Sleek modern kitchenette with minimalist design","Intimate dining area for culinary gatherings"}', '{"Serviced apartment","Mini apartment","1 bedroom","1 bathroom","High-end furniture","Living room",Kitchen,Balcony,"Free motorbike parking","Smart TV","Washing machine",Dryer,"Induction hob","Range hood",Refrigerator,"Air conditioning (2 units)","Smart card lock","3-mode ceiling lights",TV,"TV Stand","Coffee Table",Curtains,"Decorative Flowers","Large Windows",Sofa,Television,"Air Conditioning",Kitchenette,Wardrobe,Bed,"Kitchen Sink",Countertop,"Kitchen Cabinets",Stove,"Modern Backsplash","Dining Table",Chairs,"Wall Art"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131667796/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131667796/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131667796/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131667796/3.jpg,https://gbgr