	('e7082296-5987-4df9-9f34-7ea0c068d3b9', 'nt131224836', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131224836.htm', 'Mỹ Cảnh 108m2 - Phú Mỹ Hưng 2 Bedrooms 2 Bathrooms Apartment for Rent', 'Hà Huy Tập, Tân Phong Ward, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City', 'h huy tp tn phong ward district 7 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 13000000, '13 triệu/tháng', '91 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment is located in the desirable Mỹ Cảnh complex in Phú Mỹ Hưng, District 7. With a spacious area of 91 m², this apartment features a well-designed layout that includes a living room, kitchen, and a private garden area. The apartment is situated on the 4th floor and is a corner unit, providing ample natural light and a pleasant view. It comes equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, a washing machine, an electric stove, and a water heater. The monthly management fee is 972,000 VND, and there is free parking available for two motorbikes. The rental price is negotiable at 13 million VND per month. Please note that the owner is not interested in working with brokers or marketing agents. Contact for more details.', '{"Contemporary facade with expansive windows","Multipurpose workspace with built-in storage","Vibrant dining area for social gatherings","Inviting balcony with urban views","Bright and airy space with stunning urban views"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Refrigerator,"Washing Machine","Electric Stove","Water Heater"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131224836/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131224836/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131224836/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131224836/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supa