	('da61fbcb-d1eb-473b-8d4e-a82a25a57132', 'nt111234943', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/111234943.htm', '🚨Grand Opening: 2BR Fully Furnished Apartment in Le Hong Phong, near Nga 7 Ly Thai To🌳', 'Lý Thái Tổ, Phường 10, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'l thi t phng 10 qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 10500000, '10,5 triệu/tháng', '65 m²', 'Discover this newly opened, fully furnished 2-bedroom apartment with a balcony, located conveniently near Le Hong Phong in District 10. Starting from just 10.5 million VND per month, this apartment offers exceptional value in a prime location. Situated in a central area, it provides easy access to various districts and is surrounded by essential amenities such as supermarkets and convenience stores like Vinmart, Family Mart, and Ministop. The apartment boasts a spacious balcony, perfect for enjoying natural light and fresh air. It comes fully equipped with modern conveniences and furniture, including a TV, air conditioning, and a refrigerator, ensuring a comfortable living experience from day one. Residents will appreciate the high-security environment and friendly community. The building offers a large basement parking area with 24/7 security and a fast, high-quality elevator. Laundry facilities are also available on-site. We have a wide range of other apartments across Ho Chi Minh City, including studio, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom units, with prices varying based on location, size, and view. Contact Phu via phone or Zalo for more information and to schedule a viewing!', '{"Bright open space with decorative ceiling accents","Serene natural light streaming through large windows","Elegant decorative ceiling design enhancing ambiance","Efficient laundry corner with modern appliances","Comfortable sleeping area with calming decor"}', '{"Fully furnished",Balcony,TV,"Air conditioning",Refrigerator,"Basement parking","24/7 security",Elevator,"On-site laundry","2 bedrooms","1 bathroom","Large Windows