"styles": ["Elegant", "Modern", "Luxurious"], "elegant": 8, "colorful": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests", "Dining", "Socializing", "Evening relaxation"], "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 8, "image_analyses": [{"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Stove", "Microwave", "Dishwasher", "Kitchen Sink", "Cabinets", "Countertops", "Wine Rack", "Lighting"], "image_index": 0, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Bright and airy culinary creativity hub", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen space exudes a bright, modern aesthetic with its sleek cabinetry and polished countertops, creating an inviting culinary creativity hub. The combination of abundant natural light and a spacious layout enhances functionality, making it perfect for cooking and entertaining. The wine rack adds a touch of sophistication, while the integrated appliances promote effortless living. The overall design encourages a seamless flow, making it a delightful environment for both everyday meals and special gatherings.", "suggested_amenities": ["Modern Kitchen Appliances", "Open Kitchen Design"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Dining Table", "Sofa", "Large Windows", "Coffee Table", "Chandelier"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 8, "urban": 6, "modern": 5, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Inviting dining space for memorable gatherings", "detailed_analysis": "This vibrant living space exudes warmth with its cozy dining area and inviting sofa, ideal for gathering with family and friends. The large windows flood the area with natural light, enhancing the cheerful atmosphere. With tasteful decor elements like woven light fixtures and decorative mirrors, the space feels both stylish and welcoming. The open layout fosters a sense of connectivity, making it perfect for entertaining or simply enjoying a meal in a comfortable setting.", "suggested_amenities": ["Dining Table", "Sofa"], "suggested_activities": ["Dining", "Socializing"]}, {"amenities": [], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 9, "modern": 8, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 8, "luxurious": 9, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 10}, "image_highlight": "Breathtaking sunset views over the city skyline", "detailed_analysis": "This image captures a stunning urban landscape bathed in the warm hues of sunset, showcasing a blend of modern high-rises and tranquil waterways. The expansive view creates a sense of openness and peace, perfect for unwinding after a long day. The vibrant colors evoke a feeling of inspiration and creativity, making it an ideal backdrop for relaxation or social gatherings. The seamless connection between the natural beauty of the sunset and the urban environment offers a unique lifestyle upgrade, enhancing daily living with picturesque moments.", "suggested_amenities": [], "suggested_activities": ["Evening relaxation", "Photography sessions"]}, {"amenities": ["Bed", "Nightstand", "Wardrobe", "Decorative Shelves", "Closet"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 4, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Vibrant color scheme with energizing aesthetics", "detailed_analysis": "This bedroom features a vibrant yellow and blue color palette that instantly energizes the space, creating a lively atmosphere. The blue bed frame contrasts beautifully with the bright bedding, while the decorative shelves add a touch of personality and organization. Ample storage provided by the wardrobe and closet enhances functionality, ensuring a clutter-free environment. The room''s layout and natural light contribute to a welcoming and uplifting mood, making it an ideal personal sanctuary for relaxation and creativity.", "suggested_amenities": ["Decorative Shelves", "Wardrobe"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Personal organization"]}, {"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Stove", "Oven", "Microwave", "Dishwasher", "Kitchen Island", "Dining Table", "Dining Chairs", "Pendant Lights", "Cabinets"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 8}, "image_highlight": "Elegant kitchen island for culinary creativity", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen space exudes elegance with its modern design and bright ambiance. The kitchen island serves as a central hub for culinary creativity, making it perfect for both meal preparation and casual dining. Ample cabinetry and sleek countertops enhance functionality while providing organized storage. The warm wooden dining chairs complement the light color palette, creating an inviting atmosphere for gatherings. Pendant lighting above the island adds a stylish touch, emphasizing the sophisticated design elements. Overall, the flow of the space encourages both productivity and social interaction.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Island", "Dining Table"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking", "Entertaining"]}]}', '2026-04-07 10:30:36.58+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-17 03:00:03.912+00', true, '2026-04-07 10:30:36.559271+00', '2026-06-17 03:00:03.914955+00', NULL, NULL, '1 Bedroom', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('faa6ea54-d1fe-4331-a2cb-46c7190427d2', 'nt131984452', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131984452.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Duplex Retreat with Private Laundry in Quận 7', 'Đường Nguyễn Thị Thập, Phường Tân Phú, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng nguyn th thp phng tn ph qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 4900000, '4,9 triệu/tháng', '32 m²', 'Step into this charming duplex retreat located in the vibrant Quận 7, where modern living meets comfort. With a generous height of 2 meters, the space feels open and airy, perfect for those who appreciate a bright and inviting atmosphere. The apartment is fully furnished, featuring a cozy sofa, a washing machine for your convenience, and ample storage with a wardrobe and refrigerator. Natural light pours in through four windows, creating a warm and welcoming environment. The thoughtful layout allows for seamless daily rituals, whether it''s enjoying your morning coffee or hosting friends for a casual gathering. The building offers a large lobby, two elevators, and 24/7 security, ensuring a safe and comfortable living experience. This is not just a place to stay; it''s a lifestyle choice that embraces both relaxation and functionality.', '{"Cozy loft with wooden staircase and natural light","Bright space with a small dining table and plants","Open layout featuring a workspace and kitchen view","Modern kitchen with decorative tile backsplash"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"24/7 Security","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131984452/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131984452/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131984452/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co