	('a86ae2c0-be44-4722-b4a4-bf943b094c9a', 'nt128632734', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/128632734.htm', 'Stunning 2 Bedroom Apartment in District 3 with New Furniture', '380 Nam Kỳ Khởi Nghĩa, Võ Thị Sáu, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City', '380 nam k khi ngha v th su district 3 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 10000000, '10 triệu/tháng', '65 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment is located in the heart of District 3, Ho Chi Minh City. With a spacious area of 65 m², this apartment features brand new, high-end furniture and a modern design that is perfect for comfortable living. The apartment boasts a beautiful balcony with a great view, allowing for plenty of natural light and fresh air. The building is equipped with an elevator, making it easily accessible. The location is ideal, with convenient access to local amenities and public transport. Enjoy the luxury of having your car parked right at your doorstep. This is a perfect opportunity for anyone looking for a stylish and convenient living space in a vibrant area.', '{"Streamlined kitchen with modern finishes","Dedicated workspace with inspiring energy","Stylish dining area for intimate gatherings","Efficient kitchen with sleek cabinetry and appliances","Efficient workspace with natural light"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Elevator,Balcony,"High-end Furniture","Parking Space"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128632734/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128632734/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128632734/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128632734/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt128632734/4.jpg}', 'Vũ Megas', NULL, 'Mode