	('ef1e1cd8-af13-4201-84a7-4d7bbe991198', 'nt131317042', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/131317042.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxurious 2 Bedrooms Apartment with Stunning Park and River View', 'Nguyễn Xiển, Long Thạnh Mỹ Ward, Thủ Đức City, Ho Chi Minh City', 'nguyn xin long thnh m ward th c city ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 8000000, '8 triệu/tháng', '85 m²', 'Experience luxury living at The Beverly, a stunning 2-bedroom apartment located in the heart of Vinhomes Grand Park. This exquisite residence offers a breathtaking view of the 36-hectare park and the river, providing a serene and tranquil environment. The apartment features a spacious 85 m² layout, designed to maximize natural light and comfort. With high-end furnishings and a modern design, it is perfect for those seeking a sophisticated lifestyle. Enjoy exclusive amenities including a saltwater swimming pool, a state-of-the-art gym, and beautifully landscaped gardens. The location is unbeatable, with easy access to Vincom Mega Mall and direct connectivity to the vibrant park. This is not just a home; it''s a lifestyle choice.', '{"Stunning water view through large floor-to-ceiling windows","Vibrant water park with colorful slides and pools","Modern kitchen with sleek cabinetry and open layout","Spacious living area with elegant marble flooring","Panoramic view of landscaped parks and water features"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Swimming Pool",Gym,"Children''s Playground",Garden,Parking}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131317042/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131317042/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131317042/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt1313170