	('d4bcef2e-25c1-41ba-9db1-d0f9f29150e8', 'nt131310134', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-chau-da-nang/131310134.htm', '2 Bedroom Apartment for Rent at Da Nang Plaza - 16 Tran Phu', '6 Thach Thang, Thach Thang Ward, Hai Chau District, Da Nang', '6 thach thang thach thang ward hai chau district da nang', 'da_nang', 15000000, '15 triệu/tháng', '79 m²', 'This spacious 2-bedroom apartment located in the prestigious Da Nang Plaza offers a comfortable living experience in the heart of Da Nang. With a generous area of 79 m², the apartment is fully furnished, providing all the necessary amenities for a modern lifestyle. The unit features two well-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals seeking extra space. Residents will enjoy the convenience of living near the administrative center, public and international schools, shopping centers, and supermarkets. The apartment is equipped with utilities such as electricity and water, charged at state rates, ensuring affordability. Experience the vibrant lifestyle of Da Nang while enjoying the comfort of your own home.', '{"Bright corner window with scenic views","Dedicated workspace for productivity and focus","Sleek dining area for memorable gatherings","Sleek quartz countertops for culinary creativity"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Fully Furnished","Electricity and Water at State Rates",Bed,Wardrobe,TV,Window,Curtains,"Natural Light","Comfortable Bed",Desk,Chair,Mirror,"Storage Cabinets","Dining Table",Chairs,"Lighting Fixtures","Storage Cabinet",Refrigerator,"Built-in Oven",Stove,Dishwasher,Microwave,"Kitchen Cabinets","Kitchen Sink","Quartz Countertops","Modern Kitchen Design"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131310134/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131310134/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/