: 9, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 8, "minimalist": 10, "natural_light": 6}, "image_highlight": "Sleek quartz countertops for culinary creativity", "detailed_analysis": "This modern kitchen boasts sleek quartz countertops and minimalist cabinetry, creating an inviting culinary creativity hub. The clean lines and neutral palette reflect contemporary elegance, while the well-integrated appliances ensure functional efficiency. Large windows allow natural light to illuminate the space, enhancing the overall atmosphere. An open floor plan seamlessly connects the kitchen to a dining area, promoting social interactions during meal preparations. The sophisticated design not only elevates cooking experiences but also serves as a stylish backdrop for entertaining guests.", "suggested_amenities": ["Built-in Oven", "Dishwasher"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Hosting intimate dinner parties"]}]}', '2026-03-20 17:34:41.046+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-13 03:00:10.729+00', true, '2026-03-20 17:34:41.152504+00', '2026-06-14 15:31:45.804769+00', NULL, NULL, '2 Bedrooms', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
