	('35b43b6f-03b8-4e55-8a97-c7c14d31fa15', 'nt131809541', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-dong-da-ha-noi/131809541.htm', 'Charming 1-Bedroom Retreat with Balcony Overlooking Hồ Đống Đa', 'Phố Thái Hà, Phường Trung Liệt, Quận Đống Đa, Hà Nội', 'ph thi h phng trung lit qun ng a h ni', 'hanoi', 12000000, '12 triệu/tháng', '50 m²', 'Discover a beautifully appointed 1-bedroom apartment, fully furnished and ready for you to call home, boasting a fantastic balcony with views directly overlooking Hồ Đống Đa. This space is designed for comfort and convenience, featuring a bright and airy living area that flows seamlessly into a well-equipped kitchen. The full furnishings, as depicted in the images, ensure a hassle-free move-in experience, allowing you to immediately enjoy the serene atmosphere. The highlight is undoubtedly the super-airy balcony, perfect for morning coffee, evening relaxation, or simply enjoying the vibrant surroundings. With elevator access, a robust fire protection system, and 24/7 camera surveillance and security, peace of mind is guaranteed. This apartment offers a harmonious blend of modern living and a tranquil lakeside setting, ideal for those seeking a stylish and secure urban retreat.', '{"Open layout with seamless indoor-outdoor flow","Versatile living area for relaxation or work","Premium living space feature","Inviting lounging area for relaxation and socializing","Premium living space feature"}', '{"Fully Furnished",Balcony,Elevator,Stairs,"Fire Protection System","Security Camera","24/7 Security","Air Conditioning","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131809541/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131809541/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt