	('c4c49994-0cf3-4129-87da-17c1e33ba586', 'nt131500409', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131500409.htm', 'Spacious Fully Furnished Apartment with Balcony in the Heart of District 7', '77 Street, Tan Quy Ward, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City', '77 street tan quy ward district 7 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 7500000, '7.5 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'This spacious 1-bedroom apartment is located in the heart of District 7, Ho Chi Minh City, on 77 Street in Tan Quy Ward. It features a modern design with full furnishings, ensuring a comfortable living experience. The apartment boasts a large balcony that allows for plenty of natural light and fresh air. The building includes an elevator and a spacious parking area. Residents enjoy the freedom of access at any time and benefit from fire safety standards. The surrounding area is secure and quiet, with a high standard of living. It is conveniently located near various dining options, supermarkets, pharmacies, and banks. Additionally, it is close to educational institutions such as Ton Duc Thang University and RMIT University, making it ideal for students and professionals alike. Contact us for a free consultation and to schedule a viewing.', '{"Abundant natural light through large windows","Serene sleep sanctuary with abundant greenery","Intimate dining setup for cozy meals","Inviting dining setup for intimate gatherings","Bright and airy urban retreat with tranquil views"}', '{"Fully Furnished",Balcony,Elevator,Parking,"Fire Safety","Air Conditioning","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131500409/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131500409/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131500409/2.jpg,https://gbgrw