	('d946e2af-53ff-4637-add7-9b65f49e853e', 'pr40950683', 'batdongsan', 'https://batdongsan.com.vn/cho-thue-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-golden-river-ba-son-phuong-sai-gon-tp-ho-chi-minh/chuyen-cho-bason-1-2-3-4pn-gia-tot-nhat-pr40950683', 'Rent 2 Bedrooms Apartment at Vinhomes Golden River Ba Son - Best Price Guarantee', 'Vinhomes Golden River Ba Son, Ton Duc Thang Street, Saigon Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', 'vinhomes golden river ba son ton duc thang street saigon ward district 1 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 26000000, '26 million/month', '77 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment located in Vinhomes Golden River Ba Son offers a spacious living area of 77 m², perfect for families or professionals looking for a comfortable home in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. The apartment is fully furnished with modern amenities including a sofa, dining table, beds, and a TV. It also features essential appliances such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, a water heater, and a washing machine. Residents can enjoy a beautiful balcony view and access to a bathtub for relaxation. The property is situated in a prime location with easy access to famous attractions like the Saigon Zoo, shopping centers, and hospitals. The area is well-connected with public transport, including the Metro line, ensuring convenient travel around the city. With 24/7 security and a vibrant community, this apartment is an ideal choice for those seeking a lively yet secure living environment.', '{"Expansive living area with natural light","Elegant chandelier illuminating the stylish living space","Spa-like bathing oasis with panoramic views","Sleek entertainment center with stunning views","Stunning city view from the elegant balcony"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Refrigerator,"Water Heater","Washing Machine","Cable TV",WiFi,Balcony,Bathtub,"24/7 Security","Dining Table",Chairs,Sofa,"Coffee Table","Lighting Fixtures","Large Windows","Marble Flooring","Kitchen Island",Chandelier,"Dining Chairs","Floor Lamp","