	('05d400d5-65f2-4e99-9afc-37fdecd7d55e', 'nt131469593', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/131469593.htm', 'For Rent: Fully Furnished Airbnb in Phan Xich Long Food Area', 'Phan Tay Ho Street, Ward 7, Phu Nhuan District, Ho Chi Minh City', 'phan tay ho street ward 7 phu nhuan district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 90000000, '90 triệu/tháng', '75 m²', 'This property is a fantastic opportunity for those looking to invest in a fully furnished Airbnb setup in the vibrant Phan Xich Long area of Phu Nhuan District. The building features a total of 12 rooms, with 10 available for immediate operation, including 6 rooms equipped with bathtubs. The property is designed for high occupancy and comes with premium furnishings, ready for guests to move in. The fire safety system is up to standard, ensuring a safe environment for all tenants. The lease agreement is set for 6 years with a 6-month deposit required. Setup time is 15 days from the handover date. This is an excellent chance to capitalize on the booming rental market in Ho Chi Minh City.', '{"Multi-functional space with sleek design","Functional lounge area for relaxation and socializing","Efficient workspace with stylish desk setup","Indulgent soaking tub with integrated bath tray","Entertainment-ready space with seamless tech integration"}', '{"Air Conditioning","High-end Furniture",Bathtub,"Fire Safety System",Bed,Sofa,Desk,Chair,TV,"Window Blinds",Artwork,"Coffee Table","Wall Art","Open Closet","Comfortable Sofa","Stylish Coffee Table",Wardrobe,Lighting,"Window Treatments","Bath Tray","Bath Products","Water Faucet","Glass of Wine","Luxury Bathtub","Large Screen TV","Smart TV",Workspace}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131469593/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131469593/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/stora