	('a4ba1e5f-8333-465a-bfec-1a5d78e045c2', 'nt131786294', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131786294.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Urban Retreat with Modern Comforts in Quận 10', 'Đường Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 13, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng t hin thnh phng 13 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 6000000, '6 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Step into a charming urban retreat nestled in the heart of Quận 10, where modern comforts meet a vibrant lifestyle. This beautifully designed 1-bedroom apartment boasts an airy layout, flooded with natural light through large windows that frame the bustling city outside. The contemporary decor features a soothing color palette, blending soft neutrals with pops of color, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Imagine sipping your morning coffee in the cozy living area, or hosting friends in the stylish kitchen equipped with essential appliances. The thoughtful design maximizes space, ensuring every corner is functional yet stylish. With a focus on comfort, this apartment is perfect for those seeking a serene escape while being close to the city''s dynamic energy. Enjoy the convenience of nearby shopping, dining, and cultural attractions, making this the ideal home for urban dwellers.', '{"Sun-soaked workspace with urban views","Inviting workspace with vibrant urban views","Bright workspace with open window to nature","Compact kitchenette for convenient meal prep","Inviting workspace with ample natural light"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Security Camera",Elevator,Parking,Desk,Chair,Kitchenette,"Large Windows",Wardrobe,"Work Desk",Refrigerator,Bed,"Window Treatments","Coffee Table",Flooring,"Natural Light","Kitchen Sink",Nightstand,Curtains}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131786294/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131786294/1.jpg,https: