	('5858ae0a-8fce-4314-98d6-c0c2befa745e', 'nt131465853', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-bat-dong-san-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/131465853.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '1 Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Gò Vấp, Ho Chi Minh City', '740 Phan Van Tri Street, Ward 10, Gò Vấp District, Ho Chi Minh City', '740 phan van tri street ward 10 g vp district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 7500000, '7.5 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'This charming 1-bedroom apartment is located in a quiet and secure area of Gò Vấp, Ho Chi Minh City. With a spacious layout of 35 m², it features a separate living room and a cozy bedroom, perfect for individuals or couples looking for a comfortable living space. The apartment is fully furnished with high-quality furniture including a bed, mattress, wardrobe, sofa, air conditioning, and refrigerator. Enjoy the fresh air from your own balcony, and benefit from modern amenities such as fingerprint access for enhanced security. The apartment is clean, modern, and ready for you to move in with just your suitcase. Ideal for working professionals or long-term residents, this apartment offers privacy and tranquility in a well-developed neighborhood.', '{"Efficient laundry and kitchen combo space","Efficient laundry and kitchen integration","Efficient multi-functional kitchen workspace","Bright, inviting workspace with natural light","Inviting workspace with ample natural light"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Balcony,"High-quality Furniture",Refrigerator,Sofa,Wardrobe,"Fingerprint Access","Free Access Hours","Washing Machine","Kitchen Sink",Stove,Countertop,Chair,Mirror,"Kitchen Hood",Cabinets,"Range Hood","Kitchen Appliances","In-unit Laundry","Queen Bed",Desk,"Dining Table","Natural Light",Curtains,"Large Windows"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131465853/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131465853/1.jpg,https://