	('9de4d17f-18bd-4de5-bc8d-8007bd87f096', 'nt131461369', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131461369.htm', 'For Rent: Sunrise City View Apartment – 2 Bedrooms with Eastern View for 20 Million VND', '33 Nguyen Huu Tho Street, Tan Hung Ward, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City', '33 nguyen huu tho street tan hung ward district 7 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 20000000, '20 triệu/tháng', '76 m²', 'This beautiful Sunrise City View apartment is available for rent, featuring 2 spacious bedrooms and an inviting eastern view. With a generous area of 76 square meters, this apartment is designed for comfort and convenience, making it an ideal choice for families or professionals working in the city center. The apartment is fully furnished with high-end amenities, including air conditioning, a refrigerator, washing machine, sofa, bed, and wardrobe, allowing you to move in immediately. The eastern orientation ensures plenty of natural light and a refreshing breeze throughout the day. The apartment is located in a civilized and secure community with 24/7 security and reception services. Residents can enjoy various on-site amenities such as a swimming pool, gym, children''s playground, supermarket, café, and restaurant, all conveniently located within the building. The location offers easy access to Districts 1, 4, 5, and 7, making commuting a breeze.', '{"Chic living area with modern decor elements","Inviting space for restful sleep and relaxation","Bright dining area perfect for intimate gatherings","Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances","Serene sleep environment with calming color palette"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Refrigerator,"Washing Machine",Sofa,Bed,Wardrobe,"Swimming Pool",Gym,"Children''s Playground",Supermarket,Café,Restaurant,"24/7 Security"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131461369/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/pub