	('103cbed5-3414-4510-90bf-b86dd5377410', 'nt131457936', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131457936.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '2 Bedrooms Apartment for Rent in District 10, Ho Chi Minh City - Fully Furnished', 'To Hien Thanh Street, Ward 15, District 10, Ho Chi Minh City', 'to hien thanh street ward 15 district 10 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 11000000, '11 million/month', '70m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment is located in the heart of District 10, Ho Chi Minh City, offering a spacious 70m² living area. The apartment is fully furnished with high-end furniture, ensuring a comfortable living experience. The building is secure and well-maintained, featuring a large parking area and a fingerprint access system for added security. The apartment is designed with a separate kitchen area, providing convenience for cooking and entertaining. With its peaceful surroundings and modern amenities, this apartment is perfect for families or professionals looking for a cozy home in the city. Don''t miss the opportunity to live in this beautiful space!', '{"Brightly lit open living space with modern decor","Sleek laundry area with modern appliances","Elegant entryway with stylish lighting features","Stylish lighting and modern decor throughout space","Stylish ceiling with ambient lighting"}', '{"High-end furniture","Large parking area","Fingerprint access system","Separate kitchen",Security}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131457936/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131457936/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131457936/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131457936/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exte