	('f36bf7c5-5c73-478c-98ca-aa141cff01b8', 'nt93347687', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/93347687.htm', 'Rent a Beautiful 2 Bedroom Apartment at Terra Royal, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City', '83, 83 Ly Chinh Thang Street, Vo Thi Sau Ward, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City', '83 83 ly chinh thang street vo thi sau ward district 3 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 15000000, '15 triệu/tháng', '58 m²', 'This stunning 2-bedroom apartment in the Terra Royal complex is available for rent at an attractive price of 15 million VND per month. Spanning 58 square meters, the apartment features a modern design with basic furnishings including curtains, air conditioning, and a kitchen. The unit is located on the 12th floor, providing a beautiful view and ample natural light. The apartment is perfect for those looking for a comfortable living space in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. The building offers excellent amenities such as a gym, swimming pool, and a cinema, ensuring a luxurious lifestyle. The location is convenient for commuting to District 1 and other nearby areas, making it ideal for professionals and families alike.', '{"Elegant dining area with modern lighting fixtures","Sleek walk-in shower with contemporary fixtures","Personalized study corner with natural light","Bright and inviting personal retreat","Functional kitchen layout for culinary creativity"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Gym,"Swimming Pool",Elevator,Security,Parking}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt93347687/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt93347687/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt93347687/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt93347687/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/obje