	('9224d538-3da2-400d-abdb-7d827bb8d809', 'nt131477856', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-bat-dong-san-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/131477856.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Mini Apartment Fully Furnished Near An Nhon Market', '28 Street, Ward 6, Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City', '28 street ward 6 go vap district ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 3500000, '3.5 triệu/tháng', '20 m²', 'This mini apartment is fully furnished and conveniently located near An Nhon Market in Go Vap District, Ho Chi Minh City. With a size of 20 m², it features one bedroom and is perfect for individuals or couples looking for a cozy living space. The apartment comes equipped with essential amenities including a kitchen shelf, air conditioning, wardrobe, solar water heater, bed, and refrigerator. Additional features include access to a parking area, an elevator, fingerprint door lock, and shared washing machine. Utility costs are reasonable, with electricity at 3,800 VND per kWh and water at 100,000 VND per person. The apartment is designed to accommodate a maximum of three people and two vehicles, making it an ideal choice for those seeking comfort and convenience in a bustling city.', '{"Minimalist design with functional living space","Functional kitchenette with sleek storage solutions","Efficient kitchenette for seamless meal prep","Serene minimalist bedroom with natural light","Functional kitchenette with modern appliances"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Kitchen Shelf",Wardrobe,"Solar Water Heater",Bed,Refrigerator,Parking,Elevator,"Fingerprint Door Lock","Shared Washing Machine"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131477856/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131477856/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131477856/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/obje