indows, creating an inviting atmosphere. The sleek design and contemporary aesthetic enhance the overall sophistication of the space. Ideal for casual dining or morning coffee, this area promotes social interaction while offering stunning panoramic city views, making it a perfect spot for unwinding or entertaining guests.", "suggested_amenities": ["Breakfast Bar", "City View"], "suggested_activities": ["Casual dining", "Morning coffee chats"]}, {"amenities": ["Stove", "Refrigerator", "Microwave", "Dishwasher", "Kitchen Island", "Bar Stools", "Granite Countertops", "Pendant Lights"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 4, "urban": 10, "modern": 9, "elegant": 10, "spacious": 8, "luxurious": 10, "minimalist": 6, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Sleek marble countertops with modern finishes", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen radiates elegance with its sleek marble countertops and modern finishes, creating a culinary playground that inspires creativity. Bright pendant lights accentuate the space, providing both functionality and style. The open layout seamlessly connects to the dining area, making it perfect for entertaining. Glossy cabinetry and a minimalist design enhance the airy ambiance, while large windows flood the room with natural light, elevating the overall mood and inviting a vibrant energy into daily cooking experiences.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "Breakfast Bar"], "suggested_activities": ["Entertaining guests", "Preparing gourmet meals"]}, {"amenities": ["Bar shelf", "Indoor plant", "Large hallway", "Recessed lighting"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 8, "modern": 8, "elegant": 9, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 9, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 6}, "image_highlight": "Elegant bar shelf for sophisticated entertaining", "detailed_analysis": "This hallway exudes elegance with its sophisticated bar shelf, complete with an array of spirits that invites social gatherings. The warm beige walls and polishe