	('b281c626-7b41-48d8-bb29-a279c9313e7e', 'nt131670157', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131670157.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Studio Apartment with Balcony, Elevator, Private Washing Machine - Flexible Hours', '131, Đường Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 13, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '131 ng t hin thnh phng 13 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Discover this charming 35m² studio apartment for rent, ideally located at 131 Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 13, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh. This prime location offers excellent connectivity, being close to Dân Chủ roundabout and providing easy access to Districts 1, 3, and 5. The apartment boasts a private balcony, perfect for enjoying fresh air and city views. 

