cases a modern bathroom featuring a sleek gray countertop with an integrated sink. The walls are adorned with white tiles accented by black grout, creating a minimalist aesthetic. A large oval mirror enhances the space, reflecting light and adding depth. The layout includes a shower area and a toilet, with open shelving for storage, making it functional and stylish. The overall design emphasizes cleanliness and contemporary style.", "suggested_amenities": ["Heated towel rack", "Storage cabinets"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Grooming"]}, {"amenities": ["built-in shelf", "large window", "wooden platform"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 7, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Built-in wooden shelf against the wall", "detailed_analysis": "The image showcases a bright living area with a large window and a unique oval design. A built-in wooden shelf is mounted on the wall, providing functional storage. The flooring features gray tiles, complementing the minimalist aesthetic. A wooden platform adds a cozy touch, suitable for various uses. The overall layout promotes an open feel, ideal for relaxation or social gatherings.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air conditioning", "Balcony"], "suggested_activities": ["Reading", "Relaxing", "Entertaining"]}, {"amenities": ["large window", "wooden shelf", "platform bed"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 6, "modern": 8, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Wooden platform bed with a soft mattress", "detailed_analysis": "The image features a minimalist room with a wooden platform bed topped with a soft mattress. The large window allows for abundant natural light, enhancing the airy feel of the space. A built-in wooden shelf adds functionality, while the overall design emphasizes clean lines and a modern aesthetic. The color palette is neutral