	('dd76d64d-84fb-4ade-a9d0-89c118a43af7', 'nt108162652', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/108162652.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxurious Urban Retreat with Stunning City Views', '334, Tô Hiến Thành, Phường 14, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '334 t hin thnh phng 14 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 17000000, '17 triệu/tháng', '79 m²', 'Step into a world of luxury and comfort in this stunning 2-bedroom apartment located in the heart of Quận 10. With a generous 79 m² of space, this urban retreat boasts breathtaking views of the city skyline, including the iconic Bitexco Tower. The interior is designed with a modern aesthetic, featuring high-end furnishings and a warm color palette that creates a cozy yet sophisticated atmosphere. Natural light floods the living area, enhancing the open layout that seamlessly connects the living room, dining area, and kitchen—perfect for hosting friends or enjoying quiet evenings at home. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the balcony while taking in the vibrant city life below. The apartment is equipped with all the amenities you need for a comfortable lifestyle, including a pool, gym, and BBQ area, making it an ideal choice for those seeking both relaxation and convenience.', '{"Vibrant orange sofa with playful decor","Sleek dining area with modern finishes","Elegant dining area with natural light","Sleek shower space for rejuvenating experiences","Sleek dining area with elegant lighting"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Parking,Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera",Sofa,"Coffee Table",Artwork,Curtains,"Floor Lamp","Dining Table","Dining Chairs",Refrigerator,"Kitchen Cabinets","Kitchen Sink",Countertop,"Lighting Fixtures","TV Stand","Large Windows","Storage Cabinet",Shower,"Bathroom Sink",Toilet,"Storage Shelves",Vanity,Mirror,"Modern Shower","Elegant Vanity","Wall-mounted TV","Decorative Wall Panels","Air Conditioning Unit","Modern Dining Table","Stylish Flo