	('801e8d48-258a-47fa-9ec7-47391b8efb71', 'nt132023697', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/132023697.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Corner Apartment Bathed in Natural Light', 'Phan Xích Long, Phường 7, Quận Phú Nhuận, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'phan xch long phng 7 qun ph nhun tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 11500000, '11.5 triệu/tháng', '62 m²', 'Welcome to your new home in the heart of Phan Xích Long, where charm meets comfort in this delightful corner apartment. Bathed in natural light, this space features large windows that invite the sun to dance across the warm, inviting interiors. The open layout is perfect for morning rituals, whether sipping coffee on the balcony or enjoying a cozy breakfast in the airy living area. With two spacious bedrooms, each thoughtfully designed to maximize comfort and tranquility, you’ll find the perfect retreat after a long day. The full furnishings include modern amenities, ensuring a seamless blend of style and functionality. Enjoy the convenience of a well-equipped kitchen, ideal for hosting friends or indulging in culinary adventures. The friendly community and attentive management add to the welcoming atmosphere, making this apartment not just a place to live, but a place to thrive.', '{"Chandelier with warm lighting above the dining area","Wooden bed frame with storage underneath mattress","Granite countertop with dark wooden cabinets"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"24/7 Security",refrigerator,desk,chair,curtains,TV,Wi-Fi,"Air conditioning",bed,shelves,fan,window,Bookshelf,Microwave,"Washing machine","Granite countertop","Wooden cabinets",Dishwasher}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt132023697/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt132023697/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/obje