	('ba94c1b2-9524-4218-8869-6dd6751f0bab', 'nt130267271', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/130267271.htm', 'Luxury Apartment for Rent at Saigon Pavillon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan - Q3', '53-55, Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Phường Võ Thị Sáu, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '5355 b huyn thanh quan phng v th su qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 45000000, '45 triệu/tháng', '150 m²', 'This luxurious apartment at Saigon Pavillon offers an expansive living space of 150 m², featuring 4 spacious bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms. The apartment is designed with high-end furnishings, ensuring a comfortable and stylish living experience. Located in the vibrant Quận 3 area of Ho Chi Minh City, this property is perfect for families or professionals seeking a spacious home. The apartment is available for rent at 45 million VND per month, with an option for short-term rental at 50 million VND. Enjoy the convenience of living in a well-equipped apartment with all necessary amenities. Contact us to schedule a viewing and experience the luxury of this stunning apartment.', '{"Infinity pool with stunning city skyline views","Fitness oasis with panoramic city views","Vibrant urban dining experience at doorstep","Vibrant urban dining experience with outdoor seating","Striking architectural design with expansive windows"}', '{"Air Conditioning","High-speed WiFi","Fully furnished","24/7 security","Parking space","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130267271/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130267271/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130267271/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130267271/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaks