	('9eb40976-aac1-4c9e-a9d2-431d60797898', 'nt131319422', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-chau-da-nang/131319422.htm', 'New 1 Bedroom Apartment with Balcony in Hai Chau', 'Duy Tan Street, Hoa Thuan Tay Ward, Hai Chau District, Da Nang', 'duy tan street hoa thuan tay ward hai chau district da nang', 'da_nang', 15000000, '15 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'This newly built 1-bedroom apartment is located in the vibrant Hai Chau district of Da Nang, offering a perfect blend of comfort and modern living. Spanning 40 m², the apartment features a spacious layout with a bright and airy atmosphere, thanks to its large windows and a generous balcony that invites natural light. The interior is fully furnished with essential amenities including a bed, mattress, TV, dining table, and kitchen utensils, making it ideal for immediate occupancy. The building is clean and well-maintained, providing a welcoming environment for residents. With a rental price of 15,000,000 VND per month, this apartment is a fantastic choice for those seeking a stylish and convenient living space in the heart of the city.', '{"Sleek kitchen with modern cabinetry and countertop.","Bright corner with large glass doors for natural light.","Minimalist layout featuring a built-in desk area.","Open kitchen design with integrated appliances visible.","View from window showcasing cityscape and greenery."}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Fully Furnished",TV,"Kitchen Utensils","Dining Table"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131319422/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131319422/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131319422/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131319422/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/st