	('7cce29d3-a67e-4afa-b204-2f14fa527597', 'nt131670982', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/131670982.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Vinhomes Grand Park Apartment for Rent - 2 Bedrooms, 60m² from 4 Million/month', 'Nguyễn Xiển, Phường Long Thạnh Mỹ (Quận 9 cũ), Thành phố Thủ Đức, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'nguyn xin phng long thnh m qun 9 c thnh ph th c tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 4000000, '4 triệu/tháng', '60 m²', 'Discover your new home at Vinhomes Grand Park, Thành phố Thủ Đức! This listing offers a wide selection of apartments for rent, with over 300 units available, starting from just 4 million VND per month. The featured apartment is a spacious 60m² unit with 2 bedrooms, perfect for individuals, couples, or small families seeking comfort and convenience. 

