iances", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "In-unit Laundry"]}, {"image_index": 1, "image_highlight": "Innovative loft-style sleeping solution", "suggested_amenities": ["Loft-style bed", "Desk"]}, {"image_index": 2, "image_highlight": "Inviting indoor-outdoor living space", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "Indoor Plants"]}, {"image_index": 3, "image_highlight": "Functional laundry area with modern appliances", "suggested_amenities": ["Washing Machine", "Kitchen Appliances"]}]}', '2026-03-22 15:32:02.116+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-10 03:00:10.82+00', true, '2026-03-22 15:32:02.115606+00', '2026-06-14 15:31:45.804769+00', NULL, NULL, '1 Bedroom', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
