	('b62cbb63-0069-41e8-904c-abeb143ec944', 'nt129616492', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/129616492.htm', 'SUPERB APARTMENT FOR RENT ON VO THI SAU STREET, FULL HIGH-END FURNITURE', 'Đường Võ Thị Sáu, Phường Võ Thị Sáu, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng v th su phng v th su qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 6500000, '6,5 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover this exquisite apartment for rent on Võ Thị Sáu, District 3, offering a blend of beauty, sophistication, and rarity that will captivate anyone who sees it. Located in the heart of District 3, this prime spot provides easy access to District 1, Phú Nhuận, and District 10 within minutes. The apartment is situated in a civilized, clean, and highly secure residential area.

This exceptional unit boasts a luxurious design and a modern layout, embodying the essence of a high-end mini-apartment. Enjoy abundant natural light thanks to large windows and a super airy balcony. The apartment comes fully furnished with brand new, high-quality furniture, meticulously set up exactly as shown in the pictures. For added convenience, some units include a private washing machine. The spacious and separate kitchen allows for comfortable cooking. Security is a top priority with 24/7 surveillance and fingerprint access, offering residents freedom of movement. Its convenient location is close to Hồ Con Rùa, Tân Định Market, bus routes, and supermarkets, making daily life effortless. This apartment is ideal for office workers, expatriates, and couples seeking a beautiful, clean, and well-equipped living space.', '{"Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes","Open plan living and dining space for gatherings","Inviting workspace with natural light","Intimate workspace with natural light","Bright and functional kitchen workspace"}', '{"1 Bedroom","1 Bathroom","Fully furnished",Balcony,"Washing machine (in some units)","Spacious kitchen","24/7 security","Fingerprint lock","Free hours","Legal document: Deposit contract"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/4.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt129616492/5.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v