	('26b3cc08-32f6-46f6-9ff2-5522324088f9', 'nt131649779', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-cau-giay-ha-noi/131649779.htm#px=sr-special_display_ad-[po-1][pl-default]', 'Corner 3-Bedroom Apartment in 30T2 Nam Trung Yen Tower with Full Furniture', 'Phố Nguyễn Chánh, Phường Yên Hoà, Quận Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội', 'ph nguyn chnh phng yn ho qun cu giy h ni', 'hanoi', 13500000, '13,5 triệu/tháng', '75 m²', 'Discover this spacious and bright corner apartment for rent in the prestigious 30T2 Nam Trung Yen Tower. Spanning 75m², this apartment features three comfortable bedrooms, a welcoming living room, and two modern bathrooms, offering ample space for families or professionals. As a corner unit, it benefits from excellent natural light and ventilation, creating a pleasant living environment.

