	('60a229d8-541d-4453-a3a1-85023851c4b1', 'nt131350264', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-ba-dinh-ha-noi/131350264.htm', 'Fully Furnished Apartment for Rent on Hoang Hoa Tham Street, Ba Dinh', 'Hoang Hoa Tham Street, Lieu Giai Ward, Ba Dinh District, Hanoi', 'hoang hoa tham street lieu giai ward ba dinh district hanoi', 'hanoi', 6900000, '6.9 million/month', '35 m²', 'This charming fully furnished apartment is located on Hoang Hoa Tham Street in the Ba Dinh district of Hanoi. With a spacious area of 35 square meters, the apartment features a well-designed layout that includes a living room, kitchen, and a separate bedroom. The apartment boasts a large balcony that offers a refreshing view and is equipped with a private washing machine for your convenience. The interior is tastefully decorated with high-quality furnishings, ensuring a comfortable living experience. The rental price is 6.9 million VND per month, with a one-month deposit required. The apartment is situated in a central location with easy access to transportation, making it ideal for those who value convenience. It is available for immediate move-in, and you can enjoy the freedom of your own space without shared ownership. Contact Nguyen Giang for more details and to schedule a viewing.', '{"Compact kitchen with modern appliances and design","Inviting atmosphere with calming wall art","Serene balcony retreat with lush greenery","Natural light streaming through sliding glass doors","Spa-like retreat for daily rejuvenation"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Washing Machine",Balcony,"High-quality Furniture","Weekly Cleaning Service",Refrigerator,Microwave,Stove,"Kitchen Sink","Dining Table",TV,Desk,Chair,Wardrobe,"Lighting Fixtures","Modern Kitchen Appliances","Queen Bed",Nightstand,"Wall Art","LED Lighting",Plants,View,"Outdoor space",Greenery,"Water Dispenser","Kitchen Cabinets",Bathtub,Shower,Toilet,"Bathroom Sink","Water Heater"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1