	('f56605a3-8f43-46a3-bdf0-5c861c2edd32', 'nt131531307', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/131531307.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charmington La Pointe Apartment for Rent - 181 Cao Thắng, District 10', 'Số 181, Cao Thắng, Phường 12, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 181 cao thng phng 12 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 13500000, '13,5 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover this charming studio apartment for rent at Charmington La Pointe, ideally located at 181 Cao Thắng, Phường 12, Quận 10 (now Phường Hoà Hưng), Tp Hồ Chí Minh. This 40m² studio is perfect for both living and business, offering a versatile space in a prime location. The apartment is available fully furnished for 13,500,000 VND/month, or unfurnished for 10,500,000 VND/month. Lease terms are flexible, ranging from 1-3 months or long-term for 6 months to 1 year.

Situated in Tower A, the apartment boasts an open view towards Cao Thắng Street and a refreshing Northeast orientation. It comes with brand new, unused furniture, ensuring a comfortable and modern living experience. Residents benefit from private magnetic card access to the elevator. The building offers excellent internal amenities, including a Co.op supermarket directly below Tower A, a gym on the 2nd floor, and a swimming pool on the 8th floor. The location is highly convenient, adjacent to the Á Châu International School, and just a short walk from popular cafes like Highland and The Coffee House, as well as various F&B establishments on Cao Thắng Street. This is an excellent opportunity for serious tenants.', '{"Functional kitchen with ample dining space","Productivity-focused workspace with natural light","Inviting dining area for social gatherings","Bright workspace with expansive city views","Inviting personal sanctuary with natural light"}', '{"Apartment type: Chung cư","Area: 40 m²","Bedrooms: 1 phòng","Bathrooms: 1 phòng","Furnishing: Nội thất đầy đủ (Fully furnished)","Balcony direction: Đông (East)","Deposit: 13.500.000 đ/tháng","Floor number: 3","Block/Tower: A","Supermarket (Co.op)",Gym,"Swimming pool","Magnetic card elevator access","Dining Table",Chairs,Refrigerator,"Kitchen Sink",Stove,Cabinet,"Wall Cabinets","Kitchen Appliances","Dining Furniture",Television,Desk,"Office Chair",Sofa,Wardrobe,TV,"Air Conditioning",Nightstand,Bed,"Decorative Plants",Chair,Window,"Natural Light","Queen Bed",Artwork}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131531307/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131531307/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131531307/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt13153130