", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "Dining Furniture"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking", "Dining"]}, {"amenities": ["Television", "Desk", "Office Chair", "Dining Table", "Refrigerator", "Sofa"], "image_index": 1, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 5, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 7, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 6}, "image_highlight": "Productivity-focused workspace with natural light", "detailed_analysis": "This living space exudes a modern, minimalist aesthetic featuring a well-integrated workspace complete with a desk and office chair positioned to benefit from ample natural light. The light wood flooring complements the contemporary design. A sleek television mounted on the wall enhances entertainment options, while the subtle decor adds a touch of elegance. This layout promotes a productive atmosphere, ensuring a seamless flow between working and relaxing. The overall environment is inviting and conducive to both focus and leisure.", "suggested_amenities": ["Office Chair", "Desk"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Studying"]}, {"amenities": ["Dining Table", "Chairs", "Wardrobe", "TV", "Air Conditioning", "Nightstand", "Bed", "Decorative Plants"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 5, "modern": 8, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 7, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Inviting dining area for social gatherings", "detailed_analysis": "This image highlights an inviting dining area featuring a clean, modern table with chairs that encourages social interactions. The warm wood flooring complements the neutral color palette, creating a cozy atmosphere. The layout promotes a seamless flow between dining and the living space, making it ideal for entertaining guests. The presence of decorative plants adds a touch of life and freshness, enhancing the overall aesthetic appeal. This area not only serves as a dining spot but also as a hub for connection and shared experiences.", "suggested_amenities": ["Dining Table", "Chairs"], "suggested_activities": ["Hosting dinner parties", "Casual dining with friends"]}, {"amenities": ["Desk", "Chair", "Window", "Bed"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 7, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Bright workspace with expansive city views", "detailed_analysis": "This room exemplifies a modern, minimalist design, featuring a functional workspace with a sleek desk and ergonomic chair. The large window floods the space with natural light, creating an uplifting atmosphere ideal for productivity. The neutral color palette enhances the sense of calm, while the urban view adds a dynamic backdrop to daily tasks. The layout promotes a seamless flow between work and rest, making it a perfect retreat for both focused study and relaxation.", "suggested_amenities": ["Desk", "Natural Light"], "suggested_activities": ["Studying", "Working"]}, {"amenities": ["Queen Bed", "Nightstand", "Wardrobe", "Artwork", "Natural Light"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 8, "urban": 6, "modern": 7, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 9, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Inviting personal sanctuary with natural light", "detailed_analysis": "This bedroom exudes a serene, minimalist vibe with a focus on comfort and tranquility. The queen bed, adorned with soft linens, invites restful nights, while the wooden nightstand complements the light wood flooring, enhancing the room''s warmth. A piece of artwork adds a touch of color, subtly uplifting the space. Large windows allow natural light to flood in, making the room feel airy and bright, perfect for relaxation or quiet reading. The layout promotes a sense of peace, creating a personal sanctuary for rejuvenation.", "suggested_amenities": ["Natural Light", "Queen Bed"], "suggested_activities": ["Resting", "Reading"]}]}', '2026-04-07 11:04:28.557+00', 