	('a03c32b7-509a-4ddc-b63f-5734757034ab', 'nt131039580', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131039580.htm', 'Cozy 1 Bedroom Apartment with Full Amenities in District 4', 'Tôn Thất Thuyết Street, Ward 15, District 4, Ho Chi Minh City', 'tn tht thuyt street ward 15 district 4 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 6800000, '6.8 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'This cozy 1-bedroom apartment is located in the vibrant District 4 of Ho Chi Minh City, offering a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. The apartment spans 35 square meters and is fully furnished with modern amenities, including air conditioning, a refrigerator, a washing machine, and a television. The living space is designed to maximize comfort, featuring a well-equipped kitchen with an induction stove, a comfortable bed, and stylish furniture. Security is a priority, with 24/7 guard service and CCTV surveillance. The location provides easy access to central districts, making it ideal for both work and leisure. Enjoy the freedom of flexible hours and a welcoming community atmosphere.', '{"Efficient kitchenette with vibrant accents","Loft-style sleeping area with stylish ladder access","Functional kitchenette with modern appliances","Bright turquoise backsplash with modern cabinetry","Dedicated workspace for productivity and focus"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Induction Stove",Refrigerator,"Washing Machine",Television,Wardrobe,"Shoe Rack","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131039580/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131039580/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131039580/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131039580/3.jpg,https://gbgr