	('4195b671-feb0-43c5-835c-593f9a59562b', 'nt131908454', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131908454.htm', 'Charming Studio with Spacious Balcony in the Heart of District 1', 'Đường Võ Thị Sáu, Phường Tân Định, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng v th su phng tn nh qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 10200000, '10,2 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Step into this charming studio apartment located in the vibrant heart of District 1, where modern comfort meets urban convenience. The spacious layout, approximately 40m², is bathed in natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere perfect for relaxation and productivity. The highlight of this space is the generous balcony, ideal for sipping morning coffee while soaking in the lively surroundings. The interior features high-end furnishings that blend style with functionality, making it easy to set up a cozy living area or a stylish workspace. With an elevator for easy access and a well-maintained environment, this studio is perfect for those seeking a comfortable living experience in a bustling city. Enjoy the convenience of nearby amenities while having a tranquil retreat to call home.', '{"Bright and airy living space with large windows","Bright and inviting open living space","Bright workspace with natural light and comfort","Inviting wardrobe for effortless organization","Versatile workspace for focused productivity"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,Elevator,Refrigerator,Microwave,Stove,Sink,Sofa,Bed,TV,"Dining Table",Curtains,"Natural Light","Smart TV","Coffee Table",Dresser,"Large Windows",Chairs,Desk,Chair,Wardrobe,"Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131908454/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131908454/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131908454/2.jpg,htt