 large windows that allow ample natural light. The minimalist design features a stylish sofa and a coffee table, perfect for casual gatherings or unwinding after a long day. A compact dining area encourages social interactions, while the light wood flooring adds to the inviting atmosphere. The ceiling fan enhances comfort, making this space an ideal spot for both relaxation and entertaining, seamlessly blending modern aesthetics with practical functionality.", "suggested_amenities": ["Large Windows", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Entertaining"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Desk", "Chair", "Large Windows", "Curtains"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Bright workspace with natural light and comfort", "detailed_analysis": "This space features a bright and inviting workspace, highlighted by large windows that flood the room with natural light, creating a productive atmosphere. The modern desk and ergonomic chair provide comfort for extended work sessions or reading. The minimalist design, with light wood flooring and neutral walls, enhances the sense of space while maintaining an elegant aesthetic. The air conditioning ensures comfort in any season, making this area an ideal retreat for focused work or leisure reading.", "suggested_amenities": ["Desk", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Wardrobe", "Sofa", "Coffee Table", "Air Conditioning", "Large Windows"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 7, "urban": 5, "modern": 6, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 9}, "image_highlight": "Inviting wardrobe for effortless organization", "detailed_analysis": "This space features an inviting wardrobe that enhances organization and storage with its sleek design. The light wood tones create a warm atmosphere, complemented by the natural light flooding in from the large windows. The layout offers an open flow, allowing for relaxation and productivity, making it ideal for both work and leisure. The modern fixtures and cozy elements together create a balanced ambiance that feels both sophisticated and welcoming.", "suggested_amenities": ["Wardrobe", "Sofa"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Relaxing"]}, {"amenities": ["Desk", "Chair", "Bed", "Sofa", "Refrigerator", "Air Conditioning", "Lighting Fixtures"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 7, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 5}, "image_highlight": "Versatile workspace for focused productivity", "detailed_analysis": "This inviting living space features a practical desk and chair setup, perfect for a focused work environment. The light wood flooring enhances the airy feel, while the soft color palette creates a calming atmosphere. A cozy sofa offers a comfortable spot for relaxation or casual meetings. The layout promotes a seamless flow between workspace and living area, catering to a modern lifestyle. Natural light floods the room, energizing the space and inspiring creativity.", "suggested_amenities": ["Desk", "Chair"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Reading"]}]}', '2026-04-19 05:03:05.633+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-23 03:00:08.872+00', true, '2026-04-19 05:03:09.917542+00', '2026-06-23 03:00:08.848311+00', NULL, NULL, 'Studio', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('3e42ed56-2fb6-4938-9fc5-e51120f15c91', 'nt131890026', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131890026.htm', 'Charming Urban Retreat with Full Amenities in the Heart of Quận 3', 'Đường Võ Thị Sáu, Phường Võ Thị Sáu, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng v th su phng v th su qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Step into this charming urban retreat located in the vibrant heart of Quận 3, where modern design meets comfort. This beautifully furnished 1-bedroom apartment boasts a spacious 40 m² layout, perfect for those who appreciate both style and functionality. The natural light floods through large windows, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere that is ideal for morning coffee rituals or cozy evenings at home. The contemporary decor features a soothing color palette and high-quality furnishings, ensuring a luxurious living experience. Enjoy the convenience of a fully equipped kitchen and a cozy living area that seamlessly flows into the bedroom, making it perfect for hosting friends or unwinding after a long day. With a private balcony offering a glimpse of the bustling city below, this apartment is not just a place to live, but a lifestyle to embrace. Located close to essential amenities and public transport, it’s the perfect spot for professionals seeking a peaceful yet connected living environment.', '{"Bright room with large window offering city views","Compact dining area with modern appliances visible","Open layout connecting kitchen and living space","Built-in storage and entertainment unit in bedroom","Balcony access with sunlight and fresh air"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,Elevator,"Security Camera"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131890026/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131890026/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v