	('f236041b-74d2-4cf7-967f-12b8364eeb56', 'nt131753943', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/131753943.htm', 'Charming Urban Retreat in Belleza Q7 with Stunning Views', 'Phạm Hữu Lầu, Phường Phú Mỹ, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'phm hu lu phng ph m qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '45 m²', 'Step into this charming urban retreat located in the sought-after Belleza Q7. This 1-bedroom apartment offers a perfect blend of comfort and style, with a spacious layout that invites natural light to dance across the modern interiors. The high floor location provides stunning views, making it an ideal spot for morning coffee or evening relaxation. The design features a warm color palette complemented by wooden furnishings, creating a cozy yet sophisticated atmosphere. With essential amenities like air conditioning and a fully equipped kitchen, this space is perfect for both remote work and hosting friends. The thoughtful layout ensures that every corner is utilized, making it feel both spacious and intimate. Experience the vibrant lifestyle of Quận 7 while enjoying the tranquility of your own stylish haven.', '{"Sleek chandelier illuminates spacious living area","Breathtaking panoramic cityscape view","Versatile multi-functional wooden platform","Culinary creativity hub with ample storage","Multi-functional wooden platform with storage drawers"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera",Chandelier,"Wall-mounted storage","Large tiled floor","Decorative mountain wall art","Wooden Platform","Tile Flooring","Kitchen Cabinets",Stove,"Kitchen Sink",Countertop,"Exhaust Fan","Built-in Storage",Drawers,Curtains,"LED Lighting"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131753943/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131753943/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcy