	('72f23b02-f7fc-4a99-81f4-b5ac6a479a42', 'nt131443170', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131443170.htm', 'Chic Urban Retreat in the Heart of Quận 4', '348, Bến Vân Đồn, Phường 1, Quận 4, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '348 bn vn n phng 1 qun 4 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 15000000, '15 triệu/tháng', '80 m²', 'Step into this chic urban retreat, where modern design meets comfort in the vibrant heart of Quận 4. This spacious 3-bedroom apartment offers a harmonious blend of style and functionality, perfect for both relaxation and entertaining. The open layout invites natural light to flood the living spaces, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. With a tasteful color palette and contemporary furnishings, every corner of this home exudes a sense of tranquility. Imagine sipping your morning coffee on the balcony, basking in the sunlight, or hosting friends in the stylish living area. The fully equipped kitchen makes meal prep a breeze, while the cozy bedrooms provide a peaceful sanctuary at the end of the day. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice that embraces the essence of urban living.', '{"Indoor-outdoor living with green wall feature","Vibrant patterned wall tiles energize the space","Tranquil retreat with calming color palette","Stylish dining area with artistic wall decor","Charming green wall with decorative accents"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Parking,Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131443170/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131443170/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131443170/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/e