	('e4350d83-8a97-4cab-abb2-e52db3288848', 'nt131730634', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131730634.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Chic Penthouse Retreat with Expansive Views and Serene Vibes', 'Đường Nguyễn Thị Minh Khai, Phường Bến Thành, Quận 1, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng nguyn th minh khai phng bn thnh qun 1 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 16900000, '16,9 triệu/tháng', '100 m²', 'Step into this chic penthouse that exudes a serene and stylish atmosphere, perfect for urban living. With a generous 100 m² layout, this space is designed to embrace natural light, featuring large windows and two spacious balconies that invite the outside in. The interior boasts a modern aesthetic with a harmonious blend of neutral tones and vibrant accents, creating a warm and inviting environment. Imagine sipping your morning coffee while basking in the sunlight streaming through the windows or hosting friends in the open living area that flows seamlessly into the kitchen. The penthouse is fully furnished with high-quality amenities, including air conditioning, a washing machine, and a private kitchen, ensuring comfort and convenience. Nestled in a peaceful neighborhood near Tao Dan Park, you’ll enjoy a tranquil retreat while being just moments away from the bustling heart of the city.', '{"Expansive rooftop terrace with city views","Open layout with abundant natural light","Sunset views from expansive windows","Functional workspace with natural light","Functional kitchen space for culinary creativity"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Washing Machine",Refrigerator,"Private Kitchen","Security Camera",Elevator}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131730634/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131730634/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131730634/2.