	('db9856c9-19a6-4361-af26-23ebe1996179', 'nt130157409', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/130157409.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Vinhomes Grand Park Apartment for Rent - 2 Bedrooms, 70m², Fully Furnished', 'Nguyễn Xiển, Phường Long Thạnh Mỹ (Quận 9 cũ), Thành phố Thủ Đức, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'nguyn xin phng long thnh m qun 9 c thnh ph th c tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 8000000, '8 triệu/tháng', '70 m²', 'Discover your ideal home at Vinhomes Grand Park, Thành phố Thủ Đức! This spacious 70m² apartment features 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, offering comfortable living in a vibrant community. The unit comes with high-end furniture, ensuring a move-in ready experience. As part of the prestigious Vinhomes Grand Park project, residents enjoy a wealth of amenities, including resort-standard internal landscapes and 5-star hotel-standard apartment lobbies. Stay active with free access to sports courts for basketball, volleyball, tennis, badminton, and football, as well as swimming pools. The complex also boasts the largest light park in Southeast Asia (36 hectares), perfect for outdoor gatherings and BBQs. With 24/7 security, free electric shuttle buses within the area every 5 minutes, and intercity buses every 15 minutes, convenience and safety are paramount. Management fees are competitive, and parking options are available for motorbikes and cars. Contact us today for a personalized viewing and find the perfect apartment to suit your needs!', '{"Stylish living area with modern amenities","Inviting social space with modern décor","Inviting workspace with stunning natural views","Seamless blend of comfort and functionality","Sleek kitchen with marble island and modern finishes"}', '{"2 bedrooms","2 bathrooms","High-end furniture","Deposit contract","Resort-standard internal landscape","5-star hotel-standard apartment lobby","Free sports courts (basketball, volleyball, tennis, badminton, football)","Free swimming pool"