	('70b0cfbd-bb55-4cc5-938a-62a763ea224d', 'nt131896754', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131896754.htm', 'Chic Urban Retreat in the Heart of Quận 3', '60, Đường Lý Chính Thắng, Phường Võ Thị Sáu, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '60 ng l chnh thng phng v th su qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 9000000, '9 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Step into this chic urban retreat, where modern design meets comfort in the vibrant heart of Quận 3. This newly built 1-bedroom apartment is a sanctuary of style, featuring high-end furnishings and a thoughtful layout that maximizes space and light. The open-plan living area is bathed in natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere perfect for morning coffee or evening relaxation. The sleek kitchen is equipped with top-of-the-line appliances, making it ideal for culinary enthusiasts. Enjoy the convenience of a fully furnished space, complete with air conditioning, a cozy bed, and ample storage. With a prime location just steps away from local cafes, parks, and markets, this apartment is perfect for those seeking a blend of urban living and tranquility. Experience the freedom of a flexible lifestyle with 24/7 security and amenities that cater to your every need.', '{"Bright and inviting workspace with natural light","Functional kitchen for culinary creativity and efficiency","Serene personal retreat with calming decor","Functional workspace with stylish desk and chair","Sleek modern kitchen with efficient layout"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Washing Machine",Elevator,"Security Camera",Bed,Desk,Chair,Wardrobe,Mirror,Window,Artwork,Refrigerator,Workspace,"Natural Light",Stove,"Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,"Dining Table","Kitchen Appliances","Decorative Art",Microwave,"Electric Kettle","Range Hood","Modern Kitchen"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131896754/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/ext