	('87b393ba-d82c-4d67-b7f3-a043c415b891', 'nt131648457', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131648457.htm', 'Spacious Mini Apartment with Large Balcony Right Next to Khanh Hoi Bridge', 'Đường Xóm Chiếu, Phường 13, Quận 4, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng xm chiu phng 13 qun 4 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 6500000, '6,5 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Discover this charming mini apartment for rent, ideally located right next to Khanh Hoi Bridge in District 4, Ho Chi Minh City. This 30 m² service apartment offers a comfortable living space with a large balcony, perfect for enjoying the city views and fresh air. The unit comes fully furnished, ensuring a hassle-free move-in experience. Residents will appreciate the freedom of flexible hours and no live-in landlord, providing a private and independent lifestyle. Safety is prioritized with 24/7 security cameras throughout the building. Additional conveniences include free parking for vehicles, a shared washing machine, and a dedicated drying area. With 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom, this apartment is an excellent choice for individuals or couples seeking a well-equipped and secure home in a vibrant urban area. The deposit is equivalent to one month''s rent, making it an accessible option for those looking to settle in quickly.', '{"Bright open space with natural light and balcony","Versatile workspace with natural light","Stylish entertainment setup with modern TV","Stylish glass partition for seamless room division","Sleek floating vanity with stylish mirror"}', '{"Fully furnished","Flexible hours","No live-in landlord","24/7 security camera","Free parking","Shared washing machine","Drying area"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131648457/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131648457/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-p