	('117ba747-e090-4685-835b-a01ee3551fec', 'nt131133166', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-ba-dinh-ha-noi/131133166.htm', 'Rental Apartment in Liễu Giai Tower, Ba Dinh District, Hanoi', '7 Kim Ma Thượng Street, Cong Vi Ward, Ba Dinh District, Hanoi', '7 kim ma thng street cong vi ward ba dinh district hanoi', 'hanoi', 7000000, '7 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'This charming 1-bedroom serviced apartment is located in the newly constructed Liễu Giai Tower in the heart of Ba Dinh District, Hanoi. With a total area of 30 m², the apartment is designed to provide a comfortable living space with high-end furnishings. The unit is situated on the second floor and is accessible via an elevator. The apartment is fully equipped with modern amenities and is ideal for individuals or couples looking for a cozy home. The location is convenient, being close to hospitals, schools, and markets, making it a perfect choice for those who value accessibility and comfort. The rental price is 7 million VND per month, which includes a deposit of the same amount. Don''t miss out on this opportunity to live in a prime location with all the necessary facilities.', '{"Integrated living and dining space with smart design","Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances","Compact workspace for efficient living","Breathtaking cityscape night view","Sleek glass shower with modern fixtures"}', '{Elevator,"High-end furnishings","Close to hospitals","Close to schools","Close to markets",Sofa,"Dining Table",Chairs,"Wall-mounted TV","Air Conditioning Unit","Kitchen Sink",Cabinet,"Decorative Artwork","Wood Flooring",Stove,Refrigerator,Microwave,TV,"Kitchen Cabinets","Coffee Maker","Modern Kitchen Appliances","Dining Space",Bed,"Air Conditioning",Lamp,Workspace,"Large Windows","City View","Potted Plants","Glass Shower Enclosure","Modern Toilet","Vanity Sink","Storage Shelves","Modern Bathroom Sink","Stylish Showerhead"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/publi