	('a9c725d9-dec6-42ef-be21-69ab6569c166', 'nt131315317', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-chau-da-nang/131315317.htm', 'Charming 1 Bedroom Apartment in the Heart of Hai Chau', 'Duy Tan Street, Hoa Cuong Bac Ward, Hai Chau District, Da Nang', 'duy tan street hoa cuong bac ward hai chau district da nang', 'da_nang', 15000000, '15 triệu/tháng', '45 m²', 'This charming 1-bedroom apartment is located in the heart of Hai Chau, Da Nang, offering a perfect blend of comfort and modern living. The apartment is brand new, featuring a contemporary design with ample natural light streaming through large windows. The living space is well-furnished with essential amenities including a bed, wardrobe, sofa, kitchen, refrigerator, and air conditioning. A private washing machine is also available for your convenience. Situated on Duy Tan Street, it is close to essential services such as hospitals, universities, and the airport, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a vibrant urban lifestyle. Enjoy the convenience of living in a central location with easy access to transportation and local attractions.', '{"Bright and airy kitchen with large windows","Sleek minimalist design with functional kitchen layout","Bright, open layout with abundant natural light","Sleek, built-in kitchen cabinets with modern finishes","Bright, minimalist design with abundant natural light"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Refrigerator,"Washing Machine",Sofa,Bed,Wardrobe,"Kitchen Sink",Cabinets,Countertops,"Large Windows",Stove,"Kitchen Cabinets",Sink,"Range Hood","Modern Kitchen Appliances","Ample Storage Space","Floor-to-ceiling Windows","Basic Kitchenette","Storage Closet","Built-in Kitchen Cabinets","Electric Stove","Modern Kitchen Sink","Large Wall Mirror","Ceramic Tile Flooring","Built-in Bed Frame","Storage Cabinet"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131315317/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase