	('7365089b-497e-4b00-a575-dbdf617b7efb', 'nt131360000', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-4-tp-ho-chi-minh/131360000.htm', 'Chic Urban Retreat in Saigon Royal Residence', 'Số 34-35, Bến Vân Đồn, Phường 13, Quận 4, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 3435 bn vn n phng 13 qun 4 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 21000000, '21 triệu/tháng', '60 m²', 'Step into a world of modern elegance in this chic 2-bedroom apartment at Saigon Royal Residence. Bathed in natural light, the open layout invites you to unwind in a stylish living space adorned with contemporary furnishings and a soothing color palette. Picture yourself enjoying morning coffee on the balcony, soaking in the vibrant city vibes, or hosting friends in the spacious living area that seamlessly flows into a well-equipped kitchen. The apartment boasts a harmonious blend of comfort and sophistication, making it the perfect urban retreat for those seeking a balance of relaxation and city life. With amenities like a refreshing pool and a state-of-the-art gym, every day feels like a getaway.', '{"Natural light flooding the open living space","Warm and inviting retreat with stylish decor","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes","Spa-inspired walk-in shower with modern finishes"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131360000/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131360000/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131360000/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131360000/3.jpg}', 'Tư vấn miễn phí 24/7', '096821 ***', NULL, '{"cozy": 6, "urban": 5, "colors": ["Warm", "Cool", "Bright",