	('1ded5495-2d7e-4f1d-b4aa-1db4143a211f', 'nt124374013', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-thanh-pho-thu-duc-tp-ho-chi-minh/124374013.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Beautiful 2 Bedroom Apartment with Stunning View for Rent', 'Nguyễn Xiển, Long Thạnh Mỹ Ward, Thu Duc City, Ho Chi Minh City', 'nguyn xin long thnh m ward thu duc city ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 6000000, '6 triệu/tháng', '69 m²', 'Experience resort-style living every day in this beautiful 2-bedroom apartment located in the prestigious Vinhomes Grand Park. Spanning 69 m², this apartment offers a stunning view that enhances your living experience. The apartment features two spacious bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it perfect for families or professionals seeking comfort and convenience. The property is situated in a high-class urban area with top-notch amenities available for residents. Enjoy a range of facilities within the community, all provided free of charge. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and see for yourself why this apartment is the perfect choice for you!', '{"Sleek kitchen island with integrated lighting","Serene balcony retreat for morning coffee","Resort-style pool and landscaped garden oasis","Sophisticated dining area for memorable gatherings","Sleek entertainment area with modern TV setup"}', '{"Air Conditioning","Free Community Amenities","Private Ownership Certificate"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt124374013/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt124374013/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt124374013/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt124374013/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage