	('f2d60299-9791-40f7-88d3-44bf34fc0971', 'nt131657489', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-hai-ba-trung-ha-noi/131657489.htm', 'For rent: Mini apartment room at 161B Dai La, fully furnished, with elevator, beautiful and affordable', '161B, Phố Đại La, Phường Đồng Tâm, Quận Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội', '161b ph i la phng ng tm qun hai b trng h ni', 'hanoi', 5500000, '5,5 triệu/tháng', '25 m²', 'Discover this charming mini apartment room for rent at 161B Đại La, Hà Nội. Perfectly situated in a central location, it offers easy access to prestigious universities such as Economics, Polytechnic, and Construction. This newly constructed building features fully equipped, self-contained rooms, complete with a modern fire protection system and a high-speed elevator for your convenience. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with essential items including air conditioning, water heater, bed, wardrobe, refrigerator, and kitchen facilities. The building also boasts a spacious ground-floor parking area and shared washing machines and dryers, making daily life incredibly convenient. Located just 5 meters from the main road, this apartment is an ideal choice for students or newlywed couples seeking comfort and accessibility. The rental price is 5.5 million VND per month. Don''t miss out on this fantastic opportunity!', '{"Efficient kitchen layout with essential appliances","Dedicated multi-use garage and storage area","Efficient modern bathroom with sleek fixtures","Efficient kitchen layout for culinary creativity","Efficient climate control for year-round comfort"}', '{"Service apartment, mini","25 m²","Private pink book (legal document)","1 bedroom","High-end interior","Southwest facing main door","Southwest facing balcony","Deposit: 5,500,000 VND/month","Floor number: 4","Block/Tower: 6",Elevator,"Fire protection system","Air conditioning","Water heater",Bed,Wardrobe,Refrigerator,Kitchen,"Motorbike parking","Washing machine",Dryer}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztc