	('2070af91-3987-4367-bf4b-b4d1439f6b18', 'nt131670983', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-phu-nhuan-tp-ho-chi-minh/131670983.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'FULLY FURNISHED APARTMENT IN PHÚ NHUẬN - ONLY 2.8 MILLION (INCLUDING ELECTRICITY, WATER, WIFI)', 'Đường Hồ Biểu Chánh, Phường 11, Quận Phú Nhuận, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng h biu chnh phng 11 qun ph nhun tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 2800000, '2,8 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'Discover this fully furnished apartment in the heart of Phú Nhuận, offering exceptional value at just 2.8 million VND per month, inclusive of electricity, water, and WiFi. This cozy and beautifully maintained apartment is perfect for male tenants looking for a convenient and comfortable living space. The unit features two smart bunk beds and a spacious living area within its 25m² footprint. It''s part of a larger apartment that will be shared with the male owner (who has a private room) and one other male tenant, making for a total of three occupants. The apartment boasts a private bathroom, a separate kitchen area, and a refreshing window for natural light and ventilation. Modern amenities include a refrigerator, air conditioning, water heater, and a full set of cooking utensils and dishes. Located at 14/2 Hồ Biểu Chánh, just 50m from Nguyễn Văn Trỗi street, this property offers excellent connectivity to District 1, major schools, banks, and Tân Sơn Nhất Airport. The building is secure and quiet, with 24/7 security. All utilities are covered in the rent, ensuring a hassle-free living experience. Just bring your suitcase and move right in!', '{"Wooden shelf with intricate design on ceiling","Unique bunk bed design with integrated storage","Geometric coffee table with gold metal base","Wall-mounted shelves for decorative items or storage","Wooden bench with smooth curved edges"}', '{"Fully Furnished","Electricity Included","Water Included","WiFi Included","Private Bathroom","Private Kitchen",Window,Refrigerator,"Air Cond