	('ea8b329a-143c-48ed-9860-2053c9e2e2f9', 'nt131577029', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131577029.htm', 'Charming 1-Bedroom Retreat with Balcony in the Heart of Quận 3', 'Đường Trần Văn Đang, Phường 9, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng trn vn ang phng 9 qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 10500000, '10,5 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Step into this charming 1-bedroom retreat nestled in the vibrant heart of Quận 3, where modern comfort meets cozy living. The apartment boasts a spacious layout, featuring a separate bedroom that offers a private sanctuary away from the hustle and bustle of city life. Natural light floods the living area through large windows, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere perfect for morning coffee or unwinding after a long day. The fully furnished space includes essential amenities such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a washing machine, ensuring a hassle-free living experience. Enjoy the fresh air and city views from your own balcony, a perfect spot for hosting friends or enjoying a quiet evening. With its prime location, you’ll have quick access to local cafes, shops, and parks, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a blend of convenience and tranquility. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle waiting to be embraced.', '{"Compact kitchen with modern appliances and dining area","Efficient laundry integration with kitchen space","Bright workspace with natural light and air conditioning","Efficient workspace with stylish desk and chair","Integrated laundry and kitchen for convenience"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Refrigerator,"Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131577029/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131577029/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdm