	('f1feea51-c456-4c51-9b89-2f15818d9872', 'nt118154359', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/118154359.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Charming Urban Retreat in the Heart of Quận 10', 'Số 181, Cao Thắng, Phường 12, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 181 cao thng phng 12 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 12000000, '12 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Step into this charming urban retreat, a 1-bedroom apartment that perfectly balances comfort and style in the vibrant Quận 10. Bathed in natural light, the space features a warm color palette with soft textures that create a welcoming atmosphere. The open layout encourages a seamless flow between living and dining areas, making it ideal for morning coffee rituals or hosting intimate gatherings with friends. The minimalist design is complemented by essential furnishings, ensuring a cozy yet functional living experience. Enjoy the convenience of nearby amenities, including a refreshing swimming pool, a well-equipped gym, and local shops, all within easy reach. This apartment is not just a place to live; it''s a lifestyle choice that embraces the essence of urban living.', '{"Green sofa contrasting with light wood tones","Artwork above the bed adds a vibrant touch","Shower area with sleek fixtures and light tiles","Small dining table with stylish chairs and candles","Wooden headboard complements the soft bedding colors"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,Balcony,"Washing Machine",Parking,Pool,Gym,Elevator,"Security Camera","Queen Bed","Bedside Table",Sofa,"Coffee Table",Desk,"Desk Chair","Wall Art","Large Windows","Indoor Plant","Natural Light","Modern Fixtures","Storage Cabinets","Lighting Fixtures",Shower,Toilet,"Bathroom Sink",Mirror,"Water Heater"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt118154359/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt118154359/1.jpg,https://gbg