	('2be0b12c-e6c5-4407-9566-0b9bad03be24', 'nt131450411', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-ba-dinh-ha-noi/131450411.htm', 'Rare Apartment for Rent with Direct West Lake View - Fully Furnished', 'B6, Nam Cao, Giang Vo Ward, Ba Dinh District, Hanoi', 'b6 nam cao giang vo ward ba dinh district hanoi', 'hanoi', 22000000, '22 triệu/tháng', '84 m²', 'This rare apartment offers a stunning direct view of West Lake, situated on the 18th floor of the prestigious B6 Giang Vo - The Golden Armor project. With a spacious area of 84 m², the apartment features 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals. The living space is designed with a flexible layout, including a sofa bed in the living room that can easily convert into an additional bedroom. Enjoy a tranquil environment with plenty of natural light and a high standard of living. The apartment comes fully furnished with high-end interior finishes, allowing you to move in immediately without the need for additional purchases. Located in the heart of Hanoi, it provides convenient access to various amenities and services in the surrounding area.', '{"Breathtaking sunset view from the balcony","Serene balcony oasis with lush greenery","Sunset view creating a calming ambiance"}', '{"Fully Furnished","High-end Interior","Direct Lake View","Quiet Environment","Natural Light","Convenient Location"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131450411/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131450411/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131450411/2.jpg}', 'Trần Thu Hà', NULL, NULL, '{"colors": [], "styles": [], "activities": [], "image_analyses": [{"image_index": 0, "image_highlight": "Breathtaking sunset view from the balcony", "suggested_amenities": ["Balcony", "View"]}, {"image_index": 