	('80d07d1f-b0f2-4e28-b5cb-d28a393798bc', 'nt130531805', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/130531805.htm', 'Charming 1 Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Viettel Building, District 3', 'Cách Mạng Tháng 8 Street, Ward 5, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City', 'cch mng thng 8 street ward 5 district 3 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 6000000, '6 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'This stylish 1-bedroom apartment is located in the modern Viettel building in District 3, Ho Chi Minh City. The apartment features a separate bedroom that offers a quiet and private space, perfect for relaxation. The kitchen is compact yet well-organized, equipped with essential appliances including a refrigerator, washing machine, and air conditioning. The living area is furnished with a comfortable sofa, dining table, and a TV, ensuring a cozy atmosphere. Large windows allow natural light to flood the space, enhancing the overall ambiance. The building provides several amenities such as an elevator, fingerprint access, security cameras, and regular cleaning services. Its prime location is close to the Democracy Square roundabout, Viettel building, local markets, and the Saigon train station, making it convenient for both work and leisure. Ideal for professionals or long-term tenants looking for a comfortable living space in the heart of the city.', '{"Premium living space feature","Unique round window with urban view","Sleek, modern kitchen with clever storage solutions","Premium living space feature","Premium living space feature"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Refrigerator,"Washing Machine",TV,Sofa,"Dining Table","Security Cameras",Elevator,"Fingerprint Access","Regular Cleaning Service"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130531805/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt130531805/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/objec