	('90d61714-ca50-48c1-9b19-82a3fd8642e8', 'nt129309675', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-7-tp-ho-chi-minh/129309675.htm', 'FOR RENT HIGH-CLASS APARTMENT FULLY FURNISHED 1 SEPARATE BEDROOM NEXT TO LOTTE MART Q7', 'Đường Số 79, Phường Tân Quy, Quận 7, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng s 79 phng tn quy qun 7 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 9000000, '9 triệu/tháng', '40 m²', 'Discover this high-class, fully furnished service apartment located in the vibrant center of District 7, Ho Chi Minh City. Situated on Đường số 79, this newly built apartment offers a comfortable and convenient living experience, perfect for those seeking a move-in ready home. The unit comes complete with all necessary furniture, allowing you to simply bring your suitcase and settle in. The surrounding area is bustling with amenities, including various convenience stores and dining options, ensuring all your daily needs are met. The building itself boasts a spacious basement parking area and an elevator for easy access. Safety is a priority, with a fire prevention and fighting system that meets all standard requirements. Its prime location provides excellent connectivity, being close to universities such as Tôn Đức Thắng University, RMIT University, and Marketing University, as well as Tân Thuận Export Processing Zone, Go! Nguyễn Thị Thập, Tân Hương market, and Lotte Mart District 7. This makes commuting to District 1, District 4, District 5, District 8, and other areas incredibly convenient. Contact Hoàng Thiện for free consultation and to schedule a viewing.', '{"Stylish seating area with modern decor","Sleek bathroom with modern shower design","Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances","Elegant workspace with natural light and comfort","Sleek media wall with integrated storage solutions"}', '{"Fully furnished","Service apartment","Basement parking",Elevator,"Fire prevention and fighting system (PCCC)","1 bedroom","1 bathroom","Legal document: Deposit contract",Sofa,"Coffee Tab