a and unique floor lamp, fosters a welcoming atmosphere. Large windows allow natural light to flood the space, promoting a vibrant and uplifting environment. The integration of urban design elements encourages both relaxation and social interaction, making it ideal for both personal retreats and entertaining guests.", "suggested_amenities": ["Modern Bathroom", "Cozy Living Area"], "suggested_activities": ["Refreshing showers", "Relaxing evenings with friends"]}, {"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Microwave", "Stove", "Coffee Maker", "Dining Table", "Sofa", "Potted Plants", "Lighting Fixture"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 8, "modern": 8, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 7, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Culinary creativity hub with modern appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This image showcases a modern kitchen and living area, seamlessly integrated for both functionality and style. The sleek, dark cabinetry complements the light countertops, creating a chic contrast. A round dining table offers an intimate space for meals, while the sofa invites relaxation. Potted plants add a touch of greenery, enhancing the inviting atmosphere. Thoughtfully placed lighting fixtures provide a warm glow, promoting a cozy vibe. This space flows effortlessly, making it perfect for culinary creativity and social gatherings.", "suggested_amenities": ["Modern Kitchen Appliances", "Dining Area"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking gourmet meals", "Entertaining guests"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Bed", "Wardrobe", "Large Windows", "Nightstand", "Desk", "Chair"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 5, "modern": 8, "elegant": 8, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 7, "minimalist": 5, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Elegant workspace with natural light and comfort", "detailed_analysis": "This bedroom space radiates a sophisticated yet cozy atmosphere, featuring a plush bed adorned with soft pillows. The elegant desk setup invites productivity, enhanced by natural light streaming through large windows. A stylish wardrobe and nightstand add functional elegance, while the climate control ensures year-round comfort. The use of sleek materials and warm tones creates a serene retreat, promoting both relaxation and focus, perfect for unwinding or working efficiently.", "suggested_amenities": ["Desk", "Chair"], "suggested_activities": ["Working", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Wall-mounted TV", "Stylish storage cabinet", "Full-length mirror"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 7, "modern": 7, "elegant": 6, "spacious": 6, "luxurious": 5, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 4}, "image_highlight": "Sleek media wall with integrated storage solutions", "detailed_analysis": "This modern bedroom showcases a sleek media wall, integrating a wall-mounted TV and stylish storage solutions that enhance functionality without compromising aesthetics. The minimalist design is complemented by a cozy bed and a full-length mirror, creating a sense of space and openness. The warm wood tones of the furniture contrast beautifully with the dark accent wall, fostering a serene and inviting atmosphere. This space is perfect for both relaxation and entertainment, allowing for easy unwinding after a long day.", "suggested_amenities": ["Media Setup", "Storage Solutions"], "suggested_activities": ["Watching movies", "Relaxing with style"]}]}', '2026-04-07 10:31:51.492+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-14 03:00:12.449+00', true, '2026-04-07 10:31:51.550028+00', '2026-06-14 15:31:45.804769+00', NULL, NULL, '1 Bedroom', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
