	('58b47f05-aa2a-4526-8afd-550268fae64e', 'nt131050708', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-dong-da-ha-noi/131050708.htm', 'Newly Opened Fully Furnished Studio Apartment with Private Washing Machine on Kim Hoa Street', '105 Kim Hoa Street, Phuong Lien Ward, Dong Da District, Hanoi', '105 kim hoa street phuong lien ward dong da district hanoi', 'hanoi', 5000000, '5 triệu/tháng', '30 m²', 'This newly opened studio apartment is fully furnished and features a private washing machine, making it an ideal choice for those seeking convenience and comfort. Located on Kim Hoa Street in the heart of Dong Da District, this apartment offers easy access to local amenities and attractions. The studio is designed with a modern aesthetic, featuring large windows that provide ample natural light and a balcony for fresh air. The apartment includes essential furnishings such as an air conditioner, kitchen cabinets, a refrigerator, a sofa, a bed, and a wardrobe. Residents will enjoy a vibrant neighborhood with nearby cafes, restaurants, and shops. The property is also conveniently located near public transportation, making commuting a breeze. With a competitive rental price and a range of included amenities, this apartment is perfect for individuals or couples looking for a cozy living space in Hanoi.', '{"Bright living area with balcony access","Culinary creativity hub with modern finishes","Compact, functional living space with modern appliances","Inviting balcony with urban skyline views","Loft-style sleeping area access via ladder"}', '{"Air Conditioning",Refrigerator,Sofa,Bed,Wardrobe,"Washing Machine",Balcony,"Kitchen Cabinets",WiFi}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131050708/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131050708/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/n