	('71011e37-6aa7-439a-8b95-94fed53962a8', 'nt122916556', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/122916556.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Luxury 2 Bedroom Apartment for Rent at Hà Đô Centrosa Garden', '200, 12, Ward 12, District 10, Ho Chi Minh City', '200 12 ward 12 district 10 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 21000000, '21 million/month', '87 m²', 'This luxurious 2-bedroom apartment at Hà Đô Centrosa Garden offers a spacious 87 m² of living space, perfect for those seeking comfort and style in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. The apartment features high-end furnishings and a modern design, ensuring a pleasant living experience. Located in District 10, this property boasts a beautiful view and is well-maintained. The rental price starts at 21 million VND per month, with the possibility of negotiation for interested tenants. The apartment includes two bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it ideal for families or professionals. Residents can enjoy a range of amenities including a swimming pool, gym, BBQ area, and nearby shopping options. Parking is available for both cars and motorbikes, with reasonable monthly fees. Don''t miss out on this opportunity to live in a prestigious location with excellent facilities.', '{"Stylish dining area with vibrant wall art","Bright and inviting open-plan living space","Stylish dining setup with decorative shelving","Warm and inviting living area for social gatherings","Bright balcony with stunning city views"}', '{"Swimming Pool",Gym,"BBQ Area",Parking,"Children''s Playground","Nearby Shopping","24/7 Security"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt122916556/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt122916556/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt122916556/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supaba