	('b90f1464-7c89-49e3-88a8-3f8f28389ee7', 'nt131247699', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-3-tp-ho-chi-minh/131247699.htm', 'Charming Full-Furnished 2-Bedroom Retreat in the Heart of Quận 3', 'Hẻm 611 Điện Biên Phủ, Phường 1, Quận 3, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'hm 611 in bin ph phng 1 qun 3 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 7800000, '7,8 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Step into a charming sanctuary in the bustling heart of Quận 3, where modern comfort meets inviting warmth. This full-furnished 2-bedroom apartment offers an expansive layout, perfect for both relaxation and productivity. Large windows flood the space with natural light, creating a bright and airy atmosphere that enhances the vibrant decor. The cozy living area invites you to unwind after a long day, while the well-equipped kitchen beckons for culinary adventures. Each bedroom is a private retreat, designed for restful nights and rejuvenating mornings. Enjoy the convenience of a clean, modern bathroom and a dedicated cooking space that makes meal prep a breeze. With its strategic location, you can easily explore nearby markets, cafes, and parks, making this apartment not just a home, but a lifestyle. Whether you''re hosting friends or enjoying quiet evenings, this space is designed for your everyday rituals.', '{"Sleek modern bathroom with stylish fixtures","Bright natural light fills the cozy retreat","Functional minimalist design for effortless living","Airy atmosphere with abundant natural light","Efficient kitchen with modern cabinetry and appliances"}', '{"Air Conditioning",WiFi,"Private Bathroom",Kitchen,Security,Shower,Toilet,Sink,Mirror,"Wall Tiles","Modern Shower","Stylish Sink",Bed,"Large Windows",Wardrobe,"Side Table","Wood Flooring",Refrigerator,"Kitchen Sink","Kitchen Cabinets",Washer,Countertop,"Kitchen Appliances","In-unit Laundry"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131247699/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.sup