 cozy retreat features large windows that invite bright natural light, creating an uplifting atmosphere. The blue accent wall adds a vibrant touch, while the wooden bed frame and simple mattress enhance the minimalist aesthetic. The air conditioning unit ensures comfort, making this space ideal for relaxation or quiet reading. The layout encourages a sense of openness, perfect for unwinding after a busy day. The combination of colors and natural light contributes to a serene and inviting environment.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Large Windows"], "suggested_activities": ["Relaxing", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Wardrobe", "Side Table", "Wood Flooring"], "image_index": 2, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 5, "modern": 6, "elegant": 3, "spacious": 4, "luxurious": 2, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 6}, "image_highlight": "Functional minimalist design for effortless living", "detailed_analysis": "This room features a minimalist design that promotes a sense of effortless living. The wood flooring adds warmth, while the blue accent wall injects a pop of color, creating an inviting atmosphere. The air conditioning unit ensures comfort year-round. The open layout allows for flexible use, whether for studying or relaxing. The wardrobe provides essential storage without overwhelming the space. Overall, it fosters a tranquil environment ideal for personal reflection or focused work.", "suggested_amenities": ["Wardrobe", "Air Conditioning"], "suggested_activities": ["Studying", "Relaxing"]}, {"amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Wardrobe", "Bed", "Large Windows"], "image_index": 3, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 6, "urban": 5, "modern": 3, "elegant": 2, "spacious": 4, "luxurious": 2, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 7}, "image_highlight": "Airy atmosphere with abundant natural light", "detailed_analysis": "This room exudes a sense of tranquility with its abundant natural light filtering through large windows, creating an inviting atmosphere. The minimalist design features a simple bed and a wardrobe, promoting a clutter-free environment ideal for relaxation or focus. The air conditioning unit enhances comfort, ensuring a pleasant climate year-round. The light color palette and clean lines contribute to a serene ambiance, making this space perfect for unwinding or engaging in quiet activities. Overall, it offers a refreshing retreat in a bustling urban setting.", "suggested_amenities": ["Air Conditioning", "Wardrobe"], "suggested_activities": ["Meditation", "Reading"]}, {"amenities": ["Refrigerator", "Kitchen Sink", "Kitchen Cabinets", "Washer", "Countertop"], "image_index": 4, "vibe_scores": {"cozy": 5, "urban": 6, "modern": 7, "elegant": 5, "spacious": 5, "luxurious": 4, "minimalist": 8, "natural_light": 3}, "image_highlight": "Efficient kitchen with modern cabinetry and appliances", "detailed_analysis": "This kitchen space embodies efficiency and modern design with its sleek cabinetry and functional layout. The combination of warm wood tones and vibrant blue accents creates a welcoming atmosphere. The compact yet well-equipped kitchen features a refrigerator, a practical kitchen sink, and ample storage. Perfect for culinary enthusiasts, it encourages creativity while maintaining a clutter-free environment. The inclusion of a washer enhances convenience for daily chores, making this space both practical and stylish, ideal for urban living.", "suggested_amenities": ["Kitchen Appliances", "In-unit Laundry"], "suggested_activities": ["Cooking", "Laundry"]}]}', '2026-04-10 17:02:35.588+00', '2026-06-24 15:31:44.469+00', '2026-06-23 03:00:10.659+00', true, '2026-04-10 17:02:35.714501+00', '2026-06-23 03:00:10.634905+00', NULL, NULL, '2 Bedrooms', 0, 'alive', NULL, NULL, 0, 'pending', false, NULL),
	('03f37939-a2c6-4784-b70c-6206348fff4e', 'nt130997616', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-binh-thanh-tp-ho-chi-minh/130997616.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'FOR RENT: Fully Furnished Mini Apartment, Super Airy in Binh Thanh Center', 'Đường Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh, Phường 25, Quận Bình Thạnh, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 'ng x vit ngh tnh phng 25 qun bnh thnh tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 5000000, '5 triệu/tháng', '35 m²', 'Discover this charming and super airy mini apartment available for rent, fully furnished and ideally located in the heart of Binh Thanh District. This cozy 35 m² apartment features a spacious high mezzanine and large glass windows, ensuring abundant natural light throughout the day. It comes complete with all necessary furniture, offering a comfortable and convenient living experience from day one. The building provides essential amenities including a basement parking area, an elevator, and a full fire protection system, ensuring safety and ease of living. Its central location offers excellent connectivity, making it easy to commute to neighboring districts such as District 1, District 2, Phu Nhuan, Thu Duc, and Go Vap. Residents will also benefit from its proximity to local markets, supermarkets, and major universities like Hutech, VLU, and Hong Bang. This apartment is perfect for individuals or couples seeking a well-equipped and strategically located home in Ho Chi Minh City.', '{"Lofted sleeping area with stylish staircase","Premium living space feature","Natural light-filled living space with stylish accents","Efficient laundry corner with modern appliances","Premium living space feature"}', '{"High mezzanine","Full glass windows (natural light)","Fully furnished","Basement parking",Elevator,"Fire protection system (PCCC)","Close to markets","Close to supermarkets","Close to universities (Hutech, VLU, Hong Bang)","Lofted sleeping area","Large windows",Stairs,"Kitchen appliances","Storage shelves",Washer,"Air Conditioning","Natu