	('c052797a-3c4a-45e7-b606-6c410016b11f', 'nt106668316', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-10-tp-ho-chi-minh/106668316.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'LUXURY APARTMENT AT HA DO CENTROSA - 1BR, 2BR, 3BR AVAILABLE NOW, STARTING FROM 17 MILLION VND', 'Số 200, 12, Phường 12, Quận 10, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', 's 200 12 phng 12 qun 10 tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 18000000, '18 triệu/tháng', '61 m²', 'Discover luxury living at Hà Đô Centrosa Garden, located at 200 3/2 Street, Ward 12, District 10. This prestigious project offers a range of apartment types to suit your needs, from cozy 1-bedroom units to spacious 3-bedroom residences with additional multi-functional rooms. Each apartment boasts high-end interiors, ensuring a comfortable and stylish living experience.

Available units include:
- 1-bedroom apartments (54m² - 61m²) starting from 18 million VND/month.
- 2-bedroom apartments (79m² - 87m²) starting from 22 million VND/month.
- 2-bedroom + 1 multi-functional room apartments (107m²) from 23-25 million VND/month.
- 3-bedroom apartments (123m²) starting from 30 million VND/month.
- 3-bedroom + 1 multi-functional room apartments (138m²) starting from 37 million VND/month.

Residents will enjoy an array of premium amenities, including a shopping center, Finelife supermarket, restaurants, cafes, 24/7 convenience stores, gym, and spa. The complex features a stunning infinity pool on the 5th floor with a BBQ area, a gym and yoga room, karaoke room, sauna, and a reading library. There are also 21 gardens, including 8 hanging gardens, and a unique ''cloud garden'' on the 30th floor offering breathtaking views of Bitexco and Landmark 81, overlooking the entire District 10. Ample underground parking is available, along with a basketball court and playgrounds for both adults and children. Contact Ms. Dung for a viewing.', '{"Sleek marble countertop with integrated lighting","Elegant built-in shelving with ambient lighting","Elegant built-in shelving with accent lighting","Sleek marble countertop with integrated LED lighting","Elegant built-in storage with ambient lighting"}', '{"Shopping Center","Supermarket (Finelife)",Restaurants,Cafes,"24/7 Convenience Stores",Gym,Spa,"Infinity Pool","BBQ Area","Yoga Room","Karaoke Room",Sauna,"Reading Library","Community Room","Gardens (21 total, 8 hanging gardens)","Cloud Garden (30th floor with city views)","Underground Parking","Basketball Court","Children''s Playground","Adult Playground","Luxury Interior"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/4.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt106668316/5.jpg,https://