	('d486b10c-527c-4be3-b241-996dd39e44dc', 'nt119985092', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-go-vap-tp-ho-chi-minh/119985092.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', 'Apartment for rent 62 m2, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, fully furnished high-class Dream Home', '135/533, Lê Đức Thọ, Phường 13, Quận Gò Vấp, Tp Hồ Chí Minh', '135533 l c th phng 13 qun g vp tp h ch minh', 'ho_chi_minh', 9500000, '9,5 triệu/tháng', '62 m²', 'Discover this exquisite 62 m² apartment for rent in the Dream Home Residence, Quận Gò Vấp, Tp Hồ Chí Minh. This fully furnished unit boasts 2 comfortable bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms, along with a spacious living room, a well-equipped kitchen, and a convenient loggia for laundry. The apartment comes with high-end furnishings as shown in the pictures, including a TV, refrigerator, washing machine, dining table, sofa, two beds with mattresses, a wardrobe, two air conditioners, and a water heater. The bathrooms are fitted with American standard fixtures, including a lavabo, shower, toilet, and a standing shower with tempered glass.

Security is paramount with a comprehensive smart card system for video calls and elevator access. The apartment is available for move-in from October 7, 2024. Dream Home Residence offers unparalleled advantages in Gò Vấp, including a prime location near the intersection of Lê Đức Thọ and Lê Văn Thọ. Residents can enjoy a wide array of amenities such as a kindergarten, park, swimming pool, commercial center, gym, and spa. The first and second floors feature cafes, and there''s a BBQ area on the rooftop. With its intelligent and sophisticated design, all Dream Home Residence apartments are corner units, benefiting from two bright and airy sides, offering 2 to 3 bedrooms complemented by luxurious interiors. The project spans 6,066m² with a construction density of 40%.', '{"Welcoming living space with modern finishes","Premium living space feature","Bright dining area with modern aesthetic appeal","Sleek walk-in shower with modern design","Efficient storage solutions for clutter-free living"}', '{Balcony,"Fully furnished","2 bedrooms","2 bathrooms","1 living room",Kitchen,"Loggia for laundry",TV,Refrigerator,"Washing machine","Dining table",Sofa,"2 beds",Mattresses,"1 wardrobe","2 air conditioners","Water heater",Lavabo,Shower,Toilet,"Standing shower with tempered glass","Smart card system","Video call system","Elevator access",Kindergarten,Park,"Swimming pool","Commercial center",Gym,Spa,Cafe,"Rooftop BBQ area"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt119985092/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt119985092/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt119985092/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt119985092/3.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-n