	('bc0fb797-86d3-443d-809c-ea28b0d12db8', 'nt131464880', 'nhatot', 'https://www.nhatot.com/thue-can-ho-chung-cu-quan-1-tp-ho-chi-minh/131464880.htm#px=sr-stickyad-[po-1][pl-top]', '[OWNER] FOR RENT 1 + 1 APARTMENT IN DISTRICT 1 GRAND MARINA SAIGON', '2 Ton Duc Thang, Ben Nghe Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City', '2 ton duc thang ben nghe ward district 1 ho chi minh city', 'ho_chi_minh', 60000000, '60 million/month', '69 m²', 'This stunning 1 + 1 apartment located in the prestigious Grand Marina Saigon offers a luxurious living experience in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. Situated on the 2nd floor, this corner unit features a spacious layout of 69 m², designed for comfort and style. The apartment comes fully furnished with high-end furniture, allowing you to move in with just your suitcase. Enjoy breathtaking views and an abundance of natural light thanks to its east-facing windows. The property boasts premium amenities including a infinity pool, gym, and concierge services provided by Marriott. Located near the Ba Son Metro station, it offers convenient access to the city’s best attractions. The rental price is negotiable at 60 million VND per month. Don''t miss out on this exceptional opportunity to live in one of the most sought-after locations in the city.', '{"Bright and airy urban living space","Dedicated workspace with inspiring urban views","Bright urban living space with stunning views","Premium living space feature","Premium living space feature"}', '{"Full Furnishings","Infinity Pool",Gym,"Concierge Service","Metro Access"}', '{https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131464880/0.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131464880/1.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-images/nhatot-nt131464880/2.jpg,https://gbgrwjdmytaksrztcyzs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/external-property-imag